      "source_text": "Take c_{0}\\leq 1/16 . Then \\gamma_{\\rm gap}\\leq 2\\sqrt{\\alpha\\eta}\\leq 1/2 , and consequently \\Lambda_{\\rho}\\geq\\log 2 . We compare the actual update with the idealized operator analyzed above. Let g\\coloneqq\\mathsf{K}_{\\rm id}f , g_{\\mathsf{P}}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{P}g , and g_{\\mathsf{V}}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}^{*}\\mathsf{P}^{\\perp}g . By the definitions of \\mathsf{K} and \\mathsf{K}_{\\rm id} ,"
