      "source_text": "Both r and r_{\\rho} belong to \\mathfrak{H}_{\\mathsf{P},0} . In r_{\\rho} , the first term comes from refreshment, while the second measures the departure of the half turn from -I_{\\mathfrak{H}_{\\perp}} . Consequently,"
