      "raw_sha256": "36cc0c846c8e0f2ab2d0078b018e0fb87f8ef11b20b1b234db9f3a1d05314bc7",
      "lf_sha256": "36cc0c846c8e0f2ab2d0078b018e0fb87f8ef11b20b1b234db9f3a1d05314bc7",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\hskip 20.00003pt=\\bigl\\langle g_{\\mathsf{P}},\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}r_{\\rho}\\bigr\\rangle+\\bigl\\langle g_{\\mathsf{V}},\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}r_{\\rho}\\bigr\\rangle+\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\bigl(\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}r_{\\rho}\\|^{2}-\\|\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}r_{\\rho}\\|^{2}\\bigr)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-912815-915118",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 912815,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 915118,
      "raw_sha256": "c32a1bc7d50d70a32f618308482656f07b69b4657f31d7a112e189e17bab58fa",
      "lf_sha256": "c32a1bc7d50d70a32f618308482656f07b69b4657f31d7a112e189e17bab58fa",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\hskip 20.00003pt\\hskip 20.00003pt+{}\\bigl\\langle\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}g_{\\mathsf{P}},\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}r_{\\rho}\\bigr\\rangle-\\bigl\\langle\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}r_{\\rho},g_{\\mathsf{V}}\\bigr\\rangle+\\|\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}r_{\\rho}\\|^{2}"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-915147-918198",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 915147,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 918198,
      "raw_sha256": "cf65b86e7dfd2b70e58de0c6b61a8177dbb62b65a5b138126ff960348c549f7b",
      "lf_sha256": "cf65b86e7dfd2b70e58de0c6b61a8177dbb62b65a5b138126ff960348c549f7b",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\hskip 20.00003pt=\\bigl\\langle g_{\\mathsf{P}},\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}r_{\\rho}\\bigr\\rangle+\\bigl\\langle\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}g_{\\mathsf{P}},\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}r_{\\rho}\\bigr\\rangle+\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\bigl(\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}r_{\\rho}\\|^{2}+\\|\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}r_{\\rho}\\|^{2}\\bigr)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p8.6",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 918216,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 920055,
      "raw_sha256": "d84ea03ae5db445eb455db68646e6d8bf56e925d2687ff02b42f70ffa77448c5",
      "lf_sha256": "d84ea03ae5db445eb455db68646e6d8bf56e925d2687ff02b42f70ffa77448c5",
      "source_text": "In the last equality, the two terms containing g_{\\mathsf{V}} cancel. For the terms linear in g_{\\mathsf{P}} , the commutation of \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} with \\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}} and the identity \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{2}+\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{2}=I give"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-920153-922058",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 920153,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 922058,
      "raw_sha256": "1e031f8f431d4df48576869ec4b048cca1bd440954899948c074ccf04984f99b",
      "lf_sha256": "1e031f8f431d4df48576869ec4b048cca1bd440954899948c074ccf04984f99b",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\bigl\\langle g_{\\mathsf{P}},\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}r_{\\rho}\\bigr\\rangle+\\bigl\\langle\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}g_{\\mathsf{P}},\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}r_{\\rho}\\bigr\\rangle"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-922087-924301",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 922087,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 924301,
      "raw_sha256": "9b01fbca9b41f57d91284664e2b04d17f20bc7aac5d2d5989f3e6ce09b179c16",
      "lf_sha256": "9b01fbca9b41f57d91284664e2b04d17f20bc7aac5d2d5989f3e6ce09b179c16",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\hskip 20.00003pt=\\bigl\\langle g_{\\mathsf{P}},(\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}+\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{2})r_{\\rho}\\bigr\\rangle=\\bigl\\langle g_{\\mathsf{P}},\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}r_{\\rho}\\bigr\\rangle\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p8.7",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 924319,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 924454,
      "raw_sha256": "85cc360f6107cda5292856f51f8efec33aef8c257110ac8b279d0e50dae410b6",
      "lf_sha256": "85cc360f6107cda5292856f51f8efec33aef8c257110ac8b279d0e50dae410b6",
      "source_text": "The same identity reduces the quadratic terms to"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.Ex34",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 924455,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 926219,
      "raw_sha256": "a184e18cc41e07c1305bcbd1c2bbc92b4803ea5c6675a1fda8ae17d4810a9082",
      "lf_sha256": "a184e18cc41e07c1305bcbd1c2bbc92b4803ea5c6675a1fda8ae17d4810a9082",
      "source_text": "\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\bigl(\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}r_{\\rho}\\|^{2}+\\|\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}r_{\\rho}\\|^{2}\\bigr)=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\|r_{\\rho}\\|^{2}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-924519-926202",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 924519,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 926202,
      "raw_sha256": "2f82b57dfbc12f7876dbc8f5fab4d9ce9f1fd235a3852059b141f48d3bd6516b",
      "lf_sha256": "2f82b57dfbc12f7876dbc8f5fab4d9ce9f1fd235a3852059b141f48d3bd6516b",
      "source_text": "\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\bigl(\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}r_{\\rho}\\|^{2}+\\|\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}r_{\\rho}\\|^{2}\\bigr)=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\|r_{\\rho}\\|^{2}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p8.8",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 926220,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 926675,
      "raw_sha256": "5efc184154e82aec9fb6458d9be8e67f757e71f16e547644fad8416436f8300c",
      "lf_sha256": "5efc184154e82aec9fb6458d9be8e67f757e71f16e547644fad8416436f8300c",
      "source_text": "Consequently, combined with ( B.21 ),"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-926773-928222",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 926773,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 928222,
      "raw_sha256": "ea6152be39a3c5e28220bb8eaf1506df65c32bec06675697560ca03ef71185c3",
      "lf_sha256": "ea6152be39a3c5e28220bb8eaf1506df65c32bec06675697560ca03ef71185c3",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\mathscr{C}\\bigl((\\mathsf{K}f)_{\\mathsf{P}},(\\mathsf{K}f)_{\\mathsf{V}}\\bigr)-\\mathscr{C}(f_{\\mathsf{P}},f_{\\mathsf{V}})"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-928251-930705",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 928251,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 930705,
      "raw_sha256": "52340c781e42082e3413268ce032fa650790fd73f0ea389633b86bb8b4cc60ae",
      "lf_sha256": "52340c781e42082e3413268ce032fa650790fd73f0ea389633b86bb8b4cc60ae",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\hskip 10.00002pt=\\bigl[\\mathscr{C}\\bigl((\\mathsf{K}f)_{\\mathsf{P}},(\\mathsf{K}f)_{\\mathsf{V}}\\bigr)-\\mathscr{C}(g_{\\mathsf{P}},g_{\\mathsf{V}})\\bigr]+\\bigl[\\mathscr{C}(g_{\\mathsf{P}},g_{\\mathsf{V}})-\\mathscr{C}(f_{\\mathsf{P}},f_{\\mathsf{V}})\\bigr]"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-930733-932806",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 930733,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 932806,
      "raw_sha256": "704aafc7cf7dd05841e4825bad04049bab182c48bd2f7ab5386f9bc6e25f05f5",
      "lf_sha256": "704aafc7cf7dd05841e4825bad04049bab182c48bd2f7ab5386f9bc6e25f05f5",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\hskip 10.00002pt=-\\|f_{\\mathsf{P}}\\|^{2}+\\|f_{\\mathsf{V}}\\|^{2}+\\bigl\\langle g_{\\mathsf{P}},\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}r_{\\rho}\\bigr\\rangle+\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\|r_{\\rho}\\|^{2}\\,. (B.28)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p8.9",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 932824,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 933167,
      "raw_sha256": "72e6996b850dd7ac045e6e28929884854fe72b472964a016507c37006ecd3080",
      "lf_sha256": "72e6996b850dd7ac045e6e28929884854fe72b472964a016507c37006ecd3080",
      "source_text": "Thus, it remains to estimate r_{\\rho} . Let"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.Ex37",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 933168,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 934187,
      "raw_sha256": "a9cedf0195aa9a9107b103e3e9fcdd44f809f6e6883705c85ae85fdaca3c3c9f",
      "lf_sha256": "a9cedf0195aa9a9107b103e3e9fcdd44f809f6e6883705c85ae85fdaca3c3c9f",
      "source_text": "\\mathsf{L}\\coloneqq(I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp})\\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-933232-934170",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 933232,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 934170,
      "raw_sha256": "c4e2e03b8e9015f27b20da73e0415512a87350bf7b1de474d207deaa783a06bb",
      "lf_sha256": "c4e2e03b8e9015f27b20da73e0415512a87350bf7b1de474d207deaa783a06bb",
      "source_text": "\\mathsf{L}\\coloneqq(I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp})\\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p8.10",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 934188,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 935527,
      "raw_sha256": "310ba15769ba566491099103aa63ff7a8b45cbcda0c88b4991eb89264eff02ea",
      "lf_sha256": "310ba15769ba566491099103aa63ff7a8b45cbcda0c88b4991eb89264eff02ea",
      "source_text": "Since r=\\mathsf{L}^{*}f_{\\perp} , applying ( B.17 ) to \\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}v and then taking adjoints gives"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-935624-938346",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 935624,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 938346,
      "raw_sha256": "0e1e813cb8462ec1275b1f65b01b4f84388ba66f2287e47f9c4e66404bd70296",
      "lf_sha256": "0e1e813cb8462ec1275b1f65b01b4f84388ba66f2287e47f9c4e66404bd70296",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}r\\|^{2}=\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}\\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}^{*}(I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp})f_{\\perp}\\|^{2} \\displaystyle\\leq C\\log(1/\\gamma_{\\rm gap})\\,\\|f_{\\perp}\\|^{2}\\,. (B.29)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p8.11",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 938364,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 939459,
      "raw_sha256": "6e1183658e7f05410e3d11267b5dd41926b71b29b6b30474444ed29c3cdd9c79",
      "lf_sha256": "6e1183658e7f05410e3d11267b5dd41926b71b29b6b30474444ed29c3cdd9c79",
      "source_text": "Together with \\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}\\succeq\\gamma_{\\rm gap}I and \\|f_{\\mathsf{V}}\\|\\leq\\|f_{\\perp}\\| , this gives"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-939556-942516",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 939556,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 942516,
      "raw_sha256": "67d57382619b3e3d9b66eff5b127d57aae4b41efa7c3e5932db02b298800267f",
      "lf_sha256": "67d57382619b3e3d9b66eff5b127d57aae4b41efa7c3e5932db02b298800267f",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}r_{\\rho}\\|^{2} \\displaystyle\\leq 2\\rho^{2}\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}f_{\\mathsf{V}}\\|^{2}+2(1-\\rho)^{2}\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}r\\|^{2}\\leq C\\Lambda_{\\rho}\\,\\|f_{\\perp}\\|^{2}\\,. (B.30)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p8.12",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 942534,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 944393,
      "raw_sha256": "6a0c78a80fc00f7c4002ad9620c7c0dd0a77b911c36c7f5e15218d2e8d48d084",
      "lf_sha256": "6a0c78a80fc00f7c4002ad9620c7c0dd0a77b911c36c7f5e15218d2e8d48d084",
      "source_text": "Moreover, since \\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}^{*} and \\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp} are contractions, \\|r_{\\rho}\\|\\leq\\rho\\,\\|f_{\\mathsf{V}}\\|+(1-\\rho)\\,\\|r\\|\\leq 2\\,\\|f_{\\perp}\\| ."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p9.2",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 944439,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 946329,
      "raw_sha256": "2b4f69450eabe441fab7f55b4cfa64a83262789b3df3cf656837d689f974bb96",
      "lf_sha256": "2b4f69450eabe441fab7f55b4cfa64a83262789b3df3cf656837d689f974bb96",
      "source_text": "The rotation formula for \\mathsf{K}_{\\rm id} gives \\|g_{\\mathsf{P}}\\|^{2}\\leq\\|g_{\\mathsf{P}}\\|^{2}+\\|g_{\\mathsf{V}}\\|^{2}=\\|f_{\\mathsf{P}}\\|^{2}+\\|f_{\\mathsf{V}}\\|^{2} . Hence, Young’s inequality and ( B.30 ) give"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-946427-948732",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 946427,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 948732,
      "raw_sha256": "7aec9528fb05d02bf9d8d04fee629ac42958a5e4124d3d9d7c084a3f3d627e74",
      "lf_sha256": "7aec9528fb05d02bf9d8d04fee629ac42958a5e4124d3d9d7c084a3f3d627e74",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\bigl|\\bigl\\langle g_{\\mathsf{P}},\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}r_{\\rho}\\bigr\\rangle\\bigr| \\displaystyle\\leq\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\|g_{\\mathsf{P}}\\|^{2}+C\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}r_{\\rho}\\|^{2}"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-948761-950356",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 948761,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 950356,
      "raw_sha256": "5706e145b0d6d93b31cc919167ec7410c6f6f364d176349352ff160ca8a3111e",
      "lf_sha256": "5706e145b0d6d93b31cc919167ec7410c6f6f364d176349352ff160ca8a3111e",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\leq\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\|f_{\\mathsf{P}}\\|^{2}+\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\|f_{\\mathsf{V}}\\|^{2}+C\\Lambda_{\\rho}\\,\\|f_{\\perp}\\|^{2}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p9.3",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 950374,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 951709,
      "raw_sha256": "a334caae330612e3fb588ce7d8bb46116086f8c3e9600cda4abaaa38310192ae",
      "lf_sha256": "a334caae330612e3fb588ce7d8bb46116086f8c3e9600cda4abaaa38310192ae",
      "source_text": "Inserting these estimates into ( B.28 ), and using \\|f_{\\mathsf{V}}\\|\\leq\\|f_{\\perp}\\| and \\Lambda_{\\rho}\\geq\\log 2 , gives"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.E31X",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 951778,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 954208,
      "raw_sha256": "07fc4baa39ed48be78a1cbb56f73e9cf4abfe127c9bc83021186d607557e2e72",
      "lf_sha256": "07fc4baa39ed48be78a1cbb56f73e9cf4abfe127c9bc83021186d607557e2e72",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\mathscr{C}\\bigl((\\mathsf{K}f)_{\\mathsf{P}},(\\mathsf{K}f)_{\\mathsf{V}}\\bigr)-\\mathscr{C}(f_{\\mathsf{P}},f_{\\mathsf{V}})\\leq-\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\|f_{\\mathsf{P}}\\|^{2}+C\\Lambda_{\\rho}\\,\\|f_{\\perp}\\|^{2}\\,. (B.31)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p10.1",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 954272,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 955069,
      "raw_sha256": "280cc1967b430aa7a01368caea1613e384b502818d7caa4b2d33292aee20e2cf",
      "lf_sha256": "280cc1967b430aa7a01368caea1613e384b502818d7caa4b2d33292aee20e2cf",
      "source_text": "Finally, ( B.18 ) and ( B.31 ) give"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-955167-957968",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 955167,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 957968,
      "raw_sha256": "f3bac25b2cf64c3ab11f94734f3fef2374192e81550bd917ea4dac9fc60b944d",
      "lf_sha256": "f3bac25b2cf64c3ab11f94734f3fef2374192e81550bd917ea4dac9fc60b944d",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\mathscr{L}_{\\omega}(\\mathsf{K}f)-\\mathscr{L}_{\\omega}(f) \\displaystyle\\leq-\\rho\\,\\|f_{\\perp}\\|^{2}+\\frac{c_{\\rm hyp}\\rho}{\\Lambda_{\\rho}}\\,\\Bigl(-\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\|f_{\\mathsf{P}}\\|^{2}+C\\Lambda_{\\rho}\\,\\|f_{\\perp}\\|^{2}\\Bigr)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-957997-959689",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 957997,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 959689,
      "raw_sha256": "e8cdb5cea611507f4f3fa54a1b3800a6e4bcd011aa4f2f240212a5252e1e9f87",
      "lf_sha256": "e8cdb5cea611507f4f3fa54a1b3800a6e4bcd011aa4f2f240212a5252e1e9f87",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle=-\\frac{c_{\\rm hyp}\\rho}{2\\Lambda_{\\rho}}\\,\\|f_{\\mathsf{P}}\\|^{2}-(1-Cc_{\\rm hyp})\\,\\rho\\,\\|f_{\\perp}\\|^{2}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p10.2",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 959707,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 960899,
      "raw_sha256": "cbe573de5fbb8fe6c8ae0f32ff2f4f144b068afa47655b89ea6a2283a3c772cc",
      "lf_sha256": "cbe573de5fbb8fe6c8ae0f32ff2f4f144b068afa47655b89ea6a2283a3c772cc",
      "source_text": "Choose c_{\\rm hyp}\\leq 1 sufficiently small so that Cc_{\\rm hyp}\\leq 1/2 . Since \\Lambda_{\\rho}\\geq\\log 2 , the last display is then bounded above by"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.Ex42",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 960900,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 962617,
      "raw_sha256": "69227a1b62693f1cfa1f3d5a439add1c45960a0f6526a21115d0aa70cd1e646f",
      "lf_sha256": "69227a1b62693f1cfa1f3d5a439add1c45960a0f6526a21115d0aa70cd1e646f",
      "source_text": "-\\frac{c\\rho}{\\Lambda_{\\rho}}\\,\\bigl(\\|f_{\\mathsf{P}}\\|^{2}+\\|f_{\\perp}\\|^{2}\\bigr)=-\\frac{c\\rho}{\\Lambda_{\\rho}}\\,\\|f\\|^{2}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-960964-962600",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 960964,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 962600,
      "raw_sha256": "a06833ffd69d69bf61d39c19003ee1c60826bd7bc05486a0fefdeda341b3f7e8",
      "lf_sha256": "a06833ffd69d69bf61d39c19003ee1c60826bd7bc05486a0fefdeda341b3f7e8",
      "source_text": "-\\frac{c\\rho}{\\Lambda_{\\rho}}\\,\\bigl(\\|f_{\\mathsf{P}}\\|^{2}+\\|f_{\\perp}\\|^{2}\\bigr)=-\\frac{c\\rho}{\\Lambda_{\\rho}}\\,\\|f\\|^{2}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p10.3",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 962618,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 963883,
      "raw_sha256": "ad54b1c8670c91ee092263fcb178ff5ea35f32f206d2372f8327824557db9dca",
      "lf_sha256": "ad54b1c8670c91ee092263fcb178ff5ea35f32f206d2372f8327824557db9dca",
      "source_text": "It remains to compare the last norm with the Lyapunov function. The elementary inequality x/(a+x^{2})\\leq 1/(2\\sqrt{a}) , for a>0 and x\\geq 0 , gives"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.Ex43",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 963884,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 965998,
      "raw_sha256": "0b78e6957b0cd31a9dd0292deb12a6a4acc72faa237986ad67e1b1f4c7d36b8e",
      "lf_sha256": "0b78e6957b0cd31a9dd0292deb12a6a4acc72faa237986ad67e1b1f4c7d36b8e",
      "source_text": "\\frac{\\omega}{\\gamma_{\\rm gap}}=c_{\\rm hyp}\\,\\frac{\\rho/\\gamma_{\\rm gap}}{\\log(1/\\gamma_{\\rm gap})+(\\rho/\\gamma_{\\rm gap})^{2}}\\leq\\frac{c_{\\rm hyp}}{2\\sqrt{\\log(1/\\gamma_{\\rm gap})}}\\leq\\frac{c_{\\rm hyp}}{2\\sqrt{\\log 2}}\\leq 1\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-963948-965981",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 963948,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 965981,
      "raw_sha256": "aefc64ca68fabe7888248f0b0f9652e2a24c5b9c023fc70a7e4ced89b28245a0",
      "lf_sha256": "aefc64ca68fabe7888248f0b0f9652e2a24c5b9c023fc70a7e4ced89b28245a0",
      "source_text": "\\frac{\\omega}{\\gamma_{\\rm gap}}=c_{\\rm hyp}\\,\\frac{\\rho/\\gamma_{\\rm gap}}{\\log(1/\\gamma_{\\rm gap})+(\\rho/\\gamma_{\\rm gap})^{2}}\\leq\\frac{c_{\\rm hyp}}{2\\sqrt{\\log(1/\\gamma_{\\rm gap})}}\\leq\\frac{c_{\\rm hyp}}{2\\sqrt{\\log 2}}\\leq 1\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p10.4",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 965999,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 966853,
      "raw_sha256": "f6a442202b93af64a6b488ceac1f725b8832dc10eed00edb3f5eb7891fccfc10",
      "lf_sha256": "f6a442202b93af64a6b488ceac1f725b8832dc10eed00edb3f5eb7891fccfc10",
      "source_text": "Thus \\omega\\leq\\gamma_{\\rm gap} , and the upper bound in Lemma B.3 gives"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.Ex44",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 966854,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 967863,
      "raw_sha256": "f2c8e1e1b8d04a123cd91af6280f8a3a6a60e8956befd3e8a25f12b42676fbb4",
      "lf_sha256": "f2c8e1e1b8d04a123cd91af6280f8a3a6a60e8956befd3e8a25f12b42676fbb4",
      "source_text": "\\|f\\|^{2}\\geq\\frac{2}{3}\\,\\mathscr{L}_{\\omega}(f)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-966918-967846",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 966918,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 967846,
      "raw_sha256": "acc62ce81c35bb3f6aece707e5e9b7ec9f0254fa1d02feaeb97a1d4214cd206a",
      "lf_sha256": "acc62ce81c35bb3f6aece707e5e9b7ec9f0254fa1d02feaeb97a1d4214cd206a",
      "source_text": "\\|f\\|^{2}\\geq\\frac{2}{3}\\,\\mathscr{L}_{\\omega}(f)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p10.5",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 967864,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 967966,
      "raw_sha256": "b7f03cac5a7ac0abacbdb473c57e48720ecf4608ed6003b399b1231a246bd22c",
      "lf_sha256": "b7f03cac5a7ac0abacbdb473c57e48720ecf4608ed6003b399b1231a246bd22c",
      "source_text": "Consequently,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.Ex45",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 967967,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 969599,
      "raw_sha256": "1d99df3746369dc2331e8a700ca0a71bc88b230df489f3ef5c3fdce322e58a51",
      "lf_sha256": "1d99df3746369dc2331e8a700ca0a71bc88b230df489f3ef5c3fdce322e58a51",
      "source_text": "\\mathscr{L}_{\\omega}(\\mathsf{K}f)\\leq\\Bigl(1-\\frac{2c\\rho}{3\\Lambda_{\\rho}}\\Bigr)\\,\\mathscr{L}_{\\omega}(f)\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-968031-969582",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 968031,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 969582,
      "raw_sha256": "b205ce7c0dfaed6d6f010cd7f1f65384c46c4202b9f73f5e4439696e2751478c",
      "lf_sha256": "b205ce7c0dfaed6d6f010cd7f1f65384c46c4202b9f73f5e4439696e2751478c",
      "source_text": "\\mathscr{L}_{\\omega}(\\mathsf{K}f)\\leq\\Bigl(1-\\frac{2c\\rho}{3\\Lambda_{\\rho}}\\Bigr)\\,\\mathscr{L}_{\\omega}(f)\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p10.6",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 969600,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 970137,
      "raw_sha256": "5fcbf8691f1ab8300701c0e203148463897872613a033c33ca34c23432fd0809",
      "lf_sha256": "5fcbf8691f1ab8300701c0e203148463897872613a033c33ca34c23432fd0809",
      "source_text": "which is ( B.26 ) after renaming the universal constant. ∎"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p11.1",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 970191,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 971669,
      "raw_sha256": "c9ce2bbb717084c4eab15b4ba0ab57eafec62cc21a5ae5b551ee484a7fac3c38",
      "lf_sha256": "c9ce2bbb717084c4eab15b4ba0ab57eafec62cc21a5ae5b551ee484a7fac3c38",
      "source_text": "Combining Lemmas B.3 and B.4 , we can now prove the L^{2} contraction in Theorem 3.5 ."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.4",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "proof-container",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 971677,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1000176,
      "raw_sha256": "2ca3f3ceb374f11c3d5b5445c27fae6fd807dde7bd9afdd796dc989ecec17051",
      "lf_sha256": "2ca3f3ceb374f11c3d5b5445c27fae6fd807dde7bd9afdd796dc989ecec17051",
      "source_text": "Proof of Theorem 3.5 . We first turn the one-step Lyapunov decay into a fixed L^{2} contraction over a block of N steps, and then apply this contraction to densities. Take c_{0} from Lemma B.4 and choose a fixed universal \\rho_{\\star}\\in(0,1/2] . The one-step estimate requires \\rho\\leq 1/2 . Since \\alpha\\eta\\leq\\beta\\eta\\leq 1 and x\\log(e/x)\\leq 1 for 0<x\\leq 1 , the prescribed refreshment probability satisfies 0<\\rho=\\rho_{\\star}\\sqrt{\\alpha\\eta\\log\\frac{e}{\\alpha\\eta}}\\leq\\rho_{\\star}\\leq\\frac{1}{2}\\,. The decay rate in Lemma B.4 is \\rho/\\Lambda_{\\rho} , so a fixed contraction is obtained by taking N proportional to \\Lambda_{\\rho}/\\rho . We first bound this ratio. Recall that \\gamma_{\\rm gap}\\asymp\\sqrt{\\alpha\\eta} and \\log(1/\\gamma_{\\rm gap})\\asymp\\log(e/(\\alpha\\eta)) . Hence \\Bigl(\\frac{\\rho}{\\gamma_{\\rm gap}}\\Bigr)^{2}\\leq C\\log(1/\\gamma_{\\rm gap})\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\rho\\geq c\\gamma_{\\rm gap}\\sqrt{\\log(1/\\gamma_{\\rm gap})}\\,. It follows from the definition of \\Lambda_{\\rho} that \\displaystyle\\frac{\\Lambda_{\\rho}}{\\rho} \\displaystyle\\leq C\\,\\frac{\\sqrt{\\log(1/\\gamma_{\\rm gap})}}{\\gamma_{\\rm gap}}\\leq\\frac{C}{\\sqrt{\\alpha\\eta}}\\sqrt{\\log\\frac{e}{\\alpha\\eta}}\\,. Choose a sufficiently large universal constant C_{1} and consider N\\geq C_{1}\\,\\frac{\\Lambda_{\\rho}}{\\rho}\\,. (B.32) For f\\in L_{0}^{2}(\\pi_{\\eta}) , take \\omega as in ( B.25 ). Iterating ( B.26 ) over this block gives \\mathscr{L}_{\\omega}(\\mathsf{K}^{N}f)\\leq\\Bigl(1-\\frac{c\\rho}{\\Lambda_{\\rho}}\\Bigr)^{N}\\,\\mathscr{L}_{\\omega}(f)\\,. Applying the lower bound in ( B.22 ) to \\mathsf{K}^{N}f and the upper bound to f , we obtain \\displaystyle\\|\\mathsf{K}^{N}f\\|^{2} \\displaystyle\\leq 2\\mathscr{L}_{\\omega}(\\mathsf{K}^{N}f)\\leq 2\\,\\Bigl(1-\\frac{c\\rho}{\\Lambda_{\\rho}}\\Bigr)^{N}\\,\\mathscr{L}_{\\omega}(f)\\leq 3\\,\\Bigl(1-\\frac{c\\rho}{\\Lambda_{\\rho}}\\Bigr)^{N}\\,\\|f\\|^{2}\\leq 3e^{-cC_{1}}\\,\\|f\\|^{2}\\,. The last step uses 1-x\\leq e^{-x} and N\\geq C_{1}\\Lambda_{\\rho}/\\rho . Taking C_{1} sufficiently large makes 3e^{-cC_{1}}\\leq e^{-1} . Thus, \\|\\mathsf{K}^{N}f\\|^{2}\\leq e^{-1}\\,\\|f\\|^{2}\\,. (B.33) Iterating by blocks, the L^{2} contraction ( B.33 ) is equivalently, by ( D.5 ) and the adjoint remark following it, the \\chi^{2} -estimate \\chi^{2}\\bigl(\\nu_{0}\\mathcal{K}^{JN}\\|\\pi_{\\eta}\\bigr)\\leq e^{-J}\\chi^{2}(\\nu_{0}\\|\\pi_{\\eta})\\,, which proves ( 3.14 ). The X -marginal of \\pi_{\\eta} is \\mu , and total variation cannot increase under projection. Moreover, Cauchy–Schwarz gives \\operatorname{TV}(P,Q)\\leq\\tfrac{1}{2}\\sqrt{\\chi^{2}(P\\|Q)} , which gives ( 3.15 ). ∎"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p12.1",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 972185,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 972810,
      "raw_sha256": "04afb611ebd989190ed1bfdb5bb86339ee631c16b4c797d8543875cbfe5ba16f",
      "lf_sha256": "04afb611ebd989190ed1bfdb5bb86339ee631c16b4c797d8543875cbfe5ba16f",
      "source_text": "We first turn the one-step Lyapunov decay into a fixed L^{2} contraction over a block of N steps, and then apply this contraction to densities."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p13.1",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 972857,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 975555,
      "raw_sha256": "caa39ea82f0543acd14ec8e776d72d5fa1927532241977649fa29378d0c09f19",
      "lf_sha256": "caa39ea82f0543acd14ec8e776d72d5fa1927532241977649fa29378d0c09f19",
      "source_text": "Take c_{0} from Lemma B.4 and choose a fixed universal \\rho_{\\star}\\in(0,1/2] . The one-step estimate requires \\rho\\leq 1/2 . Since \\alpha\\eta\\leq\\beta\\eta\\leq 1 and x\\log(e/x)\\leq 1 for 0<x\\leq 1 , the prescribed refreshment probability satisfies"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.Ex46",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 975556,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 976778,
      "raw_sha256": "80b6886e985331efb0be71f56ec8d00c449b3f678ed40e017401ba146b68fe72",
      "lf_sha256": "80b6886e985331efb0be71f56ec8d00c449b3f678ed40e017401ba146b68fe72",
      "source_text": "0<\\rho=\\rho_{\\star}\\sqrt{\\alpha\\eta\\log\\frac{e}{\\alpha\\eta}}\\leq\\rho_{\\star}\\leq\\frac{1}{2}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-975620-976761",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 975620,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 976761,
      "raw_sha256": "f1894a4e12ea24c21e30fe9848868f3718770dbdfe3ddaba8ad9b45b9f7a85f1",
      "lf_sha256": "f1894a4e12ea24c21e30fe9848868f3718770dbdfe3ddaba8ad9b45b9f7a85f1",
      "source_text": "0<\\rho=\\rho_{\\star}\\sqrt{\\alpha\\eta\\log\\frac{e}{\\alpha\\eta}}\\leq\\rho_{\\star}\\leq\\frac{1}{2}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p14.1",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 976825,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 979415,
      "raw_sha256": "4917ad3d78078fd265be5244ea2474f419c56d6dc2f10947795a8a196fe1c24d",
      "lf_sha256": "4917ad3d78078fd265be5244ea2474f419c56d6dc2f10947795a8a196fe1c24d",
      "source_text": "The decay rate in Lemma B.4 is \\rho/\\Lambda_{\\rho} , so a fixed contraction is obtained by taking N proportional to \\Lambda_{\\rho}/\\rho . We first bound this ratio. Recall that \\gamma_{\\rm gap}\\asymp\\sqrt{\\alpha\\eta} and \\log(1/\\gamma_{\\rm gap})\\asymp\\log(e/(\\alpha\\eta)) . Hence"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.Ex47",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 979416,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 981102,
      "raw_sha256": "a5f1054dd78c97b13342f9281ebb6a23644a820af70df0a75e144a6c13287b17",
      "lf_sha256": "a5f1054dd78c97b13342f9281ebb6a23644a820af70df0a75e144a6c13287b17",
      "source_text": "\\Bigl(\\frac{\\rho}{\\gamma_{\\rm gap}}\\Bigr)^{2}\\leq C\\log(1/\\gamma_{\\rm gap})\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\rho\\geq c\\gamma_{\\rm gap}\\sqrt{\\log(1/\\gamma_{\\rm gap})}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-979480-981085",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 979480,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 981085,
      "raw_sha256": "7ccc340dc0faf80d9bcf9fa31c2194438f795a3a99a0679bf706aca273a0cfa8",
      "lf_sha256": "7ccc340dc0faf80d9bcf9fa31c2194438f795a3a99a0679bf706aca273a0cfa8",
      "source_text": "\\Bigl(\\frac{\\rho}{\\gamma_{\\rm gap}}\\Bigr)^{2}\\leq C\\log(1/\\gamma_{\\rm gap})\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\rho\\geq c\\gamma_{\\rm gap}\\sqrt{\\log(1/\\gamma_{\\rm gap})}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p14.2",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 981103,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 981487,
      "raw_sha256": "733c1527cab0efd14455319a01c4d039935ae4b65003886882c6574a755ff567",
      "lf_sha256": "733c1527cab0efd14455319a01c4d039935ae4b65003886882c6574a755ff567",
      "source_text": "It follows from the definition of \\Lambda_{\\rho} that"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-981585-983527",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 981585,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 983527,
      "raw_sha256": "9c96048b999a404aa04734800c4b448b3ba4e92685c190e421a4db68b9a82758",
      "lf_sha256": "9c96048b999a404aa04734800c4b448b3ba4e92685c190e421a4db68b9a82758",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\frac{\\Lambda_{\\rho}}{\\rho} \\displaystyle\\leq C\\,\\frac{\\sqrt{\\log(1/\\gamma_{\\rm gap})}}{\\gamma_{\\rm gap}}\\leq\\frac{C}{\\sqrt{\\alpha\\eta}}\\sqrt{\\log\\frac{e}{\\alpha\\eta}}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p14.3",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 983545,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 983909,
      "raw_sha256": "388e917646f3a9d019252e9b04af9413c934f756b4a3abadb9d104e02f5d6998",
      "lf_sha256": "388e917646f3a9d019252e9b04af9413c934f756b4a3abadb9d104e02f5d6998",
      "source_text": "Choose a sufficiently large universal constant C_{1} and consider"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.E32",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 983910,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 984859,
      "raw_sha256": "bb029750f8ddb4b7d879c2fe6d914e2a85c546e472d78054ccd0e0ef9e5f8772",
      "lf_sha256": "bb029750f8ddb4b7d879c2fe6d914e2a85c546e472d78054ccd0e0ef9e5f8772",
      "source_text": "N\\geq C_{1}\\,\\frac{\\Lambda_{\\rho}}{\\rho}\\,. (B.32)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-983973-984842",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 983973,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 984842,
      "raw_sha256": "d4aa403a82d7247595f7f64a0920ac8e50108d180dfd628f45455f4535bef205",
      "lf_sha256": "d4aa403a82d7247595f7f64a0920ac8e50108d180dfd628f45455f4535bef205",
      "source_text": "N\\geq C_{1}\\,\\frac{\\Lambda_{\\rho}}{\\rho}\\,. (B.32)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p14.4",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 984860,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 986449,
      "raw_sha256": "263f28c197fcf8a82b95cc7324873be346bf4f4ae63cd8fbb1eabba3f7dc7f6d",
      "lf_sha256": "263f28c197fcf8a82b95cc7324873be346bf4f4ae63cd8fbb1eabba3f7dc7f6d",
      "source_text": "For f\\in L_{0}^{2}(\\pi_{\\eta}) , take \\omega as in ( B.25 ). Iterating ( B.26 ) over this block gives"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.Ex49",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 986450,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 988027,
      "raw_sha256": "fc8fd0d65d88fdb3d7dcac161e1a9b150b5b1410713ae4620c71d26ccf8bfa93",
      "lf_sha256": "fc8fd0d65d88fdb3d7dcac161e1a9b150b5b1410713ae4620c71d26ccf8bfa93",
      "source_text": "\\mathscr{L}_{\\omega}(\\mathsf{K}^{N}f)\\leq\\Bigl(1-\\frac{c\\rho}{\\Lambda_{\\rho}}\\Bigr)^{N}\\,\\mathscr{L}_{\\omega}(f)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-986514-988010",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 986514,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 988010,
      "raw_sha256": "bcc6dd1f9bc3010c235595488acea56b06ed2cc779dbf28eeefd9310b6b560ec",
      "lf_sha256": "bcc6dd1f9bc3010c235595488acea56b06ed2cc779dbf28eeefd9310b6b560ec",
      "source_text": "\\mathscr{L}_{\\omega}(\\mathsf{K}^{N}f)\\leq\\Bigl(1-\\frac{c\\rho}{\\Lambda_{\\rho}}\\Bigr)^{N}\\,\\mathscr{L}_{\\omega}(f)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p14.5",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 988028,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 989066,
      "raw_sha256": "80feb2e0a42433f6bbf0253666d7446a49de83746eca82a7e3da0a161c742b25",
      "lf_sha256": "80feb2e0a42433f6bbf0253666d7446a49de83746eca82a7e3da0a161c742b25",
      "source_text": "Applying the lower bound in ( B.22 ) to \\mathsf{K}^{N}f and the upper bound to f , we obtain"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-989164-992469",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 989164,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 992469,
      "raw_sha256": "e159c14e6312c87bf8daae55296cd712d81bdcae2af4002c028cd98c0138dc5f",
      "lf_sha256": "e159c14e6312c87bf8daae55296cd712d81bdcae2af4002c028cd98c0138dc5f",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\|\\mathsf{K}^{N}f\\|^{2} \\displaystyle\\leq 2\\mathscr{L}_{\\omega}(\\mathsf{K}^{N}f)\\leq 2\\,\\Bigl(1-\\frac{c\\rho}{\\Lambda_{\\rho}}\\Bigr)^{N}\\,\\mathscr{L}_{\\omega}(f)\\leq 3\\,\\Bigl(1-\\frac{c\\rho}{\\Lambda_{\\rho}}\\Bigr)^{N}\\,\\|f\\|^{2}\\leq 3e^{-cC_{1}}\\,\\|f\\|^{2}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p14.6",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 992487,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 994134,
      "raw_sha256": "bd31227acb617c2c43e0fd67e1783bc7e7b34ad23e4f9e008e3307d03de0f487",
      "lf_sha256": "bd31227acb617c2c43e0fd67e1783bc7e7b34ad23e4f9e008e3307d03de0f487",
      "source_text": "The last step uses 1-x\\leq e^{-x} and N\\geq C_{1}\\Lambda_{\\rho}/\\rho . Taking C_{1} sufficiently large makes 3e^{-cC_{1}}\\leq e^{-1} . Thus,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.E33",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 994135,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 995318,
      "raw_sha256": "3de17c5f9136333a2d9fe9a4ecb3c4716983e5c24793b498ea181804668617a2",
      "lf_sha256": "3de17c5f9136333a2d9fe9a4ecb3c4716983e5c24793b498ea181804668617a2",
      "source_text": "\\|\\mathsf{K}^{N}f\\|^{2}\\leq e^{-1}\\,\\|f\\|^{2}\\,. (B.33)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-994198-995301",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 994198,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 995301,
      "raw_sha256": "7c1a3473d0e4bdff31595c2ee950622b7ac77dc7636cc823302acf72aa42795e",
      "lf_sha256": "7c1a3473d0e4bdff31595c2ee950622b7ac77dc7636cc823302acf72aa42795e",
      "source_text": "\\|\\mathsf{K}^{N}f\\|^{2}\\leq e^{-1}\\,\\|f\\|^{2}\\,. (B.33)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p14.7",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 995319,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 996598,
      "raw_sha256": "aa0cc6c411829268b74eede29e2a420282cdc621c5e7ac6ff2f5c556e05dedb0",
      "lf_sha256": "aa0cc6c411829268b74eede29e2a420282cdc621c5e7ac6ff2f5c556e05dedb0",
      "source_text": "Iterating by blocks, the L^{2} contraction ( B.33 ) is equivalently, by ( D.5 ) and the adjoint remark following it, the \\chi^{2} -estimate"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.Ex51",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 996599,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 997973,
      "raw_sha256": "1b7be07526f39117efc8a24f49848591e93349a0b7ea7beaf85c18917f6914c0",
      "lf_sha256": "1b7be07526f39117efc8a24f49848591e93349a0b7ea7beaf85c18917f6914c0",
      "source_text": "\\chi^{2}\\bigl(\\nu_{0}\\mathcal{K}^{JN}\\|\\pi_{\\eta}\\bigr)\\leq e^{-J}\\chi^{2}(\\nu_{0}\\|\\pi_{\\eta})\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-996663-997956",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 996663,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 997956,
      "raw_sha256": "5321ac28d5bffb6dec8efa76fac4d1ed1d7453042138b68e6aea5da933252881",
      "lf_sha256": "5321ac28d5bffb6dec8efa76fac4d1ed1d7453042138b68e6aea5da933252881",
      "source_text": "\\chi^{2}\\bigl(\\nu_{0}\\mathcal{K}^{JN}\\|\\pi_{\\eta}\\bigr)\\leq e^{-J}\\chi^{2}(\\nu_{0}\\|\\pi_{\\eta})\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A2.SS3.p14.8",
      "anchor_container": "A2.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Modified L2 hypocoercivity and main theorem proof downstream of C.4; excluded from this bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 997974,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1000162,
      "raw_sha256": "b52730db036650706f68481878851475b8cc7d3ce51035cb649c4b29c4f928b9",
      "lf_sha256": "b52730db036650706f68481878851475b8cc7d3ce51035cb649c4b29c4f928b9",
      "source_text": "which proves ( 3.14 ). The X -marginal of \\pi_{\\eta} is \\mu , and total variation cannot increase under projection. Moreover, Cauchy–Schwarz gives \\operatorname{TV}(P,Q)\\leq\\tfrac{1}{2}\\sqrt{\\chi^{2}(P\\|Q)} , which gives ( 3.15 ). ∎"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "proof-container",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Container spans included C.1-C.4 and excluded later lanes; every substantive child paragraph/display is classified individually.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1002517,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1058014,
      "raw_sha256": "db4c06e2d485e4c870bb7ed91713eef6f5de82004c61895fe5f2bdbc97f18646",
      "lf_sha256": "db4c06e2d485e4c870bb7ed91713eef6f5de82004c61895fe5f2bdbc97f18646",
      "source_text": "Proof of Lemma B.1 . We first prove ( B.13 ). It suffices to consider f\\in C_{\\rm c}^{\\infty}(\\mathbb{R}^{d}) , the general case following by density and closedness of the gradient. Recall that the conditional density p_{y} of Y_{-} given Y_{+}=y is p_{y}(u)\\propto\\exp\\Bigl\\{-V((y+u)/2)-\\frac{\\|y-u\\|^{2}}{8\\eta}\\Bigr\\}\\,, and define s_{y}(u)\\coloneqq-\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\nabla V((y+u)/2)-\\frac{y-u}{4\\eta}\\,. Differentiating the normalized conditional density gives \\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f(y)=\\mathrm{Cov}\\bigl(f(Y_{-}),s_{y}(Y_{-})\\bigm|Y_{+}=y\\bigr)\\,. (C.1) The negative log-density of p_{y} has Hessian \\frac{1}{4}\\,\\bigl\\{\\nabla^{2}V((y+u)/2)+\\eta^{-1}I\\bigr\\}\\succeq\\frac{\\alpha+\\eta^{-1}}{4}\\,I\\,. Hence, the conditional Poincaré inequality implies, for every unit vector a , \\displaystyle\\Var\\bigl(a^{\\top}s_{y}(Y_{-})\\bigm|Y_{+}=y\\bigr) \\displaystyle\\leq\\frac{4}{\\alpha+\\eta^{-1}}\\,\\mathbb{E}\\bigl[\\|\\nabla_{u}(a^{\\top}s_{y})(Y_{-})\\|^{2}\\,\\bigm|\\,Y_{+}=y\\bigr]\\,. The assumptions \\alpha I\\preceq\\nabla^{2}V\\preceq\\beta I and \\beta\\eta\\leq 1 give \\|\\nabla_{u}s_{y}(u)\\|_{\\rm op}\\leq\\frac{\\eta^{-1}-\\alpha}{4}\\,. Consequently, \\Var\\bigl(a^{\\top}s_{y}(Y_{-})\\bigm|Y_{+}=y\\bigr)\\leq\\frac{(\\eta^{-1}-\\alpha)^{2}}{4\\,(\\alpha+\\eta^{-1})}\\,. Applying conditional Cauchy–Schwarz in ( C.1 ) and taking the supremum over \\|a\\|=1 yields \\|\\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f(y)\\|^{2}\\leq\\frac{(\\eta^{-1}-\\alpha)^{2}}{4\\,(\\alpha+\\eta^{-1})}\\Var(f(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}=y)\\,. Integrating in y and using ( B.9 ), \\displaystyle\\eta\\,\\|\\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f\\|^{2}\\leq\\frac{(1-\\alpha\\eta)^{2}}{4\\,(1+\\alpha\\eta)}\\,\\|\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}f\\|^{2}\\,. (C.2) Finally, \\|\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}f\\|^{2}=\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}f\\|^{2}=\\|f\\|^{2}-\\|\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f\\|^{2} , which proves ( B.13 ). We next bound the spectrum of \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} . Let f\\in\\mathfrak{H}_{\\mathsf{P},0} . Since \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} preserves constants, \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f is centered. The Poincaré inequality for the marginal law \\pi_{\\eta}^{Y} gives \\|\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f\\|^{2}=\\Var_{\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}}(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f)\\leq\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{\\alpha}+\\eta\\Bigr)\\,\\|\\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f\\|^{2}\\,. (C.3) Combining ( C.3 ) with ( C.2 ) and rearranging gives \\|\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f\\|\\leq\\frac{1-\\alpha\\eta}{1+\\alpha\\eta}\\,\\|f\\|=\\rho_{\\rm mac}\\,\\|f\\|\\,. (C.4) Since \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} is self-adjoint, this proves -\\rho_{\\rm mac}I\\preceq\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}\\preceq\\rho_{\\rm mac}I\\,. It remains only to obtain the uniform lower bound \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}\\succeq-\\frac{1}{2}\\,I . For every g\\in H^{1}(\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}) , exchangeability and ( B.8 ) give \\displaystyle\\bigl\\langle g,(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})g\\bigr\\rangle \\displaystyle=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathbb{E}\\bigl[\\bigl(g(Y_{+})-g(Y_{-})\\bigr)^{2}\\bigr]=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathbb{E}_{X}\\mathbb{E}_{Z}\\bigl[\\bigl(g(X+\\sqrt{\\eta}Z)-g(X-\\sqrt{\\eta}Z)\\bigr)^{2}\\bigr]\\,. (C.5) For fixed X=x , the Gaussian Poincaré inequality implies \\displaystyle\\mathbb{E}_{Z}\\bigl[\\bigl(g(x+\\sqrt{\\eta}Z)-g(x-\\sqrt{\\eta}Z)\\bigr)^{2}\\bigr] \\displaystyle\\leq\\eta\\,\\mathbb{E}_{Z}\\bigl\\|\\nabla g(x+\\sqrt{\\eta}Z)+\\nabla g(x-\\sqrt{\\eta}Z)\\bigr\\|^{2}\\,. Averaging in X and using that Y_{+} and Y_{-} have the same marginal gives \\bigl\\langle g,(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})g\\bigr\\rangle\\leq 2\\eta\\,\\|\\nabla g\\|^{2}\\,. (C.6) Applying ( C.6 ) with g=\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f and using ( B.13 ), we obtain \\displaystyle\\bigl\\langle f,\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{2}(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})f\\bigr\\rangle \\displaystyle=\\bigl\\langle\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f,(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f\\bigr\\rangle\\leq 2\\eta\\,\\|\\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f\\|^{2}\\leq\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\bigl\\langle f,(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{2})f\\bigr\\rangle\\,. Thus, as an operator inequality, 2\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{2}(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})\\preceq I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{2} , or equivalently (I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})^{2}(I+2\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})\\succeq 0\\,. (C.7) Since \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} is a self-adjoint contraction, its spectrum lies in [-1,1] . The scalar inequality corresponding to ( C.7 ) is (1-\\lambda)^{2}(1+2\\lambda)\\geq 0\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Spec}(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})\\,, and therefore \\operatorname{Spec}(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})\\subseteq[-1/2,1] . Hence -\\frac{1}{2}I\\,\\preceq\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} . Together with ( C.4 ), this proves ( B.14 ). Finally, \\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{2}=I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{2}\\succeq(1-\\rho_{\\rm mac}^{2})\\,I=\\frac{4\\alpha\\eta}{(1+\\alpha\\eta)^{2}}\\,I\\,, and therefore \\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}\\succeq\\frac{2\\sqrt{\\alpha\\eta}}{1+\\alpha\\eta}\\,I=\\gamma_{\\rm gap}I\\,. This proves ( B.15 ). ∎"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p1.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1003091,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1004181,
      "raw_sha256": "f7df116ca00ea43aba42880206caa3bf0ecf88ea40ce226a95c642de7cef3a43",
      "lf_sha256": "f7df116ca00ea43aba42880206caa3bf0ecf88ea40ce226a95c642de7cef3a43",
      "source_text": "We first prove ( B.13 ). It suffices to consider f\\in C_{\\rm c}^{\\infty}(\\mathbb{R}^{d}) , the general case following by density and closedness of the gradient.",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.SS1.p1.1"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p2.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1004227,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1005045,
      "raw_sha256": "ce63fe21e27606ed10bcd07a7af1a80c070107702bd6c4a31587e6b388b5054b",
      "lf_sha256": "ce63fe21e27606ed10bcd07a7af1a80c070107702bd6c4a31587e6b388b5054b",
      "source_text": "Recall that the conditional density p_{y} of Y_{-} given Y_{+}=y is",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.SS1.p2.1"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1005046,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1006546,
      "raw_sha256": "a6e23d867da3c53566002b685501788ae4341e97b8838c6cb5dab6a8f06a8db4",
      "lf_sha256": "a6e23d867da3c53566002b685501788ae4341e97b8838c6cb5dab6a8f06a8db4",
      "source_text": "p_{y}(u)\\propto\\exp\\Bigl\\{-V((y+u)/2)-\\frac{\\|y-u\\|^{2}}{8\\eta}\\Bigr\\}\\,,",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.Ex1"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1005109-1006529",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1005109,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1006529,
      "raw_sha256": "86ea29b578e32b627e6ed0632b52138030337997299d16ca49823f1b217e597f",
      "lf_sha256": "86ea29b578e32b627e6ed0632b52138030337997299d16ca49823f1b217e597f",
      "source_text": "p_{y}(u)\\propto\\exp\\Bigl\\{-V((y+u)/2)-\\frac{\\|y-u\\|^{2}}{8\\eta}\\Bigr\\}\\,,",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:byte-1005109-1006529"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p2.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1006547,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1006644,
      "raw_sha256": "8a5c59a780c4a2610c1fdb5bc8cf1d99cc7a90a7d4b72ce281ddccbc3ee9237e",
      "lf_sha256": "8a5c59a780c4a2610c1fdb5bc8cf1d99cc7a90a7d4b72ce281ddccbc3ee9237e",
      "source_text": "and define",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.SS1.p2.2"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1006645,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1007876,
      "raw_sha256": "eac5ef047f3caac97461376e3dff8d0bb8f5cb225c7dfb90a49f89b65636fb24",
      "lf_sha256": "eac5ef047f3caac97461376e3dff8d0bb8f5cb225c7dfb90a49f89b65636fb24",
      "source_text": "s_{y}(u)\\coloneqq-\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\nabla V((y+u)/2)-\\frac{y-u}{4\\eta}\\,.",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.Ex2"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1006708-1007859",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1006708,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1007859,
      "raw_sha256": "238f62ef8bc164dd3bd5acb56d0a910a1ed4dbf0efd1a90d2889e880cdaf19fa",
      "lf_sha256": "238f62ef8bc164dd3bd5acb56d0a910a1ed4dbf0efd1a90d2889e880cdaf19fa",
      "source_text": "s_{y}(u)\\coloneqq-\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\nabla V((y+u)/2)-\\frac{y-u}{4\\eta}\\,.",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:byte-1006708-1007859"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p2.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1007877,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1008020,
      "raw_sha256": "7e354547d57734848863d271f457961e2e4ba8184ab074e6b2b99047c2304a4e",
      "lf_sha256": "7e354547d57734848863d271f457961e2e4ba8184ab074e6b2b99047c2304a4e",
      "source_text": "Differentiating the normalized conditional density gives",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.SS1.p2.3"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.E1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1008021,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1009588,
      "raw_sha256": "758bde8e1d0c478a89e978bd88b4a0d84d0c82ad2309ecca8b16b4511b438e33",
      "lf_sha256": "758bde8e1d0c478a89e978bd88b4a0d84d0c82ad2309ecca8b16b4511b438e33",
      "source_text": "\\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f(y)=\\mathrm{Cov}\\bigl(f(Y_{-}),s_{y}(Y_{-})\\bigm|Y_{+}=y\\bigr)\\,. (C.1)",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.E1"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1008083-1009571",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1008083,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1009571,
      "raw_sha256": "56422ad605819bf0e8ee5a2ab2763dd2013e95173e5c0994ce52351f0c5230fe",
      "lf_sha256": "56422ad605819bf0e8ee5a2ab2763dd2013e95173e5c0994ce52351f0c5230fe",
      "source_text": "\\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f(y)=\\mathrm{Cov}\\bigl(f(Y_{-}),s_{y}(Y_{-})\\bigm|Y_{+}=y\\bigr)\\,. (C.1)",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:byte-1008083-1009571"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p3.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1009634,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1009975,
      "raw_sha256": "da145ff5b2728858aa9d129117115fac6ff44ff1d038aed5a1edaa677b78aed1",
      "lf_sha256": "da145ff5b2728858aa9d129117115fac6ff44ff1d038aed5a1edaa677b78aed1",
      "source_text": "The negative log-density of p_{y} has Hessian",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.SS1.p3.1"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1009976,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1011557,
      "raw_sha256": "7b3635bea6311fb5b5ca2a7ede1a2461dde8e8098c79d2ea0c7dd23f4ab7d95e",
      "lf_sha256": "7b3635bea6311fb5b5ca2a7ede1a2461dde8e8098c79d2ea0c7dd23f4ab7d95e",
      "source_text": "\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\bigl\\{\\nabla^{2}V((y+u)/2)+\\eta^{-1}I\\bigr\\}\\succeq\\frac{\\alpha+\\eta^{-1}}{4}\\,I\\,.",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.Ex3"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1010039-1011540",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1010039,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1011540,
      "raw_sha256": "cc533df63bbbf56dfc74a073a35eabd04320d9ad102aea3ba4ae5134163d74bc",
      "lf_sha256": "cc533df63bbbf56dfc74a073a35eabd04320d9ad102aea3ba4ae5134163d74bc",
      "source_text": "\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\bigl\\{\\nabla^{2}V((y+u)/2)+\\eta^{-1}I\\bigr\\}\\succeq\\frac{\\alpha+\\eta^{-1}}{4}\\,I\\,.",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:byte-1010039-1011540"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p3.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1011558,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1011904,
      "raw_sha256": "ace3b7d8f20c18c8b9c2754b1fde29807c0371e939cc3ba4bbd1e3b584f57337",
      "lf_sha256": "ace3b7d8f20c18c8b9c2754b1fde29807c0371e939cc3ba4bbd1e3b584f57337",
      "source_text": "Hence, the conditional Poincaré inequality implies, for every unit vector a ,",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.SS1.p3.2"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1012001-1014638",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1012001,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1014638,
      "raw_sha256": "76b5d26ec94925d5191be91eae9d4257a1e2788c721e2f19057a5e0ac92feacf",
      "lf_sha256": "76b5d26ec94925d5191be91eae9d4257a1e2788c721e2f19057a5e0ac92feacf",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\Var\\bigl(a^{\\top}s_{y}(Y_{-})\\bigm|Y_{+}=y\\bigr) \\displaystyle\\leq\\frac{4}{\\alpha+\\eta^{-1}}\\,\\mathbb{E}\\bigl[\\|\\nabla_{u}(a^{\\top}s_{y})(Y_{-})\\|^{2}\\,\\bigm|\\,Y_{+}=y\\bigr]\\,.",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:byte-1012001-1014638"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p3.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1014656,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1015585,
      "raw_sha256": "b0e5d9ad809ddea45b881f16a4c83161fd17118c2ad410037f4dbd4681434a4b",
      "lf_sha256": "b0e5d9ad809ddea45b881f16a4c83161fd17118c2ad410037f4dbd4681434a4b",
      "source_text": "The assumptions \\alpha I\\preceq\\nabla^{2}V\\preceq\\beta I and \\beta\\eta\\leq 1 give",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.SS1.p3.3"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex5",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1015586,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1016685,
      "raw_sha256": "4d27c57c448e791bf3731ab1c2be1cae1265d020845b62e1bf1602c2370620cb",
      "lf_sha256": "4d27c57c448e791bf3731ab1c2be1cae1265d020845b62e1bf1602c2370620cb",
      "source_text": "\\|\\nabla_{u}s_{y}(u)\\|_{\\rm op}\\leq\\frac{\\eta^{-1}-\\alpha}{4}\\,.",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.Ex5"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1015649-1016668",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1015649,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1016668,
      "raw_sha256": "621522fe65d47a1394106c8a10ee7c9dfbc1d1abfb907e0e7a0c5ae43bda18e9",
      "lf_sha256": "621522fe65d47a1394106c8a10ee7c9dfbc1d1abfb907e0e7a0c5ae43bda18e9",
      "source_text": "\\|\\nabla_{u}s_{y}(u)\\|_{\\rm op}\\leq\\frac{\\eta^{-1}-\\alpha}{4}\\,.",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:byte-1015649-1016668"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p3.4",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1016686,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1016786,
      "raw_sha256": "69e031e2db49a75b2ecdfa58f113b8afa5372b494685aedb748423b97c61cfd1",
      "lf_sha256": "69e031e2db49a75b2ecdfa58f113b8afa5372b494685aedb748423b97c61cfd1",
      "source_text": "Consequently,",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.SS1.p3.4"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex6",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1016787,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1018499,
      "raw_sha256": "d979fb9a8cc56871a34c4092adb99c918843f02b7a514b1b1ab9dc3ce36a9212",
      "lf_sha256": "d979fb9a8cc56871a34c4092adb99c918843f02b7a514b1b1ab9dc3ce36a9212",
      "source_text": "\\Var\\bigl(a^{\\top}s_{y}(Y_{-})\\bigm|Y_{+}=y\\bigr)\\leq\\frac{(\\eta^{-1}-\\alpha)^{2}}{4\\,(\\alpha+\\eta^{-1})}\\,.",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.Ex6"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1016850-1018482",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1016850,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1018482,
      "raw_sha256": "70e20453d9bb25f00b6f0a65aa5906cf21d7adac771509140371170e344f2d4b",
      "lf_sha256": "70e20453d9bb25f00b6f0a65aa5906cf21d7adac771509140371170e344f2d4b",
      "source_text": "\\Var\\bigl(a^{\\top}s_{y}(Y_{-})\\bigm|Y_{+}=y\\bigr)\\leq\\frac{(\\eta^{-1}-\\alpha)^{2}}{4\\,(\\alpha+\\eta^{-1})}\\,.",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:byte-1016850-1018482"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p3.5",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1018500,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1019260,
      "raw_sha256": "0493bd11bf7ed924f4b54e6a347990927b65e476bd1e36c07b60874a05b60937",
      "lf_sha256": "0493bd11bf7ed924f4b54e6a347990927b65e476bd1e36c07b60874a05b60937",
      "source_text": "Applying conditional Cauchy–Schwarz in ( C.1 ) and taking the supremum over \\|a\\|=1 yields",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.SS1.p3.5"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex7",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1019261,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1021061,
      "raw_sha256": "5127afc363889fda877a295746bd75315f42881850cd1fe45dc8501ea7f56af0",
      "lf_sha256": "5127afc363889fda877a295746bd75315f42881850cd1fe45dc8501ea7f56af0",
      "source_text": "\\|\\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f(y)\\|^{2}\\leq\\frac{(\\eta^{-1}-\\alpha)^{2}}{4\\,(\\alpha+\\eta^{-1})}\\Var(f(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}=y)\\,.",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.Ex7"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1019324-1021044",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1019324,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1021044,
      "raw_sha256": "2afb1a1dd728e656cd52d9194aad3dd3b78c114a50ebdf0dcfdabf90b82da511",
      "lf_sha256": "2afb1a1dd728e656cd52d9194aad3dd3b78c114a50ebdf0dcfdabf90b82da511",
      "source_text": "\\|\\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f(y)\\|^{2}\\leq\\frac{(\\eta^{-1}-\\alpha)^{2}}{4\\,(\\alpha+\\eta^{-1})}\\Var(f(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}=y)\\,.",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:byte-1019324-1021044"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p3.6",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1021062,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1021690,
      "raw_sha256": "2bb922677ff77b9ffa80336474a642f6f14ad85dd7d6a89be304ffe2558290f6",
      "lf_sha256": "2bb922677ff77b9ffa80336474a642f6f14ad85dd7d6a89be304ffe2558290f6",
      "source_text": "Integrating in y and using ( B.9 ),",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.SS1.p3.6"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1021786-1023679",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1021786,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1023679,
      "raw_sha256": "9a909a1475d6609bb1d593ef60dd11678cd9afa14ba9de92bbceb48ed8aec66a",
      "lf_sha256": "9a909a1475d6609bb1d593ef60dd11678cd9afa14ba9de92bbceb48ed8aec66a",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\eta\\,\\|\\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f\\|^{2}\\leq\\frac{(1-\\alpha\\eta)^{2}}{4\\,(1+\\alpha\\eta)}\\,\\|\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}f\\|^{2}\\,. (C.2)",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:byte-1021786-1023679"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p3.7",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1023697,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1025470,
      "raw_sha256": "f0a4fb9b16fdb080566654ff1609d4633c82fd28090baa03db99562fa7a53fee",
      "lf_sha256": "f0a4fb9b16fdb080566654ff1609d4633c82fd28090baa03db99562fa7a53fee",
      "source_text": "Finally, \\|\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}f\\|^{2}=\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}f\\|^{2}=\\|f\\|^{2}-\\|\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f\\|^{2} , which proves ( B.13 ).",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.SS1.p3.7"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p4.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1025516,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1027227,
      "raw_sha256": "d1ef31fc9ae67dc514ed545cf36ca858dbfcd931d870e367e2c3901bc227aa72",
      "lf_sha256": "d1ef31fc9ae67dc514ed545cf36ca858dbfcd931d870e367e2c3901bc227aa72",
      "source_text": "We next bound the spectrum of \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} . Let f\\in\\mathfrak{H}_{\\mathsf{P},0} . Since \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} preserves constants, \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f is centered. The Poincaré inequality for the marginal law \\pi_{\\eta}^{Y} gives",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.SS1.p4.1"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.E3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1027228,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1029036,
      "raw_sha256": "d3751b92957e3cd1d4b24d08a74d8631a7574cc23a58587aaaf2c9b176c1344b",
      "lf_sha256": "d3751b92957e3cd1d4b24d08a74d8631a7574cc23a58587aaaf2c9b176c1344b",
      "source_text": "\\|\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f\\|^{2}=\\Var_{\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}}(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f)\\leq\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{\\alpha}+\\eta\\Bigr)\\,\\|\\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f\\|^{2}\\,. (C.3)",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.E3"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1027290-1029019",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1027290,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1029019,
      "raw_sha256": "7b64d39bcc574a114cb59bf6219009ed30f0a232e3d020699f93cf316508ef43",
      "lf_sha256": "7b64d39bcc574a114cb59bf6219009ed30f0a232e3d020699f93cf316508ef43",
      "source_text": "\\|\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f\\|^{2}=\\Var_{\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}}(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f)\\leq\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{\\alpha}+\\eta\\Bigr)\\,\\|\\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f\\|^{2}\\,. (C.3)",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:byte-1027290-1029019"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p4.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1029037,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1029754,
      "raw_sha256": "4690dce06a8facb2df6a6b7f8eca0ed38f8e70cb0088876a244546cec2630aa9",
      "lf_sha256": "4690dce06a8facb2df6a6b7f8eca0ed38f8e70cb0088876a244546cec2630aa9",
      "source_text": "Combining ( C.3 ) with ( C.2 ) and rearranging gives",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.SS1.p4.2"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.E4",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1029755,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1031371,
      "raw_sha256": "832e5eba8dbe8fd2b0361f4514814d7e6462b20418b04693badb9aa6122ce341",
      "lf_sha256": "832e5eba8dbe8fd2b0361f4514814d7e6462b20418b04693badb9aa6122ce341",
      "source_text": "\\|\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f\\|\\leq\\frac{1-\\alpha\\eta}{1+\\alpha\\eta}\\,\\|f\\|=\\rho_{\\rm mac}\\,\\|f\\|\\,. (C.4)",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.E4"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1029817-1031354",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1029817,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1031354,
      "raw_sha256": "e17657e57d30d238950a051fd64c02a29babd01999b8c0c0ec173316dcc2f1af",
      "lf_sha256": "e17657e57d30d238950a051fd64c02a29babd01999b8c0c0ec173316dcc2f1af",
      "source_text": "\\|\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f\\|\\leq\\frac{1-\\alpha\\eta}{1+\\alpha\\eta}\\,\\|f\\|=\\rho_{\\rm mac}\\,\\|f\\|\\,. (C.4)",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:byte-1029817-1031354"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p4.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1031372,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1031774,
      "raw_sha256": "b93e0ad9d63b1b1219348b0225d1dbe0284b39e0583d6557001522d060aea20c",
      "lf_sha256": "b93e0ad9d63b1b1219348b0225d1dbe0284b39e0583d6557001522d060aea20c",
      "source_text": "Since \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} is self-adjoint, this proves",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.SS1.p4.3"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex8",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1031775,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1032741,
      "raw_sha256": "c22e0d3c07b7f3862407e319cd45a72093c5eb3ad4b5bb184133ad999fa38f14",
      "lf_sha256": "c22e0d3c07b7f3862407e319cd45a72093c5eb3ad4b5bb184133ad999fa38f14",
      "source_text": "-\\rho_{\\rm mac}I\\preceq\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}\\preceq\\rho_{\\rm mac}I\\,.",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.Ex8"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1031838-1032724",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1031838,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1032724,
      "raw_sha256": "1e513849db0cb64205d1e653603ab0d3450a56b257662a5fb678a6c68553a493",
      "lf_sha256": "1e513849db0cb64205d1e653603ab0d3450a56b257662a5fb678a6c68553a493",
      "source_text": "-\\rho_{\\rm mac}I\\preceq\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}\\preceq\\rho_{\\rm mac}I\\,.",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:byte-1031838-1032724"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p4.4",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1032742,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1034183,
      "raw_sha256": "c989b8174926e58914d8c3853312b96d9dadc4edd64c4363c8a25093992bc474",
      "lf_sha256": "c989b8174926e58914d8c3853312b96d9dadc4edd64c4363c8a25093992bc474",
      "source_text": "It remains only to obtain the uniform lower bound \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}\\succeq-\\frac{1}{2}\\,I . For every g\\in H^{1}(\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}) , exchangeability and ( B.8 ) give",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A3.SS1.p4.4"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1034279-1037743",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1034279,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1037743,
      "raw_sha256": "750e8a75074bebe759e99631e699e001a90d78cf6bb73240544817e6fbaf212f",
      "lf_sha256": "750e8a75074bebe759e99631e699e001a90d78cf6bb73240544817e6fbaf212f",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\bigl\\langle g,(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})g\\bigr\\rangle \\displaystyle=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathbb{E}\\bigl[\\bigl(g(Y_{+})-g(Y_{-})\\bigr)^{2}\\bigr]=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathbb{E}_{X}\\mathbb{E}_{Z}\\bigl[\\bigl(g(X+\\sqrt{\\eta}Z)-g(X-\\sqrt{\\eta}Z)\\bigr)^{2}\\bigr]\\,. (C.5)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p4.5",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1037761,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1038121,
      "raw_sha256": "71ddf1f8b92fce238d43bbca93a97ced3ea85ebd928b7b174066a3423e15f60b",
      "lf_sha256": "71ddf1f8b92fce238d43bbca93a97ced3ea85ebd928b7b174066a3423e15f60b",
      "source_text": "For fixed X=x , the Gaussian Poincaré inequality implies"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1038218-1041007",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1038218,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1041007,
      "raw_sha256": "672e54039533c0c6e58f84394737db5ea3676a46493a7e206d823d21fbeb9370",
      "lf_sha256": "672e54039533c0c6e58f84394737db5ea3676a46493a7e206d823d21fbeb9370",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\mathbb{E}_{Z}\\bigl[\\bigl(g(x+\\sqrt{\\eta}Z)-g(x-\\sqrt{\\eta}Z)\\bigr)^{2}\\bigr] \\displaystyle\\leq\\eta\\,\\mathbb{E}_{Z}\\bigl\\|\\nabla g(x+\\sqrt{\\eta}Z)+\\nabla g(x-\\sqrt{\\eta}Z)\\bigr\\|^{2}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p4.6",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1041025,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1041791,
      "raw_sha256": "0d6c650a4c4d4862886afb733d1f6d664f96ea2c94fc6ab3c7f1dacc61d56abb",
      "lf_sha256": "0d6c650a4c4d4862886afb733d1f6d664f96ea2c94fc6ab3c7f1dacc61d56abb",
      "source_text": "Averaging in X and using that Y_{+} and Y_{-} have the same marginal gives"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.E6",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1041792,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1043304,
      "raw_sha256": "6c96bcd0743dff97b53b652fb11a261cdebb3b36127a6699374150ab31b21e3d",
      "lf_sha256": "6c96bcd0743dff97b53b652fb11a261cdebb3b36127a6699374150ab31b21e3d",
      "source_text": "\\bigl\\langle g,(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})g\\bigr\\rangle\\leq 2\\eta\\,\\|\\nabla g\\|^{2}\\,. (C.6)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1041854-1043287",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1041854,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1043287,
      "raw_sha256": "be7c8bf8dae458f0bd958dad52df38ab5097e43be9b809117631711f17d62632",
      "lf_sha256": "be7c8bf8dae458f0bd958dad52df38ab5097e43be9b809117631711f17d62632",
      "source_text": "\\bigl\\langle g,(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})g\\bigr\\rangle\\leq 2\\eta\\,\\|\\nabla g\\|^{2}\\,. (C.6)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p5.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1043350,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1044532,
      "raw_sha256": "dc50ebf2ba72dba6d81404949c46fea9cf258af9d5d8ad12d7feaaaeeb91c8c3",
      "lf_sha256": "dc50ebf2ba72dba6d81404949c46fea9cf258af9d5d8ad12d7feaaaeeb91c8c3",
      "source_text": "Applying ( C.6 ) with g=\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f and using ( B.13 ), we obtain"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1044630-1047651",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1044630,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1047651,
      "raw_sha256": "757dccd59fb16a4a1e9c1d304b70c40507b4f2e5f2a8e8e5d73821ada8e1cf9d",
      "lf_sha256": "757dccd59fb16a4a1e9c1d304b70c40507b4f2e5f2a8e8e5d73821ada8e1cf9d",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\bigl\\langle f,\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{2}(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})f\\bigr\\rangle \\displaystyle=\\bigl\\langle\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f,(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f\\bigr\\rangle\\leq 2\\eta\\,\\|\\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f\\|^{2}\\leq\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\bigl\\langle f,(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{2})f\\bigr\\rangle\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p5.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1047669,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1048643,
      "raw_sha256": "a7f9afd11d06aec7f5fcd885f87a2cdf2b25158a62ac3754d4d7a5d07f7d938d",
      "lf_sha256": "a7f9afd11d06aec7f5fcd885f87a2cdf2b25158a62ac3754d4d7a5d07f7d938d",
      "source_text": "Thus, as an operator inequality, 2\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{2}(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})\\preceq I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{2} , or equivalently"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.E7",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1048644,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1049943,
      "raw_sha256": "8cbc609e2f04c60179a9e747cb2c907588f754fa2d7b39c5efb6b0c27655262b",
      "lf_sha256": "8cbc609e2f04c60179a9e747cb2c907588f754fa2d7b39c5efb6b0c27655262b",
      "source_text": "(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})^{2}(I+2\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})\\succeq 0\\,. (C.7)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1048706-1049926",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1048706,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1049926,
      "raw_sha256": "eaede14aa6aeba227aa2b2844c6c3e77e808e896fc8f9836497b4fd8ba319b5b",
      "lf_sha256": "eaede14aa6aeba227aa2b2844c6c3e77e808e896fc8f9836497b4fd8ba319b5b",
      "source_text": "(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})^{2}(I+2\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})\\succeq 0\\,. (C.7)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p5.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1049944,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1051028,
      "raw_sha256": "a51a5ce18bbdcb94ae76c86170eac3d847cd2ab25e12e06b9fc9545903b8199c",
      "lf_sha256": "a51a5ce18bbdcb94ae76c86170eac3d847cd2ab25e12e06b9fc9545903b8199c",
      "source_text": "Since \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} is a self-adjoint contraction, its spectrum lies in [-1,1] . The scalar inequality corresponding to ( C.7 ) is"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex11",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1051029,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1052411,
      "raw_sha256": "8942670fc31adbcf5326e87496d3cec4c017ea56fbd3fdf0fa01ba517665c692",
      "lf_sha256": "8942670fc31adbcf5326e87496d3cec4c017ea56fbd3fdf0fa01ba517665c692",
      "source_text": "(1-\\lambda)^{2}(1+2\\lambda)\\geq 0\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Spec}(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1051093-1052394",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1051093,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1052394,
      "raw_sha256": "f13a609b878ce303c421ac13be61a037748ac5b91adddea80aa2907e24493c77",
      "lf_sha256": "f13a609b878ce303c421ac13be61a037748ac5b91adddea80aa2907e24493c77",
      "source_text": "(1-\\lambda)^{2}(1+2\\lambda)\\geq 0\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Spec}(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p5.4",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1052412,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1054329,
      "raw_sha256": "afc9fa17dbb94cbdd547c7ea2cf71c4df7d2c9eedbad77c2704b834d8a71b069",
      "lf_sha256": "afc9fa17dbb94cbdd547c7ea2cf71c4df7d2c9eedbad77c2704b834d8a71b069",
      "source_text": "and therefore \\operatorname{Spec}(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})\\subseteq[-1/2,1] . Hence -\\frac{1}{2}I\\,\\preceq\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} . Together with ( C.4 ), this proves ( B.14 )."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p6.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1054375,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1054470,
      "raw_sha256": "821579c42959b326cea3fb9ef8d102a629d71a327c2018c2833ec6bc870cc072",
      "lf_sha256": "821579c42959b326cea3fb9ef8d102a629d71a327c2018c2833ec6bc870cc072",
      "source_text": "Finally,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex12",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1054471,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1056144,
      "raw_sha256": "4032d43b7e291d8d287fc89ad35c2d0d430f447da59d95880cf86cec7f565a55",
      "lf_sha256": "4032d43b7e291d8d287fc89ad35c2d0d430f447da59d95880cf86cec7f565a55",
      "source_text": "\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{2}=I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{2}\\succeq(1-\\rho_{\\rm mac}^{2})\\,I=\\frac{4\\alpha\\eta}{(1+\\alpha\\eta)^{2}}\\,I\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1054535-1056127",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1054535,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1056127,
      "raw_sha256": "4a0ab56c38d833fff9f61ddd823c5816cf7f6caa9e39cfbe3ea3317fb8c9cc47",
      "lf_sha256": "4a0ab56c38d833fff9f61ddd823c5816cf7f6caa9e39cfbe3ea3317fb8c9cc47",
      "source_text": "\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{2}=I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{2}\\succeq(1-\\rho_{\\rm mac}^{2})\\,I=\\frac{4\\alpha\\eta}{(1+\\alpha\\eta)^{2}}\\,I\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p6.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1056145,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1056245,
      "raw_sha256": "38fb787827fbb13090ccd6f02b3166a813cf078077f83ade106673800305498b",
      "lf_sha256": "38fb787827fbb13090ccd6f02b3166a813cf078077f83ade106673800305498b",
      "source_text": "and therefore"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex13",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1056246,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1057513,
      "raw_sha256": "85adbececf2e41a842155bc3eb5c23eb84a8b5ad2acfce7285c826cbfe003f36",
      "lf_sha256": "85adbececf2e41a842155bc3eb5c23eb84a8b5ad2acfce7285c826cbfe003f36",
      "source_text": "\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}\\succeq\\frac{2\\sqrt{\\alpha\\eta}}{1+\\alpha\\eta}\\,I=\\gamma_{\\rm gap}I\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1056310-1057496",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1056310,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1057496,
      "raw_sha256": "48ab8e231b8f786b47cc5fbf15df5983fb96259a817d7599bee5997369c3f5be",
      "lf_sha256": "48ab8e231b8f786b47cc5fbf15df5983fb96259a817d7599bee5997369c3f5be",
      "source_text": "\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}\\succeq\\frac{2\\sqrt{\\alpha\\eta}}{1+\\alpha\\eta}\\,I=\\gamma_{\\rm gap}I\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p6.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1057514,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1058000,
      "raw_sha256": "de66b544c2a9c5089be2a100f4b0cdb1cf0494bf24b2492c2b6eb911782176a8",
      "lf_sha256": "de66b544c2a9c5089be2a100f4b0cdb1cf0494bf24b2492c2b6eb911782176a8",
      "source_text": "This proves ( B.15 ). ∎"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p7.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1058053,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1058456,
      "raw_sha256": "1482a70e808dbf294400cd7b6dd9bb2427ccc1f2a76adeb14f03555eb4736890",
      "lf_sha256": "1482a70e808dbf294400cd7b6dd9bb2427ccc1f2a76adeb14f03555eb4736890",
      "source_text": "The half-turn analysis below uses the following alternative form of ( C.1 )."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Thmtheorem1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "source-statement",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1058464,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1062118,
      "raw_sha256": "ecc5b8361c8e186566ef1a39014121943453e407ed93080efb4b65206ead703c",
      "lf_sha256": "ecc5b8361c8e186566ef1a39014121943453e407ed93080efb4b65206ead703c",
      "source_text": "Lemma C.1 (Derivative formula for \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} ) . For every f\\in H^{1}(\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}) and \\pi_{\\eta}^{Y} -almost every y , \\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f(y)=\\mathbb{E}[\\nabla f(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}=y]-\\mathrm{Cov}(f(Y_{-}),\\nabla V(X)\\mid Y_{+}=y)\\,. (C.8)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Thmtheorem1.p1.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1059194,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1060260,
      "raw_sha256": "bead52108817cbff63514159eb5c1aa937bcbbb9e55f1a1b0de001cdf2ae4d44",
      "lf_sha256": "bead52108817cbff63514159eb5c1aa937bcbbb9e55f1a1b0de001cdf2ae4d44",
      "source_text": "For every f\\in H^{1}(\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}) and \\pi_{\\eta}^{Y} -almost every y ,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.E8",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1060261,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1062104,
      "raw_sha256": "ea8867c091141a43d34fae5b7a95b6e80f1da52b290292cd0a5777a97bf6cb74",
      "lf_sha256": "ea8867c091141a43d34fae5b7a95b6e80f1da52b290292cd0a5777a97bf6cb74",
      "source_text": "\\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f(y)=\\mathbb{E}[\\nabla f(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}=y]-\\mathrm{Cov}(f(Y_{-}),\\nabla V(X)\\mid Y_{+}=y)\\,. (C.8)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1060323-1062087",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1060323,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1062087,
      "raw_sha256": "b03321435f24c20d85ac21a901bf56eb3465eb19e950dfc9ed88846f08c2feb0",
      "lf_sha256": "b03321435f24c20d85ac21a901bf56eb3465eb19e950dfc9ed88846f08c2feb0",
      "source_text": "\\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f(y)=\\mathbb{E}[\\nabla f(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}=y]-\\mathrm{Cov}(f(Y_{-}),\\nabla V(X)\\mid Y_{+}=y)\\,. (C.8)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "proof-container",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Container spans included C.1-C.4 and excluded later lanes; every substantive child paragraph/display is classified individually.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1062119,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1088103,
      "raw_sha256": "d4cf1b534948bd9714cc000d20eb714ec6ca1bd06b4506328ab0d59ad0fcc92e",
      "lf_sha256": "d4cf1b534948bd9714cc000d20eb714ec6ca1bd06b4506328ab0d59ad0fcc92e",
      "source_text": "Proof. First let f\\in C_{\\rm c}^{\\infty}(\\mathbb{R}^{d}) . The representation ( C.1 ) gives \\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f(y)=\\mathrm{Cov}(f(Y_{-}),s_{y}(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}=y)\\,. Using the definition of s_{y} , we write s_{y}(u)=\\Bigl\\{\\frac{1}{2}\\nabla V((y+u)/2)-\\frac{y-u}{4\\eta}\\Bigr\\}-\\nabla V((y+u)/2)\\,. To rewrite ( C.1 ) in the claimed form, we only need to identify the covariance generated by the vector in braces. Integration by parts in u against the conditional density p_{y} gives \\mathbb{E}[\\nabla f(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}=y]=\\mathbb{E}\\Bigl[f(Y_{-})\\,\\Bigl\\{\\frac{1}{2}\\nabla V(X)-\\frac{y-Y_{-}}{4\\eta}\\Bigr\\}\\ \\Bigm|\\ Y_{+}=y\\Bigr]\\,. (C.9) Applying ( C.9 ) to f\\equiv 1 , justified by compactly supported cutoffs converging to 1 , gives \\mathbb{E}\\Bigl[\\frac{1}{2}\\nabla V(X)-\\frac{y-Y_{-}}{4\\eta}\\,\\Bigm|\\,Y_{+}=y\\Bigr]=0\\,. Combining this with ( C.9 ), we obtain \\displaystyle\\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f(y) \\displaystyle=\\mathrm{Cov}\\Bigl(f(Y_{-}),\\frac{1}{2}\\nabla V(X)-\\frac{y-Y_{-}}{4\\eta}\\,\\Bigm|\\,Y_{+}=y\\Bigr)-\\mathrm{Cov}(f(Y_{-}),\\nabla V(X)\\mid Y_{+}=y) \\displaystyle=\\mathbb{E}\\Bigl[f(Y_{-})\\,\\Bigl\\{\\frac{1}{2}\\nabla V(X)-\\frac{y-Y_{-}}{4\\eta}\\Bigr\\}\\,\\Bigm|\\,Y_{+}=y\\Bigr]-\\mathrm{Cov}(f(Y_{-}),\\nabla V(X)\\mid Y_{+}=y) \\displaystyle=\\mathbb{E}[\\nabla f(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}=y]-\\mathrm{Cov}(f(Y_{-}),\\nabla V(X)\\mid Y_{+}=y)\\,. This is ( C.8 ) for smooth f . The extension to H^{1}(\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}) is a standard approximation argument once we check that the covariance term is continuous in L^{2} . By ( 2.11 ), the conditional law of X given Y_{+}=y has Poincaré constant at most \\eta/(1+\\alpha\\eta)\\leq\\eta . Hence, for every unit vector a\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d} , \\Var(a^{\\top}\\nabla V(X)\\mid Y_{+}=y)\\leq\\eta\\,\\mathbb{E}[\\|\\nabla^{2}V(X)\\,a\\|^{2}\\mid Y_{+}=y]\\leq\\beta^{2}\\eta\\,. Conditional Cauchy–Schwarz and ( B.9 ) therefore imply \\bigl\\|\\mathrm{Cov}(f(Y_{-}),\\nabla V(X)\\mid Y_{+})\\bigr\\|_{L^{2}}\\leq\\beta\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\|\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}f\\|\\,, and the same bound applies to differences. Conditional expectation is an L^{2} contraction, and ( B.13 ) controls the left side. Thus every term in ( C.8 ) is continuous under H^{1} approximation. Density of C_{\\rm c}^{\\infty}(\\mathbb{R}^{d}) in H^{1}(\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}) completes the proof. ∎"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p8.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1062271,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1063200,
      "raw_sha256": "67701025230595cd872be914bce7bc59932119dfed2deb2c0226fe31b1c905ee",
      "lf_sha256": "67701025230595cd872be914bce7bc59932119dfed2deb2c0226fe31b1c905ee",
      "source_text": "First let f\\in C_{\\rm c}^{\\infty}(\\mathbb{R}^{d}) . The representation ( C.1 ) gives"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex14",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1063201,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1064505,
      "raw_sha256": "35462a02938eeab40967d959ed9bbfe08139cfad72e47740b4a84bbb54661de7",
      "lf_sha256": "35462a02938eeab40967d959ed9bbfe08139cfad72e47740b4a84bbb54661de7",
      "source_text": "\\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f(y)=\\mathrm{Cov}(f(Y_{-}),s_{y}(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}=y)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1063265-1064488",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1063265,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1064488,
      "raw_sha256": "e2d0fd08d958156e5691f48d6c5284d5bcdb58d75a53a3038d2d694bba17aea3",
      "lf_sha256": "e2d0fd08d958156e5691f48d6c5284d5bcdb58d75a53a3038d2d694bba17aea3",
      "source_text": "\\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f(y)=\\mathrm{Cov}(f(Y_{-}),s_{y}(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}=y)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p8.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1064506,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1064841,
      "raw_sha256": "f1bbd6720028c09b81152520c176c1b51f4e3299155c5cc8a09a2fdbbc8429ff",
      "lf_sha256": "f1bbd6720028c09b81152520c176c1b51f4e3299155c5cc8a09a2fdbbc8429ff",
      "source_text": "Using the definition of s_{y} , we write"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex15",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1064842,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1066417,
      "raw_sha256": "b2579aabbdc60d67e5b964ae2b9d818e9c7fb5550c5abd80fac3ca15c2844613",
      "lf_sha256": "b2579aabbdc60d67e5b964ae2b9d818e9c7fb5550c5abd80fac3ca15c2844613",
      "source_text": "s_{y}(u)=\\Bigl\\{\\frac{1}{2}\\nabla V((y+u)/2)-\\frac{y-u}{4\\eta}\\Bigr\\}-\\nabla V((y+u)/2)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1064906-1066400",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1064906,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1066400,
      "raw_sha256": "7a64179f29a616371e47ff49f503724c6cb7e872f301d07a855b2106b2e5b4bc",
      "lf_sha256": "7a64179f29a616371e47ff49f503724c6cb7e872f301d07a855b2106b2e5b4bc",
      "source_text": "s_{y}(u)=\\Bigl\\{\\frac{1}{2}\\nabla V((y+u)/2)-\\frac{y-u}{4\\eta}\\Bigr\\}-\\nabla V((y+u)/2)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p8.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1066418,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1067369,
      "raw_sha256": "cbe2389fd25c618e512a3c4bcf55dcd3d3814f9fe5f9613f0626288585462ed2",
      "lf_sha256": "cbe2389fd25c618e512a3c4bcf55dcd3d3814f9fe5f9613f0626288585462ed2",
      "source_text": "To rewrite ( C.1 ) in the claimed form, we only need to identify the covariance generated by the vector in braces. Integration by parts in u against the conditional density p_{y} gives"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.E9",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1067370,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1069516,
      "raw_sha256": "443ae429fe07399ce3f808e46bd37a7ce6485a22b34d4943a5158e45e0995552",
      "lf_sha256": "443ae429fe07399ce3f808e46bd37a7ce6485a22b34d4943a5158e45e0995552",
      "source_text": "\\mathbb{E}[\\nabla f(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}=y]=\\mathbb{E}\\Bigl[f(Y_{-})\\,\\Bigl\\{\\frac{1}{2}\\nabla V(X)-\\frac{y-Y_{-}}{4\\eta}\\Bigr\\}\\ \\Bigm|\\ Y_{+}=y\\Bigr]\\,. (C.9)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1067432-1069499",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1067432,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1069499,
      "raw_sha256": "e1ea574c91bb80c57b54758d9127185b9f1b443222918bf2e433d2c8db3bfad2",
      "lf_sha256": "e1ea574c91bb80c57b54758d9127185b9f1b443222918bf2e433d2c8db3bfad2",
      "source_text": "\\mathbb{E}[\\nabla f(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}=y]=\\mathbb{E}\\Bigl[f(Y_{-})\\,\\Bigl\\{\\frac{1}{2}\\nabla V(X)-\\frac{y-Y_{-}}{4\\eta}\\Bigr\\}\\ \\Bigm|\\ Y_{+}=y\\Bigr]\\,. (C.9)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p8.4",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1069517,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1070390,
      "raw_sha256": "4d6278e96e463f7a8e4c509a253350e43533021620ac3257461f9dcd4a0f118b",
      "lf_sha256": "4d6278e96e463f7a8e4c509a253350e43533021620ac3257461f9dcd4a0f118b",
      "source_text": "Applying ( C.9 ) to f\\equiv 1 , justified by compactly supported cutoffs converging to 1 , gives"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex16",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1070391,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1071721,
      "raw_sha256": "646e1228195166aedc987c277da3f2aa715ff8cccdb471864de70fdb5896a90c",
      "lf_sha256": "646e1228195166aedc987c277da3f2aa715ff8cccdb471864de70fdb5896a90c",
      "source_text": "\\mathbb{E}\\Bigl[\\frac{1}{2}\\nabla V(X)-\\frac{y-Y_{-}}{4\\eta}\\,\\Bigm|\\,Y_{+}=y\\Bigr]=0\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1070455-1071704",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1070455,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1071704,
      "raw_sha256": "36922c443fe35cd7659a237195187d734dfe7523d20333d97ee4ac7fb5546ebd",
      "lf_sha256": "36922c443fe35cd7659a237195187d734dfe7523d20333d97ee4ac7fb5546ebd",
      "source_text": "\\mathbb{E}\\Bigl[\\frac{1}{2}\\nabla V(X)-\\frac{y-Y_{-}}{4\\eta}\\,\\Bigm|\\,Y_{+}=y\\Bigr]=0\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p8.5",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1071722,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1072132,
      "raw_sha256": "ab061a8379d0c280a2577948dbe9074625e1ea7799dbff915449791e3570990d",
      "lf_sha256": "ab061a8379d0c280a2577948dbe9074625e1ea7799dbff915449791e3570990d",
      "source_text": "Combining this with ( C.9 ), we obtain"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1072230-1074717",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1072230,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1074717,
      "raw_sha256": "73ca597d372e1634ea6d4f716ee686b54f1e5afc0580c828348240a143cfdd5f",
      "lf_sha256": "73ca597d372e1634ea6d4f716ee686b54f1e5afc0580c828348240a143cfdd5f",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f(y) \\displaystyle=\\mathrm{Cov}\\Bigl(f(Y_{-}),\\frac{1}{2}\\nabla V(X)-\\frac{y-Y_{-}}{4\\eta}\\,\\Bigm|\\,Y_{+}=y\\Bigr)-\\mathrm{Cov}(f(Y_{-}),\\nabla V(X)\\mid Y_{+}=y)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1074746-1076894",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1074746,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1076894,
      "raw_sha256": "c0cfe960bd1dd8b5b9bba620f5faaa0e362ce41f3639d811918fae359f7acee2",
      "lf_sha256": "c0cfe960bd1dd8b5b9bba620f5faaa0e362ce41f3639d811918fae359f7acee2",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle=\\mathbb{E}\\Bigl[f(Y_{-})\\,\\Bigl\\{\\frac{1}{2}\\nabla V(X)-\\frac{y-Y_{-}}{4\\eta}\\Bigr\\}\\,\\Bigm|\\,Y_{+}=y\\Bigr]-\\mathrm{Cov}(f(Y_{-}),\\nabla V(X)\\mid Y_{+}=y)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1076923-1078660",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1076923,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1078660,
      "raw_sha256": "264e612367d8e585cf446467391b642dc24f084621caefc6ad7406aba58a3046",
      "lf_sha256": "264e612367d8e585cf446467391b642dc24f084621caefc6ad7406aba58a3046",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle=\\mathbb{E}[\\nabla f(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}=y]-\\mathrm{Cov}(f(Y_{-}),\\nabla V(X)\\mid Y_{+}=y)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p8.6",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1078678,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1079304,
      "raw_sha256": "9844704eb25922c96f6e88dfd8e697cc76d5f44a824263fe47ae2d1a32570c2c",
      "lf_sha256": "9844704eb25922c96f6e88dfd8e697cc76d5f44a824263fe47ae2d1a32570c2c",
      "source_text": "This is ( C.8 ) for smooth f ."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p9.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1079350,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1081809,
      "raw_sha256": "6af4fa8f23bbae53148753f073716da0925784e0ca9fcb6ddfd5a3b469f410b2",
      "lf_sha256": "6af4fa8f23bbae53148753f073716da0925784e0ca9fcb6ddfd5a3b469f410b2",
      "source_text": "The extension to H^{1}(\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}) is a standard approximation argument once we check that the covariance term is continuous in L^{2} . By ( 2.11 ), the conditional law of X given Y_{+}=y has Poincaré constant at most \\eta/(1+\\alpha\\eta)\\leq\\eta . Hence, for every unit vector a\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d} ,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex20",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1081810,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1083453,
      "raw_sha256": "a8f8b66f674a113f7f3fb3f5e4f87c037ffebdff62b4ebb47292241fea57aa71",
      "lf_sha256": "a8f8b66f674a113f7f3fb3f5e4f87c037ffebdff62b4ebb47292241fea57aa71",
      "source_text": "\\Var(a^{\\top}\\nabla V(X)\\mid Y_{+}=y)\\leq\\eta\\,\\mathbb{E}[\\|\\nabla^{2}V(X)\\,a\\|^{2}\\mid Y_{+}=y]\\leq\\beta^{2}\\eta\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1081874-1083436",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1081874,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1083436,
      "raw_sha256": "659369b3543715d8c0f3d5a199e29e4bf9c40c3aff373e736af97bde872511cd",
      "lf_sha256": "659369b3543715d8c0f3d5a199e29e4bf9c40c3aff373e736af97bde872511cd",
      "source_text": "\\Var(a^{\\top}\\nabla V(X)\\mid Y_{+}=y)\\leq\\eta\\,\\mathbb{E}[\\|\\nabla^{2}V(X)\\,a\\|^{2}\\mid Y_{+}=y]\\leq\\beta^{2}\\eta\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p9.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1083454,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1083921,
      "raw_sha256": "bf2902fc6270c74948d9986c3c55c589094e75e5d5201d2a3d90dcc419ce35a0",
      "lf_sha256": "bf2902fc6270c74948d9986c3c55c589094e75e5d5201d2a3d90dcc419ce35a0",
      "source_text": "Conditional Cauchy–Schwarz and ( B.9 ) therefore imply"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex21",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1083922,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1085764,
      "raw_sha256": "8bbb2c0e6ee209cfe68a82892b05734f385cc5b34e75b5d8e37e23e9added348",
      "lf_sha256": "8bbb2c0e6ee209cfe68a82892b05734f385cc5b34e75b5d8e37e23e9added348",
      "source_text": "\\bigl\\|\\mathrm{Cov}(f(Y_{-}),\\nabla V(X)\\mid Y_{+})\\bigr\\|_{L^{2}}\\leq\\beta\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\|\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}f\\|\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1083986-1085747",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1083986,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1085747,
      "raw_sha256": "0e73948ee9e647602323d14cfc9396704420230e846a7525f5c8f8fa936ca127",
      "lf_sha256": "0e73948ee9e647602323d14cfc9396704420230e846a7525f5c8f8fa936ca127",
      "source_text": "\\bigl\\|\\mathrm{Cov}(f(Y_{-}),\\nabla V(X)\\mid Y_{+})\\bigr\\|_{L^{2}}\\leq\\beta\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\|\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}f\\|\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS1.p9.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "C.5-C.7 uniform negative-spectrum/Gamma-gap or C.8-C.9 derivative/weak-H1 extension lane; independent of marginal PI C.3 and norm C.4.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1085765,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1088089,
      "raw_sha256": "0f412bfd29098492e56658e1c4e22b9fc5c2324786c0b493479ff775a098a696",
      "lf_sha256": "0f412bfd29098492e56658e1c4e22b9fc5c2324786c0b493479ff775a098a696",
      "source_text": "and the same bound applies to differences. Conditional expectation is an L^{2} contraction, and ( B.13 ) controls the left side. Thus every term in ( C.8 ) is continuous under H^{1} approximation. Density of C_{\\rm c}^{\\infty}(\\mathbb{R}^{d}) in H^{1}(\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}) completes the proof. ∎"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p1.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1088342,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1089161,
      "raw_sha256": "ce878ee76e00cf70d87b3b347de72c47b44292df9c9730acd6c32b90938bcf78",
      "lf_sha256": "ce878ee76e00cf70d87b3b347de72c47b44292df9c9730acd6c32b90938bcf78",
      "source_text": "This subsection establishes a conditional half-turn estimate for affine observables. After rescaling X-y by the Gaussian scale \\sqrt{\\eta} , we show that the half-turn nearly maps every affine function with mean zero to its negative. The proof combines a Duhamel representation of the half-turn with covariance identities for the rescaled conditional law."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p2.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1089207,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1090490,
      "raw_sha256": "5f050fcfc407e98f3dafb2dc4152efea97f4bc0632c3a4f69f867d6e44361668",
      "lf_sha256": "5f050fcfc407e98f3dafb2dc4152efea97f4bc0632c3a4f69f867d6e44361668",
      "source_text": "In Section C.3 , this estimate will be applied to the conditional affine part of \\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}w in the proof of Proposition B.2 ."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p3.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1090536,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1091822,
      "raw_sha256": "698c4913986df4108e419e8c0e4d1583edb319eee9a138380becd2c834dc802d",
      "lf_sha256": "698c4913986df4108e419e8c0e4d1583edb319eee9a138380becd2c834dc802d",
      "source_text": "We first fix y\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d} and work under the conditional law of X given Y=y . The bounds below are uniform in y and will later be integrated over y . To put the Gaussian confinement and harmonic dynamics on unit scale, set"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex22",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1091823,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1092963,
      "raw_sha256": "1fecb191679f2889cc16896aae4b55d2c90d3dc405a1c8f5f5f0b1d62ba364ec",
      "lf_sha256": "1fecb191679f2889cc16896aae4b55d2c90d3dc405a1c8f5f5f0b1d62ba364ec",
      "source_text": "W\\coloneqq\\frac{X-y}{\\sqrt{\\eta}}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003ptq_{y}\\coloneqq\\Law(W\\mid Y=y)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1091887-1092946",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1091887,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1092946,
      "raw_sha256": "62b149420a8f63f72b7cc534b6eca9d1148ad2e196d430428630f8241e8471db",
      "lf_sha256": "62b149420a8f63f72b7cc534b6eca9d1148ad2e196d430428630f8241e8471db",
      "source_text": "W\\coloneqq\\frac{X-y}{\\sqrt{\\eta}}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003ptq_{y}\\coloneqq\\Law(W\\mid Y=y)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p3.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1092964,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1093269,
      "raw_sha256": "5724fd6f6b3720f7d70e57dcb38c64dc34a87405456d581ffa526a7b6d263a28",
      "lf_sha256": "5724fd6f6b3720f7d70e57dcb38c64dc34a87405456d581ffa526a7b6d263a28",
      "source_text": "The density of q_{y} and the scaled potential gradient are"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex23",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1093270,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1095109,
      "raw_sha256": "4c4af7f811fa8611b7aaf8ef5c56ea4752c70c13b5fa35dd6c5f1a50fa77bad3",
      "lf_sha256": "4c4af7f811fa8611b7aaf8ef5c56ea4752c70c13b5fa35dd6c5f1a50fa77bad3",
      "source_text": "q_{y}(\\mathrm{d}w)\\propto\\exp\\Bigl\\{-V(y+\\sqrt{\\eta}w)-\\frac{1}{2}\\|w\\|^{2}\\Bigr\\}\\,\\mathrm{d}w\\,,\\hskip 20.00003ptg_{y}(w)\\coloneqq\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\nabla V(y+\\sqrt{\\eta}w)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1093334-1095092",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1093334,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1095092,
      "raw_sha256": "ac3491bd8a84dbac11a323d10bc037ad20c356bf83591988387a55c1a84f9dd2",
      "lf_sha256": "ac3491bd8a84dbac11a323d10bc037ad20c356bf83591988387a55c1a84f9dd2",
      "source_text": "q_{y}(\\mathrm{d}w)\\propto\\exp\\Bigl\\{-V(y+\\sqrt{\\eta}w)-\\frac{1}{2}\\|w\\|^{2}\\Bigr\\}\\,\\mathrm{d}w\\,,\\hskip 20.00003ptg_{y}(w)\\coloneqq\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\nabla V(y+\\sqrt{\\eta}w)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p3.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1095110,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1095721,
      "raw_sha256": "8648c30526511944e8a07a15ba1ba45c67b4404b621a43041b7e6048cf91125e",
      "lf_sha256": "8648c30526511944e8a07a15ba1ba45c67b4404b621a43041b7e6048cf91125e",
      "source_text": "Thus, the negative log-density of q_{y} has Hessian I+\\nabla g_{y} , and"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.E10",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1095722,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1097705,
      "raw_sha256": "12a1a3ecda7195f102406879a047e6d6c13295e323703e9cc75ef00f2ba9e1d4",
      "lf_sha256": "12a1a3ecda7195f102406879a047e6d6c13295e323703e9cc75ef00f2ba9e1d4",
      "source_text": "\\nabla\\log q_{y}(w)=-(w+g_{y}(w))\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\alpha\\eta I\\preceq\\nabla g_{y}(w)\\preceq\\beta\\eta I\\,. (C.10)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1095785-1097688",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1095785,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1097688,
      "raw_sha256": "56c0de798a9c4a0ec4421a51f94d412ad89059c4afdb307c49fd03840976cc84",
      "lf_sha256": "56c0de798a9c4a0ec4421a51f94d412ad89059c4afdb307c49fd03840976cc84",
      "source_text": "\\nabla\\log q_{y}(w)=-(w+g_{y}(w))\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\alpha\\eta I\\preceq\\nabla g_{y}(w)\\preceq\\beta\\eta I\\,. (C.10)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p3.4",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1097706,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1098917,
      "raw_sha256": "96b714e298e2d77afd84e9ca031386d2db15a0b80dc7f14cf1cc53c28962af14",
      "lf_sha256": "96b714e298e2d77afd84e9ca031386d2db15a0b80dc7f14cf1cc53c28962af14",
      "source_text": "In particular, q_{y} is 1 -strongly log-concave. We use the same symbol \\mathsf{H}_{y} for the conditional half-turn operator in the normalized coordinate w=(x-y)/\\sqrt{\\eta} :"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex24",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1098918,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1100841,
      "raw_sha256": "2a92ddf2394f252e2bc370d4d007f2909ca849e2a3dec1390b1d3bdeb1c1b2c0",
      "lf_sha256": "2a92ddf2394f252e2bc370d4d007f2909ca849e2a3dec1390b1d3bdeb1c1b2c0",
      "source_text": "(\\mathsf{H}_{y}f)(w)\\coloneqq\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^{d}}f\\Bigl(\\frac{x^{\\prime}-y}{\\sqrt{\\eta}}\\Bigr)\\,\\mathcal{H}_{y}(y+\\sqrt{\\eta}w,\\mathrm{d}x^{\\prime})\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1098982-1100824",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1098982,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1100824,
      "raw_sha256": "6af7f7a216a990e6b9ed543e799f18aec6a04989af4cd2e2e8352d743b031857",
      "lf_sha256": "6af7f7a216a990e6b9ed543e799f18aec6a04989af4cd2e2e8352d743b031857",
      "source_text": "(\\mathsf{H}_{y}f)(w)\\coloneqq\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^{d}}f\\Bigl(\\frac{x^{\\prime}-y}{\\sqrt{\\eta}}\\Bigr)\\,\\mathcal{H}_{y}(y+\\sqrt{\\eta}w,\\mathrm{d}x^{\\prime})\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p3.5",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1100842,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1101954,
      "raw_sha256": "ceccf23e3a791efce36233d7edbcd58c6484e23212e1741bdf7e27f8a07586a6",
      "lf_sha256": "ceccf23e3a791efce36233d7edbcd58c6484e23212e1741bdf7e27f8a07586a6",
      "source_text": "By Proposition 3.2 , \\mathsf{H}_{y} is a self-adjoint Markov contraction on L^{2}(q_{y}) ."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p4.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1102000,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1102041,
      "raw_sha256": "850055f98d126a8b63f8a6b0723e56341fbbe021dc89762a593fe2b21bba17d3",
      "lf_sha256": "850055f98d126a8b63f8a6b0723e56341fbbe021dc89762a593fe2b21bba17d3",
      "source_text": "Put"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex25",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1102042,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1103317,
      "raw_sha256": "64c9db27607fc55586d9d9e7bd6669377b0223f7d844e8ff247cccbbc99262b5",
      "lf_sha256": "64c9db27607fc55586d9d9e7bd6669377b0223f7d844e8ff247cccbbc99262b5",
      "source_text": "\\bar{w}_{y}\\coloneqq\\mathbb{E}_{q_{y}}W\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\Sigma_{y}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Cov}_{q_{y}}(W)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1102106-1103300",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1102106,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1103300,
      "raw_sha256": "42a2457f70606078a6c37048ace0c62aff9c84a142e39bddd333b1783fb8a192",
      "lf_sha256": "42a2457f70606078a6c37048ace0c62aff9c84a142e39bddd333b1783fb8a192",
      "source_text": "\\bar{w}_{y}\\coloneqq\\mathbb{E}_{q_{y}}W\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\Sigma_{y}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Cov}_{q_{y}}(W)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p4.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1103318,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1104313,
      "raw_sha256": "971163da19005d5709e3f17a13ec7b5a3f76762ac8ae8598d81e6bca27008667",
      "lf_sha256": "971163da19005d5709e3f17a13ec7b5a3f76762ac8ae8598d81e6bca27008667",
      "source_text": "Thus, \\Sigma_{y} is the conditional covariance in the normalized coordinate; equivalently, we have the identity \\mathrm{Cov}(X\\mid Y=y)=\\eta\\Sigma_{y} . Accordingly,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex26",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1104314,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1105296,
      "raw_sha256": "669a4d73c4bf66f89fd9847ec00b269fffa3fa842753b3c7355852626712bcc7",
      "lf_sha256": "669a4d73c4bf66f89fd9847ec00b269fffa3fa842753b3c7355852626712bcc7",
      "source_text": "I-\\Sigma_{y}=\\eta\\nabla^{2}U_{\\eta}(y)\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1104378-1105279",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1104378,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1105279,
      "raw_sha256": "6b3f389ad9d6961e08649bd1ecb908d97bbd3e60c60c0e7af3a03fe1c94d6d7d",
      "lf_sha256": "6b3f389ad9d6961e08649bd1ecb908d97bbd3e60c60c0e7af3a03fe1c94d6d7d",
      "source_text": "I-\\Sigma_{y}=\\eta\\nabla^{2}U_{\\eta}(y)\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p4.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1105297,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1107531,
      "raw_sha256": "06603cc709c6298f900cba32cfa201896beab7cd016cf689f765a96e87b972f1",
      "lf_sha256": "06603cc709c6298f900cba32cfa201896beab7cd016cf689f765a96e87b972f1",
      "source_text": "by ( D.10 ). Thus I-\\Sigma_{y} is both the covariance defect relative to a standard Gaussian and the normalized curvature of the Y -marginal. For a\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d} , write \\ell_{a,y}:w\\mapsto a^{\\top}(w-\\bar{w}_{y}) ; this affine function has mean zero under q_{y} ."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p5.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1107577,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1107676,
      "raw_sha256": "e4188521e0e72722a641c96325c686b859fbfa3d0a20c66dbeef431956a263ca",
      "lf_sha256": "e4188521e0e72722a641c96325c686b859fbfa3d0a20c66dbeef431956a263ca",
      "source_text": "The main result of this subsection is the following estimate."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Thmtheorem2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "source-statement",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1107684,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1116606,
      "raw_sha256": "b8ada070dd8b73cbc18c782f0de7e30c2ed149070cba447b31509e7e604b6030",
      "lf_sha256": "b8ada070dd8b73cbc18c782f0de7e30c2ed149070cba447b31509e7e604b6030",
      "source_text": "Proposition C.2 (Weighted half-turn estimate for affine functions) . Assume \\beta\\eta\\leq 1/2 . Uniformly in y , every \\ell_{a,y}:w\\mapsto a^{\\top}(w-\\bar{w}_{y}) satisfies \\|(I+\\mathsf{H}_{y})\\ell_{a,y}\\|_{L^{2}(q_{y})}^{2}\\leq C\\beta\\eta\\,a^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a\\,. (C.11) More generally, suppose that y\\mapsto a_{y} is measurable and \\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)<\\infty , and define \\ell(x,y)\\coloneqq a_{y}^{\\top}\\Bigl(\\frac{x-y}{\\sqrt{\\eta}}-\\bar{w}_{y}\\Bigr)\\,. Then, \\ell\\in\\mathfrak{H}_{\\perp} and \\|(I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp})\\ell\\|^{2}\\leq C\\beta\\eta\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Thmtheorem2.p1.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1108166,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1109613,
      "raw_sha256": "cd3bb0f8380e89cccc0fd067f73eadf485609746533d1826441ba54a3ae62870",
      "lf_sha256": "cd3bb0f8380e89cccc0fd067f73eadf485609746533d1826441ba54a3ae62870",
      "source_text": "Assume \\beta\\eta\\leq 1/2 . Uniformly in y , every \\ell_{a,y}:w\\mapsto a^{\\top}(w-\\bar{w}_{y}) satisfies"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.E11",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1109614,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1111490,
      "raw_sha256": "5727c82d4688ad0cc896b6a051a9be5555723a40bd0be46372e769f199563c24",
      "lf_sha256": "5727c82d4688ad0cc896b6a051a9be5555723a40bd0be46372e769f199563c24",
      "source_text": "\\|(I+\\mathsf{H}_{y})\\ell_{a,y}\\|_{L^{2}(q_{y})}^{2}\\leq C\\beta\\eta\\,a^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a\\,. (C.11)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1109677-1111473",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1109677,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1111473,
      "raw_sha256": "fba1de0e96e0c73b6e0f8afd09cf35cc43818f4ce98704cafd1bcdc967bfe22e",
      "lf_sha256": "fba1de0e96e0c73b6e0f8afd09cf35cc43818f4ce98704cafd1bcdc967bfe22e",
      "source_text": "\\|(I+\\mathsf{H}_{y})\\ell_{a,y}\\|_{L^{2}(q_{y})}^{2}\\leq C\\beta\\eta\\,a^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a\\,. (C.11)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Thmtheorem2.p1.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1111491,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1112961,
      "raw_sha256": "436732168e5c7e3f2a320c1b08402e74983f594e3ca02962c1b842df08b4f1ba",
      "lf_sha256": "436732168e5c7e3f2a320c1b08402e74983f594e3ca02962c1b842df08b4f1ba",
      "source_text": "More generally, suppose that y\\mapsto a_{y} is measurable and \\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)<\\infty , and define"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex27",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1112962,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1114221,
      "raw_sha256": "6c719274655c2c2710deab7687a9fce804d25b17690faa7537cd48528a776a24",
      "lf_sha256": "6c719274655c2c2710deab7687a9fce804d25b17690faa7537cd48528a776a24",
      "source_text": "\\ell(x,y)\\coloneqq a_{y}^{\\top}\\Bigl(\\frac{x-y}{\\sqrt{\\eta}}-\\bar{w}_{y}\\Bigr)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1113026-1114204",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1113026,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1114204,
      "raw_sha256": "1b44f0b07423d7097f5c5575a936e4ade1058fde1e37f2fef1d634f0cc1dd172",
      "lf_sha256": "1b44f0b07423d7097f5c5575a936e4ade1058fde1e37f2fef1d634f0cc1dd172",
      "source_text": "\\ell(x,y)\\coloneqq a_{y}^{\\top}\\Bigl(\\frac{x-y}{\\sqrt{\\eta}}-\\bar{w}_{y}\\Bigr)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Thmtheorem2.p1.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1114222,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1114679,
      "raw_sha256": "e86e53078decaf8449ac89aec303ef528b89060562ea5da1ea786f9f17fde342",
      "lf_sha256": "e86e53078decaf8449ac89aec303ef528b89060562ea5da1ea786f9f17fde342",
      "source_text": "Then, \\ell\\in\\mathfrak{H}_{\\perp} and"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex28",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1114680,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1116592,
      "raw_sha256": "3cd0a37ed4d9a3c643375187712f03f132503069698f7ede018ceae3daf43a3b",
      "lf_sha256": "3cd0a37ed4d9a3c643375187712f03f132503069698f7ede018ceae3daf43a3b",
      "source_text": "\\|(I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp})\\ell\\|^{2}\\leq C\\beta\\eta\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1114744-1116575",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1114744,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1116575,
      "raw_sha256": "1cd8875864eed7f952b45e67c0ba50ccd4962a414349eed593d56649e48abc4a",
      "lf_sha256": "1cd8875864eed7f952b45e67c0ba50ccd4962a414349eed593d56649e48abc4a",
      "source_text": "\\|(I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp})\\ell\\|^{2}\\leq C\\beta\\eta\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p6.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1116645,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1117158,
      "raw_sha256": "2048755fdae2ef1f4bd9ab54259b4010975f0e7925820d8f647ffdc83bfc4c14",
      "lf_sha256": "2048755fdae2ef1f4bd9ab54259b4010975f0e7925820d8f647ffdc83bfc4c14",
      "source_text": "We prove the proposition after two preparatory results. The first gives a Duhamel representation of the deviation from exact sign reversal; the second bounds the resulting term in terms of I-\\Sigma_{y} ."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p7.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1117204,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1118102,
      "raw_sha256": "5cf88b2dccbf46e3d78ccf0f969dd7881c4b2fbaad55f8d90b5b13ad0cf1a4b7",
      "lf_sha256": "5cf88b2dccbf46e3d78ccf0f969dd7881c4b2fbaad55f8d90b5b13ad0cf1a4b7",
      "source_text": "To analyze \\mathsf{H}_{y}\\ell_{a,y} , first fix a reference point \\widetilde{w}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d} in the rescaled coordinate. The resulting phase-space process is"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex29",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1118103,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1121206,
      "raw_sha256": "1546d338fb252bdc9e78a5400f7c24eba804a0e28cc262b94cbf5bd2298c9159",
      "lf_sha256": "1546d338fb252bdc9e78a5400f7c24eba804a0e28cc262b94cbf5bd2298c9159",
      "source_text": "\\begin{gathered}\\dot{w}=p\\,,\\qquad\\dot{p}=-\\{w+g_{y}(\\widetilde{w})\\}\\,,\\\\ \\text{event rate }[p^{\\top}\\{g_{y}(w)-g_{y}(\\widetilde{w})\\}]_{+}\\,,\\\\ p\\longmapsto R_{g_{y}(w)-g_{y}(\\widetilde{w})}p\\quad\\text{at a bounce}\\,.\\end{gathered}"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1118167-1121189",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1118167,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1121189,
      "raw_sha256": "002f38b615294aeb3dac530a4e660deb8536888f60d994e95cab65002dc0e422",
      "lf_sha256": "002f38b615294aeb3dac530a4e660deb8536888f60d994e95cab65002dc0e422",
      "source_text": "\\begin{gathered}\\dot{w}=p\\,,\\qquad\\dot{p}=-\\{w+g_{y}(\\widetilde{w})\\}\\,,\\\\ \\text{event rate }[p^{\\top}\\{g_{y}(w)-g_{y}(\\widetilde{w})\\}]_{+}\\,,\\\\ p\\longmapsto R_{g_{y}(w)-g_{y}(\\widetilde{w})}p\\quad\\text{at a bounce}\\,.\\end{gathered}"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p7.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1121207,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1122753,
      "raw_sha256": "1a2a71b8a3173a90011c14a57906091c1b610b53660ac1292fdd2ee7054d7af6",
      "lf_sha256": "1a2a71b8a3173a90011c14a57906091c1b610b53660ac1292fdd2ee7054d7af6",
      "source_text": "The construction and path reversal arguments of Appendix A apply verbatim, with phase space law q_{y}\\otimes\\mathcal{N}(0,I) . Denote the resulting strongly continuous contraction semigroup by (\\mathsf{T}_{t}^{y,\\widetilde{w}})_{t\\geq 0} . On smooth compactly supported observables, its generator is"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex30",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1122754,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1127051,
      "raw_sha256": "37c2f9f988b1826361c68539154536080ae280edd5577b4cb2e5412e726ca79f",
      "lf_sha256": "37c2f9f988b1826361c68539154536080ae280edd5577b4cb2e5412e726ca79f",
      "source_text": "\\begin{split}\\mathsf{L}_{y,\\widetilde{w}}f(w,p)&\\coloneqq p^{\\top}\\nabla_{w}f(w,p)-\\{w+g_{y}(\\widetilde{w})\\}^{\\top}\\nabla_{p}f(w,p)\\\\ &\\qquad{}+[p^{\\top}\\{g_{y}(w)-g_{y}(\\widetilde{w})\\}]_{+}\\bigl\\{f(w,R_{g_{y}(w)-g_{y}(\\widetilde{w})}p)-f(w,p)\\bigr\\}\\,.\\end{split}"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1122818-1127034",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1122818,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1127034,
      "raw_sha256": "6a0f0ee18ee45b74b53cbdff0d3304f3665cade6a3746b26873a8a2c4ac5bbd3",
      "lf_sha256": "6a0f0ee18ee45b74b53cbdff0d3304f3665cade6a3746b26873a8a2c4ac5bbd3",
      "source_text": "\\begin{split}\\mathsf{L}_{y,\\widetilde{w}}f(w,p)&\\coloneqq p^{\\top}\\nabla_{w}f(w,p)-\\{w+g_{y}(\\widetilde{w})\\}^{\\top}\\nabla_{p}f(w,p)\\\\ &\\qquad{}+[p^{\\top}\\{g_{y}(w)-g_{y}(\\widetilde{w})\\}]_{+}\\bigl\\{f(w,R_{g_{y}(w)-g_{y}(\\widetilde{w})}p)-f(w,p)\\bigr\\}\\,.\\end{split}"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p7.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1127052,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1128260,
      "raw_sha256": "7d63012c6af85bac24f593702072aa9d32a1624f9ab2455fe6c59336ee21e0d3",
      "lf_sha256": "7d63012c6af85bac24f593702072aa9d32a1624f9ab2455fe6c59336ee21e0d3",
      "source_text": "The operator \\mathsf{H}_{y} is recovered by drawing \\widetilde{W}\\sim q_{y} , running the corresponding process for time \\pi , and averaging over \\widetilde{W} and the initial Gaussian momentum."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p8.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1128306,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1129453,
      "raw_sha256": "792a4c4efcb9f1495379159913265be6e370dee7223f8e69c8f1bed1afe3d746",
      "lf_sha256": "792a4c4efcb9f1495379159913265be6e370dee7223f8e69c8f1bed1afe3d746",
      "source_text": "If g_{y}\\equiv 0 , then q_{y}=\\mathcal{N}(0,I) , \\bar{w}_{y}=0 , and the bounce rate vanishes. The dynamics reduce to harmonic motion,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex31",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1129454,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1130973,
      "raw_sha256": "7a5abe614ae2c40faabfd94fd22072f1687f3ac56da65b72a99a9f67e6a8b43d",
      "lf_sha256": "7a5abe614ae2c40faabfd94fd22072f1687f3ac56da65b72a99a9f67e6a8b43d",
      "source_text": "w_{t}=w_{0}\\cos t+p_{0}\\sin t\\,,\\hskip 20.00003ptp_{t}=-w_{0}\\sin t+p_{0}\\cos t\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1129518-1130956",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1129518,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1130956,
      "raw_sha256": "41d91a29a7528acfd29f984f8296d6c1f61baf27345464e685181cbd401d23f5",
      "lf_sha256": "41d91a29a7528acfd29f984f8296d6c1f61baf27345464e685181cbd401d23f5",
      "source_text": "w_{t}=w_{0}\\cos t+p_{0}\\sin t\\,,\\hskip 20.00003ptp_{t}=-w_{0}\\sin t+p_{0}\\cos t\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p8.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1130974,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1132948,
      "raw_sha256": "cf0bb0049786165c26ea4628e01c21df1d42936a5c9f26f9fe899fcb5da7eeaf",
      "lf_sha256": "cf0bb0049786165c26ea4628e01c21df1d42936a5c9f26f9fe899fcb5da7eeaf",
      "source_text": "so \\ell_{a,y}(w_{\\pi})=-\\ell_{a,y}(w_{0}) . For general g_{y} , the discrepancy between the harmonic center -g_{y}(\\widetilde{w}) and the conditional mean \\bar{w}_{y} , together with the residual gradient bounces, produces an inhomogeneous term. The next lemma identifies this term."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Thmtheorem3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "source-statement",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1132956,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1144822,
      "raw_sha256": "f73cfb628fb75b973b8412dab6f0c4feeac3ba87b97e932a7fbca57dce181aa7",
      "lf_sha256": "f73cfb628fb75b973b8412dab6f0c4feeac3ba87b97e932a7fbca57dce181aa7",
      "source_text": "Lemma C.3 (Affine Duhamel formula) . For a\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d} and \\widetilde{w}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d} , set k_{a,\\widetilde{w}}(w,p)\\coloneqq-a^{\\top}\\{\\bar{w}_{y}+g_{y}(\\widetilde{w})\\}-2\\,[p^{\\top}\\{g_{y}(w)-g_{y}(\\widetilde{w})\\}]_{+}^{2}\\,\\frac{a^{\\top}\\{g_{y}(w)-g_{y}(\\widetilde{w})\\}}{\\|g_{y}(w)-g_{y}(\\widetilde{w})\\|^{2}}\\,, where the quotient is defined as zero when g_{y}(w)=g_{y}(\\widetilde{w}) . Then k_{a,\\widetilde{w}}\\in L^{2}(q_{y}\\otimes\\mathcal{N}(0,I)) , and for every t\\geq 0 , \\mathsf{T}_{t}^{y,\\widetilde{w}}\\ell_{a,y}=\\ell_{a,y}\\cos t+a^{\\top}p\\sin t+\\int_{0}^{t}\\mathsf{T}_{s}^{y,\\widetilde{w}}k_{a,\\widetilde{w}}\\sin(t-s)\\,\\mathrm{d}s in L^{2}(q_{y}\\otimes\\mathcal{N}(0,I)) . In particular, (I+\\mathsf{T}_{\\pi}^{y,\\widetilde{w}})\\ell_{a,y}=\\int_{0}^{\\pi}\\mathsf{T}_{s}^{y,\\widetilde{w}}k_{a,\\widetilde{w}}\\sin s\\,\\mathrm{d}s\\,. (C.12)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Thmtheorem3.p1.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1133400,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1134185,
      "raw_sha256": "822c1d6abe8d45f7e156e2133feef146e8a46b03c38543e8abc6028e3a37d344",
      "lf_sha256": "822c1d6abe8d45f7e156e2133feef146e8a46b03c38543e8abc6028e3a37d344",
      "source_text": "For a\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d} and \\widetilde{w}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d} , set"
    },
