      "source_text": "where the quotient is defined as zero when g_{y}(w)=g_{y}(\\widetilde{w}) . Then k_{a,\\widetilde{w}}\\in L^{2}(q_{y}\\otimes\\mathcal{N}(0,I)) , and for every t\\geq 0 ,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex33",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1139851,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1142070,
      "raw_sha256": "964b2d9c0784e8bb336f03520be63fb2e5c7a313601e7443d0cd2fae592a1d38",
      "lf_sha256": "964b2d9c0784e8bb336f03520be63fb2e5c7a313601e7443d0cd2fae592a1d38",
      "source_text": "\\mathsf{T}_{t}^{y,\\widetilde{w}}\\ell_{a,y}=\\ell_{a,y}\\cos t+a^{\\top}p\\sin t+\\int_{0}^{t}\\mathsf{T}_{s}^{y,\\widetilde{w}}k_{a,\\widetilde{w}}\\sin(t-s)\\,\\mathrm{d}s"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1139915-1142053",
