      "lf_sha256": "649c892f97d2fc23fe27ae6462867c6db937ba114d365e4e9021eb5e9ae410ff",
      "source_text": "First, k_{a,\\widetilde{w}} is square integrable. Its first term is constant in (w,p) , while the absolute value of its second term is at most"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1148244-1152192",
