      "lf_sha256": "aa4c60ceab2b19ee503c3d9c32bb54bcfa8fb9df47fd928c129ed9e643a98c9a",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\mathsf{T}_{t}^{y,\\widetilde{w}}(a^{\\top}p)-a^{\\top}p \\displaystyle=\\int_{0}^{t}\\mathsf{T}_{s}^{y,\\widetilde{w}}(-\\ell_{a,y}+k_{a,\\widetilde{w}})\\,\\mathrm{d}s\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p11.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1169512,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1169662,
      "raw_sha256": "8c25bb4fbe4d85e7219b23a1afcbe6e27499341decb3fd3e222e1c5ffe386634",
      "lf_sha256": "8c25bb4fbe4d85e7219b23a1afcbe6e27499341decb3fd3e222e1c5ffe386634",
      "source_text": "Applying variation of constants to this integral system gives"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex39",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1169663,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1171928,
      "raw_sha256": "87632f4f2f1ce119ae55002aaf541e9af268dd2a6cef4b59e30f75d8cc039006",
      "lf_sha256": "87632f4f2f1ce119ae55002aaf541e9af268dd2a6cef4b59e30f75d8cc039006",
      "source_text": "\\mathsf{T}_{t}^{y,\\widetilde{w}}\\ell_{a,y}=\\ell_{a,y}\\cos t+a^{\\top}p\\sin t+\\int_{0}^{t}\\mathsf{T}_{s}^{y,\\widetilde{w}}k_{a,\\widetilde{w}}\\sin(t-s)\\,\\mathrm{d}s\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1169727-1171911",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1169727,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1171911,
      "raw_sha256": "03e6969f9093da752670c5a22e6c7d708966650091dfd2230e82d69595c6316d",
      "lf_sha256": "03e6969f9093da752670c5a22e6c7d708966650091dfd2230e82d69595c6316d",
      "source_text": "\\mathsf{T}_{t}^{y,\\widetilde{w}}\\ell_{a,y}=\\ell_{a,y}\\cos t+a^{\\top}p\\sin t+\\int_{0}^{t}\\mathsf{T}_{s}^{y,\\widetilde{w}}k_{a,\\widetilde{w}}\\sin(t-s)\\,\\mathrm{d}s\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p11.4",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1171929,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1173452,
      "raw_sha256": "7552f428e92c22adcbe5ac6d404d41a306e8ed797615fb07c82e623a5b2e99ad",
      "lf_sha256": "7552f428e92c22adcbe5ac6d404d41a306e8ed797615fb07c82e623a5b2e99ad",
      "source_text": "This is the first identity in the lemma. At t=\\pi , the homogeneous part is -\\ell_{a,y} and \\sin(\\pi-s)=\\sin s , which gives ( C.12 ). ∎"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p12.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1173506,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1174041,
      "raw_sha256": "63fe0b2c7e2c12d4dfe90c5a7c65bfe4b0c14ec6127670ef3fda989924a18ea7",
      "lf_sha256": "63fe0b2c7e2c12d4dfe90c5a7c65bfe4b0c14ec6127670ef3fda989924a18ea7",
      "source_text": "The proof of Proposition C.2 will also use the following identities and bounds."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Thmtheorem4",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "source-statement",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1174049,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1178512,
      "raw_sha256": "d50edbc36a327d7ad7437bcb4447bc34838538b16cc5469a846e6af6f3f4318f",
      "lf_sha256": "d50edbc36a327d7ad7437bcb4447bc34838538b16cc5469a846e6af6f3f4318f",
      "source_text": "Lemma C.4 (Conditional gradient covariance bound) . Fix y and assume \\beta\\eta\\leq 1/2 . Then \\mathbb{E}_{q_{y}}g_{y}(W)=-\\bar{w}_{y} , and \\mathrm{Cov}_{q_{y}}(W,g_{y}(W))=I-\\Sigma_{y}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\mathrm{Cov}_{q_{y}}(g_{y}(W))\\preceq\\frac{\\beta\\eta}{1-\\beta\\eta}\\,(I-\\Sigma_{y})\\preceq 2\\beta\\eta\\,(I-\\Sigma_{y})\\,. (C.13)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Thmtheorem4.p1.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1174508,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1175855,
      "raw_sha256": "0e49414ce8072efcbba3b8ad32cb2506f8df465aaf7f3e48dc0cfbbf8d0e8666",
      "lf_sha256": "0e49414ce8072efcbba3b8ad32cb2506f8df465aaf7f3e48dc0cfbbf8d0e8666",
      "source_text": "Fix y and assume \\beta\\eta\\leq 1/2 . Then \\mathbb{E}_{q_{y}}g_{y}(W)=-\\bar{w}_{y} , and"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.E13",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1175856,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1178498,
      "raw_sha256": "41596ae7a919371ade209d9ba1b44bc8c6d6449008fe9d65e1a003752075ec3c",
      "lf_sha256": "41596ae7a919371ade209d9ba1b44bc8c6d6449008fe9d65e1a003752075ec3c",
      "source_text": "\\mathrm{Cov}_{q_{y}}(W,g_{y}(W))=I-\\Sigma_{y}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\mathrm{Cov}_{q_{y}}(g_{y}(W))\\preceq\\frac{\\beta\\eta}{1-\\beta\\eta}\\,(I-\\Sigma_{y})\\preceq 2\\beta\\eta\\,(I-\\Sigma_{y})\\,. (C.13)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1175919-1178481",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1175919,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1178481,
      "raw_sha256": "b9ecb72659216cf6cb554f9437bb54c94fafe6c5ccebf034fd1d2f99076221cc",
      "lf_sha256": "b9ecb72659216cf6cb554f9437bb54c94fafe6c5ccebf034fd1d2f99076221cc",
      "source_text": "\\mathrm{Cov}_{q_{y}}(W,g_{y}(W))=I-\\Sigma_{y}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\mathrm{Cov}_{q_{y}}(g_{y}(W))\\preceq\\frac{\\beta\\eta}{1-\\beta\\eta}\\,(I-\\Sigma_{y})\\preceq 2\\beta\\eta\\,(I-\\Sigma_{y})\\,. (C.13)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "proof-container",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1178513,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1190086,
      "raw_sha256": "51737659faa22f05c0d9d5d86ab3fc1b00d18dac49f719b8c11634af7e95e92b",
      "lf_sha256": "51737659faa22f05c0d9d5d86ab3fc1b00d18dac49f719b8c11634af7e95e92b",
      "source_text": "Proof. Under Y_{+}=y , we have X=y+\\sqrt{\\eta}W and Y_{-}=y+2\\sqrt{\\eta}W . Applying ( C.9 ) to f:u\\mapsto F((u-y)/(2\\sqrt{\\eta})) therefore gives \\mathbb{E}_{q_{y}}\\nabla F(W)=\\mathbb{E}_{q_{y}}[F(W)\\,\\{W+g_{y}(W)\\}]\\,. Taking F\\equiv 1 and then the coordinate functions of W and g_{y}(W) , with the same cutoff approximation as in Lemma C.1 , gives \\mathbb{E}g_{y}(W)=-\\bar{w}_{y}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\mathrm{Cov}(W,g_{y}(W))=I-\\Sigma_{y}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\mathbb{E}\\nabla g_{y}(W)=I-\\Sigma_{y}+\\mathrm{Cov}(g_{y}(W))\\,. For every a\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d} , the same conditional Poincaré estimate used in the proof of Lemma C.1 , together with (\\nabla g_{y})^{2}\\preceq\\beta\\eta\\,\\nabla g_{y} then give \\displaystyle a^{\\top}\\mathrm{Cov}(g_{y}(W))a \\displaystyle\\leq\\mathbb{E}\\|\\nabla g_{y}(W)\\,a\\|^{2}\\leq\\beta\\eta\\,a^{\\top}\\{I-\\Sigma_{y}+\\mathrm{Cov}(g_{y}(W))\\}a\\,. Rearranging proves ( C.13 ). ∎"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p13.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1178666,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1180898,
      "raw_sha256": "9a46ee43fe68593b127b693a9962bd7eeab44cfd03da74cf2588d0f03b1cc97d",
      "lf_sha256": "9a46ee43fe68593b127b693a9962bd7eeab44cfd03da74cf2588d0f03b1cc97d",
      "source_text": "Under Y_{+}=y , we have X=y+\\sqrt{\\eta}W and Y_{-}=y+2\\sqrt{\\eta}W . Applying ( C.9 ) to f:u\\mapsto F((u-y)/(2\\sqrt{\\eta})) therefore gives"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex40",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1180899,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1182228,
      "raw_sha256": "245ba4e256b1a176dc24f1b6f7efc1137c175b2c5c0eeb3842a713b950aa456a",
      "lf_sha256": "245ba4e256b1a176dc24f1b6f7efc1137c175b2c5c0eeb3842a713b950aa456a",
      "source_text": "\\mathbb{E}_{q_{y}}\\nabla F(W)=\\mathbb{E}_{q_{y}}[F(W)\\,\\{W+g_{y}(W)\\}]\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1180963-1182211",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1180963,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1182211,
      "raw_sha256": "a2338aec299e3b9a3577069d4eb0d5b8acf5eebdc3c4f27195097067d7a1c0ec",
      "lf_sha256": "a2338aec299e3b9a3577069d4eb0d5b8acf5eebdc3c4f27195097067d7a1c0ec",
      "source_text": "\\mathbb{E}_{q_{y}}\\nabla F(W)=\\mathbb{E}_{q_{y}}[F(W)\\,\\{W+g_{y}(W)\\}]\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p13.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1182229,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1183560,
      "raw_sha256": "6c8c090ed1a61d770425b677a20ae05c305842501ba103c269c5bcfce765fa66",
      "lf_sha256": "6c8c090ed1a61d770425b677a20ae05c305842501ba103c269c5bcfce765fa66",
      "source_text": "Taking F\\equiv 1 and then the coordinate functions of W and g_{y}(W) , with the same cutoff approximation as in Lemma C.1 , gives"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex41",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1183561,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1185489,
      "raw_sha256": "cec8c2853ffd16b652f889488d79b7c90149b1f665ea3a7f8c9f34ba33ce02f3",
      "lf_sha256": "cec8c2853ffd16b652f889488d79b7c90149b1f665ea3a7f8c9f34ba33ce02f3",
      "source_text": "\\mathbb{E}g_{y}(W)=-\\bar{w}_{y}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\mathrm{Cov}(W,g_{y}(W))=I-\\Sigma_{y}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\mathbb{E}\\nabla g_{y}(W)=I-\\Sigma_{y}+\\mathrm{Cov}(g_{y}(W))\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1183625-1185472",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1183625,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1185472,
      "raw_sha256": "f47d6b827dd0f835f454eb451be39b6bfa199d54da1a622e0958dffc202315ad",
      "lf_sha256": "f47d6b827dd0f835f454eb451be39b6bfa199d54da1a622e0958dffc202315ad",
      "source_text": "\\mathbb{E}g_{y}(W)=-\\bar{w}_{y}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\mathrm{Cov}(W,g_{y}(W))=I-\\Sigma_{y}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\mathbb{E}\\nabla g_{y}(W)=I-\\Sigma_{y}+\\mathrm{Cov}(g_{y}(W))\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p13.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1185490,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1186885,
      "raw_sha256": "3cdba18eeee049e387e35e2f73b913185480c9970c370ed2367f7c35ab8c12b8",
      "lf_sha256": "3cdba18eeee049e387e35e2f73b913185480c9970c370ed2367f7c35ab8c12b8",
      "source_text": "For every a\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d} , the same conditional Poincaré estimate used in the proof of Lemma C.1 , together with (\\nabla g_{y})^{2}\\preceq\\beta\\eta\\,\\nabla g_{y} then give"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1186983-1189568",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1186983,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1189568,
      "raw_sha256": "8ed5179802a4d18f12f20fcf66b7fcf9adb3d115eb00d960daf1139bd39be809",
      "lf_sha256": "8ed5179802a4d18f12f20fcf66b7fcf9adb3d115eb00d960daf1139bd39be809",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle a^{\\top}\\mathrm{Cov}(g_{y}(W))a \\displaystyle\\leq\\mathbb{E}\\|\\nabla g_{y}(W)\\,a\\|^{2}\\leq\\beta\\eta\\,a^{\\top}\\{I-\\Sigma_{y}+\\mathrm{Cov}(g_{y}(W))\\}a\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p13.4",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1189586,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1190072,
      "raw_sha256": "304cc989d06c4a91a52d73a369a10c0f0826baa6be9ee6fa5c861653f5c70e4c",
      "lf_sha256": "304cc989d06c4a91a52d73a369a10c0f0826baa6be9ee6fa5c861653f5c70e4c",
      "source_text": "Rearranging proves ( C.13 ). ∎"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.4",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "proof-container",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1190087,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1213346,
      "raw_sha256": "aaf8dc813edb0326cc0ea010651e8aa20876fee3789884b4133cf1c48631f950",
      "lf_sha256": "aaf8dc813edb0326cc0ea010651e8aa20876fee3789884b4133cf1c48631f950",
      "source_text": "Proof of Proposition C.2 . Fix y , and let \\widetilde{W}\\sim q_{y} be independent of (W,P)\\sim q_{y}\\otimes\\mathcal{N}(0,I) . We first apply the Duhamel formula to identify the estimate that remains to be proved. Using, in order, Jensen’s inequality in \\widetilde{W} , ( C.12 ), the Bochner triangle inequality, the contractivity of Gaussian momentum averaging and \\mathsf{T}_{t}^{y,\\widetilde{w}} , and \\int_{0}^{\\pi}\\sin t\\,\\mathrm{d}t=2 , we obtain \\displaystyle\\|(I+\\mathsf{H}_{y})\\ell_{a,y}\\|_{L^{2}(q_{y})}^{2} \\displaystyle\\leq\\mathbb{E}_{\\widetilde{W}}\\bigl\\|\\mathbb{E}_{P}[(I+\\mathsf{T}_{\\pi}^{y,\\widetilde{W}})\\ell_{a,y}]\\bigr\\|_{L^{2}(q_{y})}^{2} \\displaystyle\\leq\\mathbb{E}_{\\widetilde{W}}\\Bigl(\\int_{0}^{\\pi}\\|\\mathsf{T}_{t}^{y,\\widetilde{W}}k_{a,\\widetilde{W}}\\|_{L^{2}(q_{y}\\otimes\\mathcal{N}(0,I))}\\sin t\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\Bigr)^{2}\\leq 4\\,\\mathbb{E}_{W,\\widetilde{W},P}k_{a,\\widetilde{W}}^{2}\\,. It remains to bound the second moment on the right. Conditional on (W,\\widetilde{W}) , a direct calculation with the Gaussian momentum P , together with \\mathbb{E}_{q_{y}}g_{y}(W)=-\\bar{w}_{y} from Lemma C.4 , gives \\displaystyle\\mathbb{E}_{P}[k_{a,\\widetilde{W}}\\mid W,\\widetilde{W}] \\displaystyle=-a^{\\top}\\{g_{y}(W)-\\mathbb{E}_{q_{y}}g_{y}(W)\\}\\,, \\displaystyle\\Var_{P}(k_{a,\\widetilde{W}}\\mid W,\\widetilde{W}) \\displaystyle=5\\,[a^{\\top}\\{g_{y}(W)-g_{y}(\\widetilde{W})\\}]^{2}\\,. After averaging over the independent variables W and \\widetilde{W} , the conditional variance term contributes 10\\Var_{q_{y}}(a^{\\top}g_{y}(W)) , while the squared conditional mean contributes one more copy of the same variance. Consequently, \\mathbb{E}_{W,\\widetilde{W},P}k_{a,\\widetilde{W}}^{2}=11\\Var_{q_{y}}(a^{\\top}g_{y}(W))\\,. By Lemma C.4 , \\mathbb{E}_{W,\\widetilde{W},P}k_{a,\\widetilde{W}}^{2}\\leq C\\beta\\eta\\,a^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a\\,. Combining the last estimate with the Duhamel bound proves ( C.11 ). For the global assertion, Proposition 2.1 gives I-\\Sigma_{y}\\succeq\\alpha\\eta\\,(1+\\alpha\\eta)^{-1}\\,I , so the stated integrability condition implies \\ell\\in L^{2}(\\pi_{\\eta}) . Its conditional mean is zero. Applying the conditional inequality with a=a_{y} and integrating in y proves the result. ∎"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p14.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1190676,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1193705,
      "raw_sha256": "b3f4b306223064a67236cd0ab531b78953993eeb8a9715d996205486679a7079",
      "lf_sha256": "b3f4b306223064a67236cd0ab531b78953993eeb8a9715d996205486679a7079",
      "source_text": "Fix y , and let \\widetilde{W}\\sim q_{y} be independent of (W,P)\\sim q_{y}\\otimes\\mathcal{N}(0,I) . We first apply the Duhamel formula to identify the estimate that remains to be proved. Using, in order, Jensen’s inequality in \\widetilde{W} , ( C.12 ), the Bochner triangle inequality, the contractivity of Gaussian momentum averaging and \\mathsf{T}_{t}^{y,\\widetilde{w}} , and \\int_{0}^{\\pi}\\sin t\\,\\mathrm{d}t=2 , we obtain"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1193803-1196469",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1193803,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1196469,
      "raw_sha256": "25e16fb8ab4ba4bcf1b89e5963b1ee9dd22cf9fe4aa1369f8c4e1b45b15dd046",
      "lf_sha256": "25e16fb8ab4ba4bcf1b89e5963b1ee9dd22cf9fe4aa1369f8c4e1b45b15dd046",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\|(I+\\mathsf{H}_{y})\\ell_{a,y}\\|_{L^{2}(q_{y})}^{2} \\displaystyle\\leq\\mathbb{E}_{\\widetilde{W}}\\bigl\\|\\mathbb{E}_{P}[(I+\\mathsf{T}_{\\pi}^{y,\\widetilde{W}})\\ell_{a,y}]\\bigr\\|_{L^{2}(q_{y})}^{2}"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1196498-1199308",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1196498,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1199308,
      "raw_sha256": "49c4945a58198baaa925bd7dc821b0bb4c2a77ea2fffddd3b472c0b764c83ade",
      "lf_sha256": "49c4945a58198baaa925bd7dc821b0bb4c2a77ea2fffddd3b472c0b764c83ade",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\leq\\mathbb{E}_{\\widetilde{W}}\\Bigl(\\int_{0}^{\\pi}\\|\\mathsf{T}_{t}^{y,\\widetilde{W}}k_{a,\\widetilde{W}}\\|_{L^{2}(q_{y}\\otimes\\mathcal{N}(0,I))}\\sin t\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\Bigr)^{2}\\leq 4\\,\\mathbb{E}_{W,\\widetilde{W},P}k_{a,\\widetilde{W}}^{2}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p14.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1199326,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1199466,
      "raw_sha256": "61e49ffb452a285cfa6dafd79956a6aba6df4d7ddd46a6dc5a92fc49cf4c8a93",
      "lf_sha256": "61e49ffb452a285cfa6dafd79956a6aba6df4d7ddd46a6dc5a92fc49cf4c8a93",
      "source_text": "It remains to bound the second moment on the right."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p15.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1199513,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1201298,
      "raw_sha256": "af3b2756b2f4e194aeba2f0f8f713f538b517c9ef10a62c3e040865428e32482",
      "lf_sha256": "af3b2756b2f4e194aeba2f0f8f713f538b517c9ef10a62c3e040865428e32482",
      "source_text": "Conditional on (W,\\widetilde{W}) , a direct calculation with the Gaussian momentum P , together with \\mathbb{E}_{q_{y}}g_{y}(W)=-\\bar{w}_{y} from Lemma C.4 , gives"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1201396-1203400",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1201396,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1203400,
      "raw_sha256": "536ffc890e58d799c03e8a1b1f776d997a2072bec15c37d87147130fccdb1627",
      "lf_sha256": "536ffc890e58d799c03e8a1b1f776d997a2072bec15c37d87147130fccdb1627",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\mathbb{E}_{P}[k_{a,\\widetilde{W}}\\mid W,\\widetilde{W}] \\displaystyle=-a^{\\top}\\{g_{y}(W)-\\mathbb{E}_{q_{y}}g_{y}(W)\\}\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1203429-1205555",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1203429,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1205555,
      "raw_sha256": "3fbe507833c334172a8a361e6c4d00c93c9116c5cd5539fd4b9acd58213465a8",
      "lf_sha256": "3fbe507833c334172a8a361e6c4d00c93c9116c5cd5539fd4b9acd58213465a8",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\Var_{P}(k_{a,\\widetilde{W}}\\mid W,\\widetilde{W}) \\displaystyle=5\\,[a^{\\top}\\{g_{y}(W)-g_{y}(\\widetilde{W})\\}]^{2}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p15.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1205573,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1207011,
      "raw_sha256": "19df278208c0d57e7c36d1e1f14bfefac0a02f1e7c325966a1d322a05ec82553",
      "lf_sha256": "19df278208c0d57e7c36d1e1f14bfefac0a02f1e7c325966a1d322a05ec82553",
      "source_text": "After averaging over the independent variables W and \\widetilde{W} , the conditional variance term contributes 10\\Var_{q_{y}}(a^{\\top}g_{y}(W)) , while the squared conditional mean contributes one more copy of the same variance. Consequently,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex47",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1207012,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1208527,
      "raw_sha256": "870cd28457ad1d52022d2382b9dfef86dea789118fd50ea4c7640f64423115fe",
      "lf_sha256": "870cd28457ad1d52022d2382b9dfef86dea789118fd50ea4c7640f64423115fe",
      "source_text": "\\mathbb{E}_{W,\\widetilde{W},P}k_{a,\\widetilde{W}}^{2}=11\\Var_{q_{y}}(a^{\\top}g_{y}(W))\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1207076-1208510",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1207076,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1208510,
      "raw_sha256": "c42279d78106e7d12cae2777597e618dca56027092d99e9ac0d73fa2dbc5bae4",
      "lf_sha256": "c42279d78106e7d12cae2777597e618dca56027092d99e9ac0d73fa2dbc5bae4",
      "source_text": "\\mathbb{E}_{W,\\widetilde{W},P}k_{a,\\widetilde{W}}^{2}=11\\Var_{q_{y}}(a^{\\top}g_{y}(W))\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p15.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1208528,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1209030,
      "raw_sha256": "6f02c616e7cfe4b6c523a7b2e87f1990c6cc7460e257d072d86e199359c75173",
      "lf_sha256": "6f02c616e7cfe4b6c523a7b2e87f1990c6cc7460e257d072d86e199359c75173",
      "source_text": "By Lemma C.4 ,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex48",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1209031,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1210534,
      "raw_sha256": "4806966eb99d9c9cb43c2751e903ae90d04798aba92f0c0731ea279f8348fa91",
      "lf_sha256": "4806966eb99d9c9cb43c2751e903ae90d04798aba92f0c0731ea279f8348fa91",
      "source_text": "\\mathbb{E}_{W,\\widetilde{W},P}k_{a,\\widetilde{W}}^{2}\\leq C\\beta\\eta\\,a^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1209095-1210517",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1209095,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1210517,
      "raw_sha256": "1c09f3a16b5323505a5b71a68bd0cfb0a7f286d8a445809356a2dea950ff4f39",
      "lf_sha256": "1c09f3a16b5323505a5b71a68bd0cfb0a7f286d8a445809356a2dea950ff4f39",
      "source_text": "\\mathbb{E}_{W,\\widetilde{W},P}k_{a,\\widetilde{W}}^{2}\\leq C\\beta\\eta\\,a^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS2.p15.4",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Conditional affine half-turn estimates; independent downstream analytic lane, excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1210535,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1213332,
      "raw_sha256": "62df8ea0b0963e48196852a4ffcd34aeac616074d1e179aa71babe0e843518ac",
      "lf_sha256": "62df8ea0b0963e48196852a4ffcd34aeac616074d1e179aa71babe0e843518ac",
      "source_text": "Combining the last estimate with the Duhamel bound proves ( C.11 ). For the global assertion, Proposition 2.1 gives I-\\Sigma_{y}\\succeq\\alpha\\eta\\,(1+\\alpha\\eta)^{-1}\\,I , so the stated integrability condition implies \\ell\\in L^{2}(\\pi_{\\eta}) . Its conditional mean is zero. Applying the conditional inequality with a=a_{y} and integrating in y proves the result. ∎"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p1.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1214020,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1214613,
      "raw_sha256": "238baf9fb6abeee15f8c2cce368db209201888de6e2f1b2a85c612846cbe90db",
      "lf_sha256": "238baf9fb6abeee15f8c2cce368db209201888de6e2f1b2a85c612846cbe90db",
      "source_text": "The following proposition controls the part of the \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} -spectrum near +1 ."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Thmtheorem5",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "source-statement",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1214621,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1219020,
      "raw_sha256": "ec156c24925ec404b4da2e25777b531e8b1bf873b05a75fc3d1674056c9f3323",
      "lf_sha256": "ec156c24925ec404b4da2e25777b531e8b1bf873b05a75fc3d1674056c9f3323",
      "source_text": "Proposition C.5 (Interpolation bound on the \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} -spectral subspace associated with [\\frac{1}{2},1] ) . Assume \\beta\\eta\\leq c . If w\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbf{1}_{[1/2,1]}(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})) , then \\|(I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp})\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}w\\|^{2}\\leq C\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}w\\|\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{3}w\\|\\,. (C.14)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Thmtheorem5.p1.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1215730,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1216977,
      "raw_sha256": "7806cdeecce98a2c8e17c9e4555bb5a7570742457c2c08ac2cb88825a2ff6bf4",
      "lf_sha256": "7806cdeecce98a2c8e17c9e4555bb5a7570742457c2c08ac2cb88825a2ff6bf4",
      "source_text": "Assume \\beta\\eta\\leq c . If w\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbf{1}_{[1/2,1]}(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})) , then"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.E14",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1216978,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1219006,
      "raw_sha256": "8d3a4eeff6e6d2416bb94a77cec9435d0f7d04a9bdf6afb739fea784e91ae743",
      "lf_sha256": "8d3a4eeff6e6d2416bb94a77cec9435d0f7d04a9bdf6afb739fea784e91ae743",
      "source_text": "\\|(I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp})\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}w\\|^{2}\\leq C\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}w\\|\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{3}w\\|\\,. (C.14)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1217041-1218989",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1217041,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1218989,
      "raw_sha256": "2332450acb6ab687cbc88b15f1c938ac3f8eba1fb89b1cb6dad247060e79c03c",
      "lf_sha256": "2332450acb6ab687cbc88b15f1c938ac3f8eba1fb89b1cb6dad247060e79c03c",
      "source_text": "\\|(I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp})\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}w\\|^{2}\\leq C\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}w\\|\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{3}w\\|\\,. (C.14)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p2.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1219059,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1219533,
      "raw_sha256": "bb0c7f8254e5a9a9a9d495cb99b744875f56c3fe9bc1d425a0b0f7f67ff2fdd9",
      "lf_sha256": "bb0c7f8254e5a9a9a9d495cb99b744875f56c3fe9bc1d425a0b0f7f67ff2fdd9",
      "source_text": "We now prove Proposition B.2 ."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "proof-container",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1219541,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1242172,
      "raw_sha256": "29f13910a076d5b1a1fa0586d8f71c867f9fc8f7316aa835a72067193611644c",
      "lf_sha256": "29f13910a076d5b1a1fa0586d8f71c867f9fc8f7316aa835a72067193611644c",
      "source_text": "Proof of Proposition B.2 . We regard \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} and \\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}} as operators on \\mathfrak{H}_{\\mathsf{P},0} and work with the spectral subspaces \\mathcal{H}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbf{1}_{[1/2,1]}(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}))\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\mathcal{H}^{\\prime}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbf{1}_{[-1/2,1/2)}(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}))\\,. Recall that \\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}=\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1} , and therefore Proposition C.5 yields \\displaystyle\\|(I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp})\\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}v\\|^{2} \\displaystyle=\\|(I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp})\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}v\\|^{2}\\leq C\\,\\|v\\|\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{2}v\\|\\,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\forall v\\in\\mathcal{H}\\,. Recall that by Lemma B.1 , \\gamma_{\\rm gap}^{2}I\\preceq\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{2}\\preceq I . Applying Lemma D.4 with \\mathsf{A}=C^{-1/2}\\,(\\mathsf{T}^{*}\\mathsf{T})^{1/2} , \\mathsf{B}=\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{2}|_{\\mathcal{H}} , m=\\gamma_{\\rm gap}^{2} , and M=1 , where \\mathsf{T}\\coloneqq(I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp})\\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}|_{\\mathcal{H}} , gives a factor 1+\\log(1/\\gamma_{\\rm gap}) , up to a universal constant. Shrinking the universal constant c in the assumption if necessary, we may suppose that \\beta\\eta\\leq 1/16 . Then \\gamma_{\\rm gap}\\leq 2\\sqrt{\\alpha\\eta}\\leq 1/2 , so the additive constant is absorbed by \\log(1/\\gamma_{\\rm gap}) . Therefore, \\displaystyle\\|(I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp})\\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}v\\|^{2}\\leq C\\log(1/\\gamma_{\\rm gap})\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}v\\|^{2}\\,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\forall v\\in\\mathcal{H}\\,. On the other hand, on \\mathcal{H}^{\\prime} , no further spectral localization is needed. Since \\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp} is a contraction, \\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}} is an isometry, and \\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{2}\\succeq\\frac{3}{4}I on \\mathcal{H}^{\\prime} , we have \\|(I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp})\\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}v\\|\\leq 2\\,\\|v\\|\\leq 4\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}v\\|\\,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\forall v\\in\\mathcal{H}^{\\prime}\\,. For a general v\\in\\mathfrak{H}_{\\mathsf{P},0} , decompose v=v_{\\mathcal{H}}+v_{\\mathcal{H}^{\\prime}} . Combining the preceding two estimates with (a+b)^{2}\\leq 2a^{2}+2b^{2} , and using that \\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}} commutes with \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} , proves ( B.17 ). ∎"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p3.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1220119,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1221175,
      "raw_sha256": "217cb88a6898ed8d3d6e59a747e8e837928168ea008acc7e8adfa9c064b2fd74",
      "lf_sha256": "217cb88a6898ed8d3d6e59a747e8e837928168ea008acc7e8adfa9c064b2fd74",
      "source_text": "We regard \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} and \\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}} as operators on \\mathfrak{H}_{\\mathsf{P},0} and work with the spectral subspaces"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex49",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1221176,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1223047,
      "raw_sha256": "0862dcf7d800b2b24e7b30887cb0f46ae9c3e6a9d0cb043cb27ecaa0d55a9c8c",
      "lf_sha256": "0862dcf7d800b2b24e7b30887cb0f46ae9c3e6a9d0cb043cb27ecaa0d55a9c8c",
      "source_text": "\\mathcal{H}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbf{1}_{[1/2,1]}(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}))\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\mathcal{H}^{\\prime}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbf{1}_{[-1/2,1/2)}(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}))\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1221240-1223030",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1221240,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1223030,
      "raw_sha256": "500df4340323432a4b39dddb7a2642c6384f429221282fc13241e997d7052f97",
      "lf_sha256": "500df4340323432a4b39dddb7a2642c6384f429221282fc13241e997d7052f97",
      "source_text": "\\mathcal{H}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbf{1}_{[1/2,1]}(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}))\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\mathcal{H}^{\\prime}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbf{1}_{[-1/2,1/2)}(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}))\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p3.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1223048,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1224382,
      "raw_sha256": "23b4971654a5829745ddb138771e4c8593e6e81f8c87945f1696775e8879585b",
      "lf_sha256": "23b4971654a5829745ddb138771e4c8593e6e81f8c87945f1696775e8879585b",
      "source_text": "Recall that \\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}=\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1} , and therefore Proposition C.5 yields"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1224480-1227493",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1224480,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1227493,
      "raw_sha256": "c169e7a64b2f482bbc29d7b9a577de737dc9549d7664f60f5d17f05cb44c0811",
      "lf_sha256": "c169e7a64b2f482bbc29d7b9a577de737dc9549d7664f60f5d17f05cb44c0811",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\|(I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp})\\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}v\\|^{2} \\displaystyle=\\|(I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp})\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}v\\|^{2}\\leq C\\,\\|v\\|\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{2}v\\|\\,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\forall v\\in\\mathcal{H}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p3.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1227511,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1233533,
      "raw_sha256": "87ac81e73807682a55401db31536f5c6853dcf2138fc4f09a07878fac14d68c9",
      "lf_sha256": "87ac81e73807682a55401db31536f5c6853dcf2138fc4f09a07878fac14d68c9",
      "source_text": "Recall that by Lemma B.1 , \\gamma_{\\rm gap}^{2}I\\preceq\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{2}\\preceq I . Applying Lemma D.4 with \\mathsf{A}=C^{-1/2}\\,(\\mathsf{T}^{*}\\mathsf{T})^{1/2} , \\mathsf{B}=\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{2}|_{\\mathcal{H}} , m=\\gamma_{\\rm gap}^{2} , and M=1 , where \\mathsf{T}\\coloneqq(I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp})\\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}|_{\\mathcal{H}} , gives a factor 1+\\log(1/\\gamma_{\\rm gap}) , up to a universal constant. Shrinking the universal constant c in the assumption if necessary, we may suppose that \\beta\\eta\\leq 1/16 . Then \\gamma_{\\rm gap}\\leq 2\\sqrt{\\alpha\\eta}\\leq 1/2 , so the additive constant is absorbed by \\log(1/\\gamma_{\\rm gap}) . Therefore,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1233631-1235660",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1233631,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1235660,
      "raw_sha256": "0f2e34896a2b5655060ce09714aad19391bb4fe0d198f5f722189e716bdd80f3",
      "lf_sha256": "0f2e34896a2b5655060ce09714aad19391bb4fe0d198f5f722189e716bdd80f3",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\|(I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp})\\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}v\\|^{2}\\leq C\\log(1/\\gamma_{\\rm gap})\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}v\\|^{2}\\,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\forall v\\in\\mathcal{H}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p3.4",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1235678,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1237583,
      "raw_sha256": "98b7395924a55d0561bdbc116d280df77f4c28d18590552207167fc9393aed7f",
      "lf_sha256": "98b7395924a55d0561bdbc116d280df77f4c28d18590552207167fc9393aed7f",
      "source_text": "On the other hand, on \\mathcal{H}^{\\prime} , no further spectral localization is needed. Since \\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp} is a contraction, \\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}} is an isometry, and \\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{2}\\succeq\\frac{3}{4}I on \\mathcal{H}^{\\prime} , we have"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex52",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1237584,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1239559,
      "raw_sha256": "8dcf30727ff6bc3a9459e4145a777642d96123f8d563e8796b108453334c09be",
      "lf_sha256": "8dcf30727ff6bc3a9459e4145a777642d96123f8d563e8796b108453334c09be",
      "source_text": "\\|(I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp})\\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}v\\|\\leq 2\\,\\|v\\|\\leq 4\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}v\\|\\,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\forall v\\in\\mathcal{H}^{\\prime}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1237648-1239542",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1237648,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1239542,
      "raw_sha256": "9824ee1821bcc154b748c6ceb1ff81b4c98e835adbf6be09432a6f7f52159be7",
      "lf_sha256": "9824ee1821bcc154b748c6ceb1ff81b4c98e835adbf6be09432a6f7f52159be7",
      "source_text": "\\|(I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp})\\mathsf{V}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}v\\|\\leq 2\\,\\|v\\|\\leq 4\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}v\\|\\,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\forall v\\in\\mathcal{H}^{\\prime}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p3.5",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1239560,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1242158,
      "raw_sha256": "b100718d891fadfea58f083b15122d20b1d04fe8ec44e89ac8022fc573506751",
      "lf_sha256": "b100718d891fadfea58f083b15122d20b1d04fe8ec44e89ac8022fc573506751",
      "source_text": "For a general v\\in\\mathfrak{H}_{\\mathsf{P},0} , decompose v=v_{\\mathcal{H}}+v_{\\mathcal{H}^{\\prime}} . Combining the preceding two estimates with (a+b)^{2}\\leq 2a^{2}+2b^{2} , and using that \\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}} commutes with \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} , proves ( B.17 ). ∎"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p4.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1242211,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1246215,
      "raw_sha256": "0ce75f943b1547f15c181846a210d0a41fb0d2c10d35346642e6a11ed0095042",
      "lf_sha256": "0ce75f943b1547f15c181846a210d0a41fb0d2c10d35346642e6a11ed0095042",
      "source_text": "We prove Proposition C.5 after the following preparatory results. The first approximates \\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}w , conditionally on Y_{+} , by a function that is affine in the rescaled coordinate W=(X-Y_{+})/\\sqrt{\\eta} , so that Proposition C.2 applies. The second bounds the resulting affine data by the gradients of w and (I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w , using the derivative formula ( C.8 ). Both results hold for arbitrary functions in H^{1}(\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}) ; the spectral condition enters when we invert \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} ."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p5.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1246261,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1248890,
      "raw_sha256": "faaf6d4ff489568b559735d0e7c747a4816d32838ad3983ec436ea21d0d0e008",
      "lf_sha256": "faaf6d4ff489568b559735d0e7c747a4816d32838ad3983ec436ea21d0d0e008",
      "source_text": "Recall from Section C.2 the conditional law q_{y}\\coloneqq\\Law(W\\mid Y_{+}=y) , its mean \\bar{w}_{y} and covariance \\Sigma_{y} , and that, conditionally on Y_{+}=y , we have X=y+\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,W and Y_{-}=y+2\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,W ."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Thmtheorem6",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "source-statement",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1248898,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1262171,
      "raw_sha256": "841a948250fec6804e5ed802957e2dcd5096d089eed92e40595fafafbd81bf1a",
      "lf_sha256": "841a948250fec6804e5ed802957e2dcd5096d089eed92e40595fafafbd81bf1a",
      "source_text": "Lemma C.6 (Conditional affine approximation and energy bound) . Let w\\in H^{1}(\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}) , and let a_{y}\\coloneqq\\mathbb{E}[\\nabla w(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}=y] denote the conditional mean of the gradient. For \\pi_{\\eta}^{Y} -almost every y , define e_{y}(u)\\coloneqq w(y+2\\sqrt{\\eta}u)-(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}w)(y)-2\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,a_{y}^{\\top}(u-\\bar{w}_{y})\\,,\\hskip 20.00003ptu\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d}\\,. Then, e_{y} has q_{y} -mean zero, the decomposition \\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}w=2\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,a_{Y_{+}}^{\\top}(W-\\bar{w}_{Y_{+}})+e_{Y_{+}}(W) (C.15) holds in L^{2}(\\pi_{\\eta}) , and, with \\mathcal{R}\\coloneqq\\|\\nabla w\\|^{2}-\\int\\|a_{y}\\|^{2}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)=\\mathbb{E}\\|\\nabla w(Y_{-})-a_{Y_{+}}\\|^{2}\\,, (C.16) one has \\mathbb{E}[e_{Y_{+}}(W)^{2}]\\leq 4\\eta\\mathcal{R}\\,. (C.17) Moreover, if \\beta\\eta\\leq c for a sufficiently small universal constant c>0 , then \\mathcal{R}+\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\leq C\\,\\|\\nabla(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w\\|\\,\\|\\nabla w\\|\\,. (C.18)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Thmtheorem6.p1.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1249369,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1251265,
      "raw_sha256": "d2db0f8fdcf094b9bfc0b0f67eec9cc1ac58334227f7981fa62cbe5873dae6be",
      "lf_sha256": "d2db0f8fdcf094b9bfc0b0f67eec9cc1ac58334227f7981fa62cbe5873dae6be",
      "source_text": "Let w\\in H^{1}(\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}) , and let a_{y}\\coloneqq\\mathbb{E}[\\nabla w(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}=y] denote the conditional mean of the gradient. For \\pi_{\\eta}^{Y} -almost every y , define"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex53",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1251266,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1253418,
      "raw_sha256": "35451906f9d813fd939ad75f76a3561816fbd0791173aa1ade18a019d195fe15",
      "lf_sha256": "35451906f9d813fd939ad75f76a3561816fbd0791173aa1ade18a019d195fe15",
      "source_text": "e_{y}(u)\\coloneqq w(y+2\\sqrt{\\eta}u)-(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}w)(y)-2\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,a_{y}^{\\top}(u-\\bar{w}_{y})\\,,\\hskip 20.00003ptu\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1251330-1253401",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1251330,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1253401,
      "raw_sha256": "272f80fb6cfdd0f2742a3221daabd14dc2d678acec1f1263aad96a0d848d7d36",
      "lf_sha256": "272f80fb6cfdd0f2742a3221daabd14dc2d678acec1f1263aad96a0d848d7d36",
      "source_text": "e_{y}(u)\\coloneqq w(y+2\\sqrt{\\eta}u)-(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}w)(y)-2\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,a_{y}^{\\top}(u-\\bar{w}_{y})\\,,\\hskip 20.00003ptu\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Thmtheorem6.p1.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1253419,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1254022,
      "raw_sha256": "5cb1797c96d4107920e41472bc0c1ab1e88949b0fdf99b508a7d106e8314cf66",
      "lf_sha256": "5cb1797c96d4107920e41472bc0c1ab1e88949b0fdf99b508a7d106e8314cf66",
      "source_text": "Then, e_{y} has q_{y} -mean zero, the decomposition"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.E15",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1254023,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1255663,
      "raw_sha256": "e0303a7ce6abd899d6251e574851092b48b5dfcf9a08faad876a69c29c2587b3",
      "lf_sha256": "e0303a7ce6abd899d6251e574851092b48b5dfcf9a08faad876a69c29c2587b3",
      "source_text": "\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}w=2\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,a_{Y_{+}}^{\\top}(W-\\bar{w}_{Y_{+}})+e_{Y_{+}}(W) (C.15)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1254086-1255646",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1254086,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1255646,
      "raw_sha256": "2dcf87f77936505cd197ebe73c69463c0992eae9e7700ced309de3a9b08f9ce1",
      "lf_sha256": "2dcf87f77936505cd197ebe73c69463c0992eae9e7700ced309de3a9b08f9ce1",
      "source_text": "\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}w=2\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,a_{Y_{+}}^{\\top}(W-\\bar{w}_{Y_{+}})+e_{Y_{+}}(W) (C.15)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Thmtheorem6.p1.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1255664,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1256202,
      "raw_sha256": "a3451ee89a789a9faeeca3e3f0894555ab312664805ce5eafb93785498548e69",
      "lf_sha256": "a3451ee89a789a9faeeca3e3f0894555ab312664805ce5eafb93785498548e69",
      "source_text": "holds in L^{2}(\\pi_{\\eta}) , and, with"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.E16",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1256203,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1258254,
      "raw_sha256": "485276ce769972592ce51e1b229264b1d54795234cb005811fb4e080bcf4da07",
      "lf_sha256": "485276ce769972592ce51e1b229264b1d54795234cb005811fb4e080bcf4da07",
      "source_text": "\\mathcal{R}\\coloneqq\\|\\nabla w\\|^{2}-\\int\\|a_{y}\\|^{2}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)=\\mathbb{E}\\|\\nabla w(Y_{-})-a_{Y_{+}}\\|^{2}\\,, (C.16)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1256266-1258237",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1256266,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1258237,
      "raw_sha256": "1f93c6c0c25974ceaddcbf94a617e33f92c57d57a46f874b282d8304ed7ddcce",
      "lf_sha256": "1f93c6c0c25974ceaddcbf94a617e33f92c57d57a46f874b282d8304ed7ddcce",
      "source_text": "\\mathcal{R}\\coloneqq\\|\\nabla w\\|^{2}-\\int\\|a_{y}\\|^{2}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)=\\mathbb{E}\\|\\nabla w(Y_{-})-a_{Y_{+}}\\|^{2}\\,, (C.16)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Thmtheorem6.p1.4",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1258255,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1258381,
      "raw_sha256": "6f33eefc9bbf9142f6f1127c54e46003921f032f1b787e56f308fac3b2d8d6fd",
      "lf_sha256": "6f33eefc9bbf9142f6f1127c54e46003921f032f1b787e56f308fac3b2d8d6fd",
      "source_text": "one has"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.E17",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1258382,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1259640,
      "raw_sha256": "6a92cd109899eb5927dbcc0a493b3802d64bbd52b9f89f34da78c157f0513de4",
      "lf_sha256": "6a92cd109899eb5927dbcc0a493b3802d64bbd52b9f89f34da78c157f0513de4",
      "source_text": "\\mathbb{E}[e_{Y_{+}}(W)^{2}]\\leq 4\\eta\\mathcal{R}\\,. (C.17)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1258445-1259623",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1258445,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1259623,
      "raw_sha256": "3936723b93667d2f5062a6c61d96b9776c9c660e2b5f0521c014bf763cd5cfc9",
      "lf_sha256": "3936723b93667d2f5062a6c61d96b9776c9c660e2b5f0521c014bf763cd5cfc9",
      "source_text": "\\mathbb{E}[e_{Y_{+}}(W)^{2}]\\leq 4\\eta\\mathcal{R}\\,. (C.17)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Thmtheorem6.p1.5",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1259641,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1260378,
      "raw_sha256": "62529b5f4053bfaa4ee94b0b851f6bf1307f2d892229508a8e3df42363b6f937",
      "lf_sha256": "62529b5f4053bfaa4ee94b0b851f6bf1307f2d892229508a8e3df42363b6f937",
      "source_text": "Moreover, if \\beta\\eta\\leq c for a sufficiently small universal constant c>0 , then"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.E18",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1260379,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1262157,
      "raw_sha256": "231838286e30ccc8f80b0d97116c7e9790729c6f314c94757c9907bdb211fd01",
      "lf_sha256": "231838286e30ccc8f80b0d97116c7e9790729c6f314c94757c9907bdb211fd01",
      "source_text": "\\mathcal{R}+\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\leq C\\,\\|\\nabla(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w\\|\\,\\|\\nabla w\\|\\,. (C.18)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1260442-1262140",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1260442,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1262140,
      "raw_sha256": "4e9801a282724df316bd18d5e24ca011524a88b37be1a24bf9d294f5523d20b1",
      "lf_sha256": "4e9801a282724df316bd18d5e24ca011524a88b37be1a24bf9d294f5523d20b1",
      "source_text": "\\mathcal{R}+\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\leq C\\,\\|\\nabla(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w\\|\\,\\|\\nabla w\\|\\,. (C.18)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "proof-container",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1262172,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1331011,
      "raw_sha256": "54908657f071e626f48e55fdc4d91c0a630f3f9dbc94ef09ab1fd44e9dc4296d",
      "lf_sha256": "54908657f071e626f48e55fdc4d91c0a630f3f9dbc94ef09ab1fd44e9dc4296d",
      "source_text": "Proof. By definition, \\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}w=w(Y_{-})-\\mathbb{E}[w(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}]=w(Y_{-})-(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}w)(Y_{+})\\,. Conditioning on Y_{+}=y and substituting Y_{-}=y+2\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,W gives, for \\pi_{\\eta}^{Y} -almost every y , (\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}w)(u)=w(y+2\\sqrt{\\eta}u)-(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}w)(y)\\,,\\hskip 20.00003ptu\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d}\\,, which is ( C.15 ). This function belongs to L^{2}(q_{y}) and has q_{y} -mean zero; since the subtracted affine function is q_{y} -centered, e_{y} has q_{y} -mean zero as well. The coefficient 2\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,a_{y} is chosen to center the gradient of e_{y} : differentiating the preceding identity and averaging under q_{y} gives \\int_{\\mathbb{R}^{d}}\\nabla_{u}(\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}w)(u)\\,q_{y}(\\mathrm{d}u)=2\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\mathbb{E}[\\nabla w(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}=y]=2\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,a_{y}\\,, and hence \\nabla_{u}e_{y}(W)=2\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\{\\nabla w(Y_{-})-a_{y}\\}\\,. Since q_{y} has Poincaré constant at most 1 , it follows that \\mathbb{E}[e_{y}(W)^{2}\\mid Y_{+}=y]\\leq\\mathbb{E}[\\|\\nabla_{u}e_{y}(W)\\|^{2}\\mid Y_{+}=y]=4\\eta\\,\\mathbb{E}[\\|\\nabla w(Y_{-})-a_{y}\\|^{2}\\mid Y_{+}=y]\\,. Integrating in y and expanding the square using the definition of a_{y} proves ( C.17 ). We turn to the energy estimate. We may assume \\beta\\eta\\leq 1/2 . Recall that g_{y}(u)=\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\nabla V(y+\\sqrt{\\eta}u) , so that \\nabla V(X)=\\eta^{-1/2}g_{y}(W) , and that \\mathrm{Cov}(W,g_{y}(W)\\mid Y_{+}=y)=I-\\Sigma_{y} by Lemma C.4 . The decomposition ( C.15 ) therefore gives \\mathrm{Cov}(w(Y_{-}),\\nabla V(X)\\mid Y_{+}=y)=2(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}+\\eta^{-1/2}\\varepsilon_{y}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\varepsilon_{y}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Cov}(e_{y}(W),g_{y}(W)\\mid Y_{+}=y)\\,. Substituting this into ( C.8 ) yields [\\nabla(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w](y)=\\nabla w(y)-a_{y}+2(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}+\\eta^{-1/2}\\varepsilon_{y}\\,. (C.19) Conditional Cauchy–Schwarz and Lemma C.4 give, for every v\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d} , |\\varepsilon_{y}^{\\top}v|^{2}\\leq C\\beta\\eta\\,\\mathbb{E}[e_{y}(W)^{2}\\mid Y_{+}=y]\\,v^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})v\\,. (C.20) We will also use 0\\preceq I-\\Sigma_{y}\\preceq\\beta\\eta I\\,. (C.21) The two-sided bound in Lemma B.1 , together with the fact that \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} fixes constants, gives (I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})^{2}\\preceq 3\\,(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{2}) on L^{2}(\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}) . Since a_{y}=(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}\\nabla w)(y) , with \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} acting coordinatewise, \\mathcal{R}=\\bigl\\langle\\nabla w,(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{2})\\nabla w\\bigr\\rangle\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\int\\|\\nabla w(y)-a_{y}\\|^{2}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\leq 3\\mathcal{R}\\,. (C.22) We now control \\mathcal{R} and the affine energy simultaneously. Take the L^{2}(\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}) inner product of ( C.19 ) with the vector field y\\mapsto\\nabla w(y)+a_{y} . Since \\int\\{\\nabla w(y)-a_{y}\\}^{\\top}\\{\\nabla w(y)+a_{y}\\}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)=\\mathcal{R}\\,, we obtain the exact identity \\displaystyle\\mathcal{R}+4\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y) \\displaystyle=\\int[\\nabla(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w](y)^{\\top}\\{\\nabla w(y)+a_{y}\\}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y) \\displaystyle\\hskip 20.00003pt-2\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})\\{\\nabla w(y)-a_{y}\\}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y) \\displaystyle\\hskip 20.00003pt-\\eta^{-1/2}\\int\\varepsilon_{y}^{\\top}\\{\\nabla w(y)+a_{y}\\}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\,. (C.23) We bound the three terms on the right separately. For the first, conditional Jensen gives \\int\\|a_{y}\\|^{2}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\leq\\|\\nabla w\\|^{2} , and hence \\Bigl\\lvert\\int[\\nabla(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w](y)^{\\top}\\{\\nabla w(y)+a_{y}\\}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\Bigr\\rvert\\leq 2\\,\\|\\nabla(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w\\|\\,\\|\\nabla w\\|\\,. (C.24) For the second, Cauchy–Schwarz, ( C.21 ), and ( C.22 ) give \\displaystyle 2\\,\\Bigl|\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})\\{\\nabla w(y)-a_{y}\\}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\Bigr|\\leq C\\sqrt{\\beta\\eta}\\,\\mathcal{R}^{1/2}\\,\\Bigl\\{\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\Bigr\\}^{1/2}\\,. (C.25) Finally, using the pointwise identity \\nabla w(y)+a_{y}=\\{\\nabla w(y)-a_{y}\\}+2a_{y} , ( C.21 ) and ( C.22 ) imply \\displaystyle\\int\\{\\nabla w(y)+a_{y}\\}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})\\{\\nabla w(y)+a_{y}\\}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\leq C\\beta\\eta\\,\\mathcal{R}+8\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\,. (C.26) Using ( C.20 ), Cauchy–Schwarz in y , ( C.17 ), and ( C.26 ), we obtain \\displaystyle\\eta^{-1/2}\\,\\Bigl|\\int\\varepsilon_{y}^{\\top}\\{\\nabla w(y)+a_{y}\\}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\Bigr| \\displaystyle\\hskip 20.00003pt\\leq C\\sqrt{\\beta\\eta\\,\\mathcal{R}}\\,\\Bigl\\{\\beta\\eta\\,\\mathcal{R}+\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\Bigr\\}^{1/2} \\displaystyle\\hskip 20.00003pt\\leq C\\sqrt{\\beta\\eta}\\,\\mathcal{R}^{1/2}\\,\\Bigl\\{\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\Bigr\\}^{1/2}+C\\beta\\eta\\,\\mathcal{R}\\,. (C.27) Substituting these three estimates into ( C.23 ) gives \\displaystyle\\mathcal{R}+4\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y) \\displaystyle\\leq 2\\,\\|\\nabla(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w\\|\\,\\|\\nabla w\\| \\displaystyle\\hskip 20.00003pt+C\\sqrt{\\beta\\eta}\\,\\mathcal{R}^{1/2}\\Bigl\\{\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\Bigr\\}^{1/2}+C\\beta\\eta\\,\\mathcal{R}\\,. For sufficiently small universal \\beta\\eta , the last two terms are absorbed into the left-hand side. This proves ( C.18 ). ∎"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p6.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1262324,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1262425,
      "raw_sha256": "68b0608d9ec1c6ed10730363ce3fdaee9828dd06c9876e5ca11ce4dc2dc619db",
      "lf_sha256": "68b0608d9ec1c6ed10730363ce3fdaee9828dd06c9876e5ca11ce4dc2dc619db",
      "source_text": "By definition,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex54",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1262426,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1264338,
      "raw_sha256": "31a5f0adbc73ef2a6946810ed1f6af610accf3d98400d19ff81d546dfeb0045e",
      "lf_sha256": "31a5f0adbc73ef2a6946810ed1f6af610accf3d98400d19ff81d546dfeb0045e",
      "source_text": "\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}w=w(Y_{-})-\\mathbb{E}[w(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}]=w(Y_{-})-(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}w)(Y_{+})\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1262490-1264321",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1262490,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1264321,
      "raw_sha256": "30b188ab83b87fb685cd2b43d9cd9a1cec3ca2ec42581d318fbb9238468d082f",
      "lf_sha256": "30b188ab83b87fb685cd2b43d9cd9a1cec3ca2ec42581d318fbb9238468d082f",
      "source_text": "\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}w=w(Y_{-})-\\mathbb{E}[w(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}]=w(Y_{-})-(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}w)(Y_{+})\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p6.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1264339,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1265618,
      "raw_sha256": "305c5979b3ddd5c5597fcd46e04e95cb9e22aa91c7ac34648633401348fc2445",
      "lf_sha256": "305c5979b3ddd5c5597fcd46e04e95cb9e22aa91c7ac34648633401348fc2445",
      "source_text": "Conditioning on Y_{+}=y and substituting Y_{-}=y+2\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,W gives, for \\pi_{\\eta}^{Y} -almost every y ,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex55",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1265619,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1267462,
      "raw_sha256": "1b07775740140015bc73702bf8ab82ee1bb10fbe273dd0db543c538a87cae759",
      "lf_sha256": "1b07775740140015bc73702bf8ab82ee1bb10fbe273dd0db543c538a87cae759",
      "source_text": "(\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}w)(u)=w(y+2\\sqrt{\\eta}u)-(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}w)(y)\\,,\\hskip 20.00003ptu\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d}\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1265683-1267445",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1265683,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1267445,
      "raw_sha256": "a38acdba204f9142630dc9085273028fecc09ef824bd647258a3578b800f3003",
      "lf_sha256": "a38acdba204f9142630dc9085273028fecc09ef824bd647258a3578b800f3003",
      "source_text": "(\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}w)(u)=w(y+2\\sqrt{\\eta}u)-(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}w)(y)\\,,\\hskip 20.00003ptu\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d}\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p6.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1267463,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1269315,
      "raw_sha256": "e8f0cee7bac2cba124c5d3e04c894b280d223acb6ba242c39c99f98632a63770",
      "lf_sha256": "e8f0cee7bac2cba124c5d3e04c894b280d223acb6ba242c39c99f98632a63770",
      "source_text": "which is ( C.15 ). This function belongs to L^{2}(q_{y}) and has q_{y} -mean zero; since the subtracted affine function is q_{y} -centered, e_{y} has q_{y} -mean zero as well."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p7.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1269361,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1270367,
      "raw_sha256": "e57feb50fa08a340e1aeb916165fe3b3f1b8b193e7b820b17c981b5362fb90c0",
      "lf_sha256": "e57feb50fa08a340e1aeb916165fe3b3f1b8b193e7b820b17c981b5362fb90c0",
      "source_text": "The coefficient 2\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,a_{y} is chosen to center the gradient of e_{y} : differentiating the preceding identity and averaging under q_{y} gives"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex56",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1270368,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1272654,
      "raw_sha256": "8dc00ee546471dcfa09f3fa1603357719e1957593bc655704d353bbff2a66bee",
      "lf_sha256": "8dc00ee546471dcfa09f3fa1603357719e1957593bc655704d353bbff2a66bee",
      "source_text": "\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^{d}}\\nabla_{u}(\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}w)(u)\\,q_{y}(\\mathrm{d}u)=2\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\mathbb{E}[\\nabla w(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}=y]=2\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,a_{y}\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1270432-1272637",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1270432,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1272637,
      "raw_sha256": "4283d9d4de13e0b1b4b47ba2edb15c9330bbeb24eda22f7141b0962528d9015c",
      "lf_sha256": "4283d9d4de13e0b1b4b47ba2edb15c9330bbeb24eda22f7141b0962528d9015c",
      "source_text": "\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^{d}}\\nabla_{u}(\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}w)(u)\\,q_{y}(\\mathrm{d}u)=2\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\mathbb{E}[\\nabla w(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}=y]=2\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,a_{y}\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p7.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1272655,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1272751,
      "raw_sha256": "d77472c1162d4127e853f647b0e838db4dc313617786d00650fdcbb9fef8c474",
      "lf_sha256": "d77472c1162d4127e853f647b0e838db4dc313617786d00650fdcbb9fef8c474",
      "source_text": "and hence"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex57",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1272752,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1274110,
      "raw_sha256": "5db53517b864ef7231ea09f97252d0d98e6cbad39120f65d161d0fe130834437",
      "lf_sha256": "5db53517b864ef7231ea09f97252d0d98e6cbad39120f65d161d0fe130834437",
      "source_text": "\\nabla_{u}e_{y}(W)=2\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\{\\nabla w(Y_{-})-a_{y}\\}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1272816-1274093",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1272816,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1274093,
      "raw_sha256": "fcfb7f15325b02041f854da54b670310f1b11c8e6973ee9c3c87a6ae00e7a788",
      "lf_sha256": "fcfb7f15325b02041f854da54b670310f1b11c8e6973ee9c3c87a6ae00e7a788",
      "source_text": "\\nabla_{u}e_{y}(W)=2\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\{\\nabla w(Y_{-})-a_{y}\\}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p7.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1274111,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1274650,
      "raw_sha256": "238d939b1c289c250317049d8b0bc178070052f903ed535d91a989203cce1a1b",
      "lf_sha256": "238d939b1c289c250317049d8b0bc178070052f903ed535d91a989203cce1a1b",
      "source_text": "Since q_{y} has Poincaré constant at most 1 , it follows that"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex58",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1274651,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1277167,
      "raw_sha256": "cd404bc170f25e146b642129901470a5cdf333d31a50ddc4233f822ebaeabdb0",
      "lf_sha256": "cd404bc170f25e146b642129901470a5cdf333d31a50ddc4233f822ebaeabdb0",
      "source_text": "\\mathbb{E}[e_{y}(W)^{2}\\mid Y_{+}=y]\\leq\\mathbb{E}[\\|\\nabla_{u}e_{y}(W)\\|^{2}\\mid Y_{+}=y]=4\\eta\\,\\mathbb{E}[\\|\\nabla w(Y_{-})-a_{y}\\|^{2}\\mid Y_{+}=y]\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1274715-1277150",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1274715,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1277150,
      "raw_sha256": "fa70447df4ba6c422a3fdef6f03e3114ceecc42c8eff538c743c57f683223886",
      "lf_sha256": "fa70447df4ba6c422a3fdef6f03e3114ceecc42c8eff538c743c57f683223886",
      "source_text": "\\mathbb{E}[e_{y}(W)^{2}\\mid Y_{+}=y]\\leq\\mathbb{E}[\\|\\nabla_{u}e_{y}(W)\\|^{2}\\mid Y_{+}=y]=4\\eta\\,\\mathbb{E}[\\|\\nabla w(Y_{-})-a_{y}\\|^{2}\\mid Y_{+}=y]\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p7.4",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1277168,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1278124,
      "raw_sha256": "ee2836ed768a3fb9fc9f1f274180807271d4cc2d3f89398e950c7df06993760c",
      "lf_sha256": "ee2836ed768a3fb9fc9f1f274180807271d4cc2d3f89398e950c7df06993760c",
      "source_text": "Integrating in y and expanding the square using the definition of a_{y} proves ( C.17 )."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p8.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1278170,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1281508,
      "raw_sha256": "cd0eb0aeba65dfa8cce215ec49373647e1326b66f85dbbab776327626ea97086",
      "lf_sha256": "cd0eb0aeba65dfa8cce215ec49373647e1326b66f85dbbab776327626ea97086",
      "source_text": "We turn to the energy estimate. We may assume \\beta\\eta\\leq 1/2 . Recall that g_{y}(u)=\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\nabla V(y+\\sqrt{\\eta}u) , so that \\nabla V(X)=\\eta^{-1/2}g_{y}(W) , and that \\mathrm{Cov}(W,g_{y}(W)\\mid Y_{+}=y)=I-\\Sigma_{y} by Lemma C.4 . The decomposition ( C.15 ) therefore gives"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex59",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1281509,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1283602,
      "raw_sha256": "f98ccb7491aa9247570178474c8ea0dd2b59479596cffe02579c05dc5205ccfb",
      "lf_sha256": "f98ccb7491aa9247570178474c8ea0dd2b59479596cffe02579c05dc5205ccfb",
      "source_text": "\\mathrm{Cov}(w(Y_{-}),\\nabla V(X)\\mid Y_{+}=y)=2(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}+\\eta^{-1/2}\\varepsilon_{y}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\varepsilon_{y}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Cov}(e_{y}(W),g_{y}(W)\\mid Y_{+}=y)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1281573-1283585",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1281573,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1283585,
      "raw_sha256": "caec5ab24029cafa58b9a973c90f91aa7d8c27f9470a6b63578941faa81f98fc",
      "lf_sha256": "caec5ab24029cafa58b9a973c90f91aa7d8c27f9470a6b63578941faa81f98fc",
      "source_text": "\\mathrm{Cov}(w(Y_{-}),\\nabla V(X)\\mid Y_{+}=y)=2(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}+\\eta^{-1/2}\\varepsilon_{y}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\varepsilon_{y}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Cov}(e_{y}(W),g_{y}(W)\\mid Y_{+}=y)\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p8.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1283603,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1284055,
      "raw_sha256": "f70019a436bbd9976f4362fb7725666abd8a45b206a1d4389bd61ef5681fcee0",
      "lf_sha256": "f70019a436bbd9976f4362fb7725666abd8a45b206a1d4389bd61ef5681fcee0",
      "source_text": "Substituting this into ( C.8 ) yields"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.E19",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1284056,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1285748,
      "raw_sha256": "bc4e3ecfef91f2eb137eabf7c21f6d33c2891ca82766fbe464957089a11054f9",
      "lf_sha256": "bc4e3ecfef91f2eb137eabf7c21f6d33c2891ca82766fbe464957089a11054f9",
      "source_text": "[\\nabla(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w](y)=\\nabla w(y)-a_{y}+2(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}+\\eta^{-1/2}\\varepsilon_{y}\\,. (C.19)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1284119-1285731",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1284119,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1285731,
      "raw_sha256": "975e371f840af06fab0fb711aad0dc328c9d366ad3d0679ee7ccb45aa7978dc2",
      "lf_sha256": "975e371f840af06fab0fb711aad0dc328c9d366ad3d0679ee7ccb45aa7978dc2",
      "source_text": "[\\nabla(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w](y)=\\nabla w(y)-a_{y}+2(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}+\\eta^{-1/2}\\varepsilon_{y}\\,. (C.19)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p8.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1285749,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1286573,
      "raw_sha256": "d3b235b06cd3a182cc1e8cfc7e107096398a6a80e6e1dc2f259993671a2b5e29",
      "lf_sha256": "d3b235b06cd3a182cc1e8cfc7e107096398a6a80e6e1dc2f259993671a2b5e29",
      "source_text": "Conditional Cauchy–Schwarz and Lemma C.4 give, for every v\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d} ,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.E20",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1286574,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1288590,
      "raw_sha256": "3267a92f3f70117afc56b8208d04ad7b1d60ba0130cca076ed363f1d72ff1fae",
      "lf_sha256": "3267a92f3f70117afc56b8208d04ad7b1d60ba0130cca076ed363f1d72ff1fae",
      "source_text": "|\\varepsilon_{y}^{\\top}v|^{2}\\leq C\\beta\\eta\\,\\mathbb{E}[e_{y}(W)^{2}\\mid Y_{+}=y]\\,v^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})v\\,. (C.20)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1286637-1288573",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1286637,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1288573,
      "raw_sha256": "abe0bd5cde85bb2b6a7696803e36bdb36260a26a6881481bf7c4081cca29a631",
      "lf_sha256": "abe0bd5cde85bb2b6a7696803e36bdb36260a26a6881481bf7c4081cca29a631",
      "source_text": "|\\varepsilon_{y}^{\\top}v|^{2}\\leq C\\beta\\eta\\,\\mathbb{E}[e_{y}(W)^{2}\\mid Y_{+}=y]\\,v^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})v\\,. (C.20)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p8.4",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1288591,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1288694,
      "raw_sha256": "3447a047701cb37d4c5c780fcdaf1afa085f3bd24c7a690b8b371770fad120e4",
      "lf_sha256": "3447a047701cb37d4c5c780fcdaf1afa085f3bd24c7a690b8b371770fad120e4",
      "source_text": "We will also use"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.E21",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1288695,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1289699,
      "raw_sha256": "ce447bc1780609321f9f9ce6fd41d0a27be33f74c181735d5960669c0d0dabba",
      "lf_sha256": "ce447bc1780609321f9f9ce6fd41d0a27be33f74c181735d5960669c0d0dabba",
      "source_text": "0\\preceq I-\\Sigma_{y}\\preceq\\beta\\eta I\\,. (C.21)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1288758-1289682",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1288758,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1289682,
      "raw_sha256": "7dd7035311c59ce0b988443f5343d0d16a291b5241eb59d1f3f21ad2dcaa12c4",
      "lf_sha256": "7dd7035311c59ce0b988443f5343d0d16a291b5241eb59d1f3f21ad2dcaa12c4",
      "source_text": "0\\preceq I-\\Sigma_{y}\\preceq\\beta\\eta I\\,. (C.21)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p8.5",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1289700,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1290561,
      "raw_sha256": "191b91ef71b718515494ad1a6634083a8e4ea6dcb2a69f1cba259b5f67dd775c",
      "lf_sha256": "191b91ef71b718515494ad1a6634083a8e4ea6dcb2a69f1cba259b5f67dd775c",
      "source_text": "The two-sided bound in Lemma B.1 , together with the fact that \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} fixes constants, gives"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex60",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1290562,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1291634,
      "raw_sha256": "be7134f17d9e8b8539ccc164c4bcb16a95f8b5db637fc74499bab609917b8923",
      "lf_sha256": "be7134f17d9e8b8539ccc164c4bcb16a95f8b5db637fc74499bab609917b8923",
      "source_text": "(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})^{2}\\preceq 3\\,(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{2})"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1290626-1291617",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1290626,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1291617,
      "raw_sha256": "d4f87cb9adc1c9ead9f58cbc1aa7c7ebed4eacc76f60d6c98d260fdfb25c9a32",
      "lf_sha256": "d4f87cb9adc1c9ead9f58cbc1aa7c7ebed4eacc76f60d6c98d260fdfb25c9a32",
      "source_text": "(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})^{2}\\preceq 3\\,(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{2})"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p8.6",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1291635,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1293041,
      "raw_sha256": "9f3cf6da849a681f31d8c262f92aa0d83b142c79934efb33f7d85c0ae689d3c7",
      "lf_sha256": "9f3cf6da849a681f31d8c262f92aa0d83b142c79934efb33f7d85c0ae689d3c7",
      "source_text": "on L^{2}(\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}) . Since a_{y}=(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}\\nabla w)(y) , with \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}} acting coordinatewise,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.E22",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1293042,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1295088,
      "raw_sha256": "19269281909105ac823b5bf1ffdbd7bdf8d1755e26dac3a47fd94cf38b7b2622",
      "lf_sha256": "19269281909105ac823b5bf1ffdbd7bdf8d1755e26dac3a47fd94cf38b7b2622",
      "source_text": "\\mathcal{R}=\\bigl\\langle\\nabla w,(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{2})\\nabla w\\bigr\\rangle\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\int\\|\\nabla w(y)-a_{y}\\|^{2}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\leq 3\\mathcal{R}\\,. (C.22)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1293105-1295071",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1293105,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1295071,
      "raw_sha256": "cd76cfd2a7500d5c68a104ca65f4cae85be4ed74d2e5256a6ab0b273cca335e4",
      "lf_sha256": "cd76cfd2a7500d5c68a104ca65f4cae85be4ed74d2e5256a6ab0b273cca335e4",
      "source_text": "\\mathcal{R}=\\bigl\\langle\\nabla w,(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{2})\\nabla w\\bigr\\rangle\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\int\\|\\nabla w(y)-a_{y}\\|^{2}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\leq 3\\mathcal{R}\\,. (C.22)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p9.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1295134,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1296836,
      "raw_sha256": "8e8ed6f1ded88dd5c3e749fe390394f2926ff336cc984cda00525d9eccee1d0c",
      "lf_sha256": "8e8ed6f1ded88dd5c3e749fe390394f2926ff336cc984cda00525d9eccee1d0c",
      "source_text": "We now control \\mathcal{R} and the affine energy simultaneously. Take the L^{2}(\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}) inner product of ( C.19 ) with the vector field y\\mapsto\\nabla w(y)+a_{y} . Since"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.Ex61",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1296837,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1298664,
      "raw_sha256": "b9b38bd3342dc6c5bccf7352f4979cdcf3361a3e4443bfeb977205b9633a4bd1",
      "lf_sha256": "b9b38bd3342dc6c5bccf7352f4979cdcf3361a3e4443bfeb977205b9633a4bd1",
      "source_text": "\\int\\{\\nabla w(y)-a_{y}\\}^{\\top}\\{\\nabla w(y)+a_{y}\\}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)=\\mathcal{R}\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1296901-1298647",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1296901,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1298647,
      "raw_sha256": "08382e9450bf0a086c8e26f31bcd9cbc8586b35df5917a5f84ffa6735a9051a0",
      "lf_sha256": "08382e9450bf0a086c8e26f31bcd9cbc8586b35df5917a5f84ffa6735a9051a0",
      "source_text": "\\int\\{\\nabla w(y)-a_{y}\\}^{\\top}\\{\\nabla w(y)+a_{y}\\}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)=\\mathcal{R}\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p9.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1298665,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1298780,
      "raw_sha256": "dc9da9306c9253bbea0a5c28556f43c768cf1c6c67324c1d65e24e18ae5dccda",
      "lf_sha256": "dc9da9306c9253bbea0a5c28556f43c768cf1c6c67324c1d65e24e18ae5dccda",
      "source_text": "we obtain the exact identity"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1298878-1301523",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1298878,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1301523,
      "raw_sha256": "316df5b49eb7a42594ebf57f21e08486d58680a793e7d241fad9913761383e46",
      "lf_sha256": "316df5b49eb7a42594ebf57f21e08486d58680a793e7d241fad9913761383e46",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\mathcal{R}+4\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y) \\displaystyle=\\int[\\nabla(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w](y)^{\\top}\\{\\nabla w(y)+a_{y}\\}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1301552-1302917",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1301552,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1302917,
      "raw_sha256": "2870199ec6a7b6b765956aa4f05cb112664ee823f199c5e3ee36cdfef31f86b2",
      "lf_sha256": "2870199ec6a7b6b765956aa4f05cb112664ee823f199c5e3ee36cdfef31f86b2",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\hskip 20.00003pt-2\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})\\{\\nabla w(y)-a_{y}\\}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1302945-1304433",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1302945,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1304433,
      "raw_sha256": "9bb3502c0f0a3ca0cbc3a24caf15f087dae86baa0f9e57fd098057fe680647e7",
      "lf_sha256": "9bb3502c0f0a3ca0cbc3a24caf15f087dae86baa0f9e57fd098057fe680647e7",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\hskip 20.00003pt-\\eta^{-1/2}\\int\\varepsilon_{y}^{\\top}\\{\\nabla w(y)+a_{y}\\}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\,. (C.23)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p10.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1304497,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1305596,
      "raw_sha256": "cca3dd7baf4fee1885cb975931b278a9e662411dbb551185a47102e1019a612d",
      "lf_sha256": "cca3dd7baf4fee1885cb975931b278a9e662411dbb551185a47102e1019a612d",
      "source_text": "We bound the three terms on the right separately. For the first, conditional Jensen gives \\int\\|a_{y}\\|^{2}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\leq\\|\\nabla w\\|^{2} , and hence"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.E24",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1305597,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1307971,
      "raw_sha256": "2a713d2f6f8b5cf602f36c4b2ad0c8643e558c2418295d49c39d3dd34e11f95a",
      "lf_sha256": "2a713d2f6f8b5cf602f36c4b2ad0c8643e558c2418295d49c39d3dd34e11f95a",
      "source_text": "\\Bigl\\lvert\\int[\\nabla(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w](y)^{\\top}\\{\\nabla w(y)+a_{y}\\}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\Bigr\\rvert\\leq 2\\,\\|\\nabla(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w\\|\\,\\|\\nabla w\\|\\,. (C.24)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1305660-1307954",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1305660,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1307954,
      "raw_sha256": "d37f35d4a7fa575b222cc07ea64818fc2b166fe36bed81b2ce0705888ac6dd17",
      "lf_sha256": "d37f35d4a7fa575b222cc07ea64818fc2b166fe36bed81b2ce0705888ac6dd17",
      "source_text": "\\Bigl\\lvert\\int[\\nabla(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w](y)^{\\top}\\{\\nabla w(y)+a_{y}\\}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\Bigr\\rvert\\leq 2\\,\\|\\nabla(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w\\|\\,\\|\\nabla w\\|\\,. (C.24)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p10.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1307972,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1308790,
      "raw_sha256": "32da5d9c8259c133cc1bff2532f520f8cfd1ca3a3d4bed6c847a66b4b68b0765",
      "lf_sha256": "32da5d9c8259c133cc1bff2532f520f8cfd1ca3a3d4bed6c847a66b4b68b0765",
      "source_text": "For the second, Cauchy–Schwarz, ( C.21 ), and ( C.22 ) give"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1308887-1312319",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1308887,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1312319,
      "raw_sha256": "977a4d7b69e7a0563b475fbf66703a509d130fe8aef23ef964ac5796c07cc8a0",
      "lf_sha256": "977a4d7b69e7a0563b475fbf66703a509d130fe8aef23ef964ac5796c07cc8a0",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle 2\\,\\Bigl|\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})\\{\\nabla w(y)-a_{y}\\}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\Bigr|\\leq C\\sqrt{\\beta\\eta}\\,\\mathcal{R}^{1/2}\\,\\Bigl\\{\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\Bigr\\}^{1/2}\\,. (C.25)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p10.3",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1312337,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1314144,
      "raw_sha256": "159ffcdaade8a9d1c01045230d05ae1023015e03373c8aedfc524d969742d83b",
      "lf_sha256": "159ffcdaade8a9d1c01045230d05ae1023015e03373c8aedfc524d969742d83b",
      "source_text": "Finally, using the pointwise identity \\nabla w(y)+a_{y}=\\{\\nabla w(y)-a_{y}\\}+2a_{y} , ( C.21 ) and ( C.22 ) imply"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1314241-1317530",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1314241,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1317530,
      "raw_sha256": "bc303b33eac5e6d96b5389c73743f9e645ebab18615d07f01049503cec317cdf",
      "lf_sha256": "bc303b33eac5e6d96b5389c73743f9e645ebab18615d07f01049503cec317cdf",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\int\\{\\nabla w(y)+a_{y}\\}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})\\{\\nabla w(y)+a_{y}\\}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\leq C\\beta\\eta\\,\\mathcal{R}+8\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\,. (C.26)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p10.4",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1317548,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1318950,
      "raw_sha256": "4a978114da38d4292fec1e1c40fa9ae3090371f4bd3ece2a3751f26577e18e5e",
      "lf_sha256": "4a978114da38d4292fec1e1c40fa9ae3090371f4bd3ece2a3751f26577e18e5e",
      "source_text": "Using ( C.20 ), Cauchy–Schwarz in y , ( C.17 ), and ( C.26 ), we obtain"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1319048-1320513",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1319048,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1320513,
      "raw_sha256": "a870124015fb5357ad20355e0912bfb9ae7302464f6ef0d9740f7aba9f71c285",
      "lf_sha256": "a870124015fb5357ad20355e0912bfb9ae7302464f6ef0d9740f7aba9f71c285",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\eta^{-1/2}\\,\\Bigl|\\int\\varepsilon_{y}^{\\top}\\{\\nabla w(y)+a_{y}\\}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\Bigr|"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1320542-1322655",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1320542,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1322655,
      "raw_sha256": "951ffe070702df29b8c88da06d3f02be9594398951ed7aa9ca11e286d79a973b",
      "lf_sha256": "951ffe070702df29b8c88da06d3f02be9594398951ed7aa9ca11e286d79a973b",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\hskip 20.00003pt\\leq C\\sqrt{\\beta\\eta\\,\\mathcal{R}}\\,\\Bigl\\{\\beta\\eta\\,\\mathcal{R}+\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\Bigr\\}^{1/2}"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1322683-1325112",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1322683,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1325112,
      "raw_sha256": "adc3d9135316113ed691987e0f05f8ae42d12a754eba5f11e9979cbd7288ba28",
      "lf_sha256": "adc3d9135316113ed691987e0f05f8ae42d12a754eba5f11e9979cbd7288ba28",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\hskip 20.00003pt\\leq C\\sqrt{\\beta\\eta}\\,\\mathcal{R}^{1/2}\\,\\Bigl\\{\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\Bigr\\}^{1/2}+C\\beta\\eta\\,\\mathcal{R}\\,. (C.27)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p11.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1325176,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1325653,
      "raw_sha256": "ca26dfce7182d10d4366f54ea437db8a741704c0c942a0c645a7e448e42e7680",
      "lf_sha256": "ca26dfce7182d10d4366f54ea437db8a741704c0c942a0c645a7e448e42e7680",
      "source_text": "Substituting these three estimates into ( C.23 ) gives"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1325751-1327870",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1325751,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1327870,
      "raw_sha256": "b2419532329ba3194e46e8b5c84e246c9383d77492cff5188955fbc786b21b44",
      "lf_sha256": "b2419532329ba3194e46e8b5c84e246c9383d77492cff5188955fbc786b21b44",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\mathcal{R}+4\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y) \\displaystyle\\leq 2\\,\\|\\nabla(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w\\|\\,\\|\\nabla w\\|"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1327899-1330120",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1327899,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1330120,
      "raw_sha256": "6f84bffa1d514dcd0bdd5ade9bdd1c6d8b66990b1675254d9a9f7680a45f8015",
      "lf_sha256": "6f84bffa1d514dcd0bdd5ade9bdd1c6d8b66990b1675254d9a9f7680a45f8015",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\hskip 20.00003pt+C\\sqrt{\\beta\\eta}\\,\\mathcal{R}^{1/2}\\Bigl\\{\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)\\Bigr\\}^{1/2}+C\\beta\\eta\\,\\mathcal{R}\\,."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p11.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1330138,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1330997,
      "raw_sha256": "001bfb17d7b7f446455ecb2d246cb4810a5c2828a910d91ba7a8bbc1aea1ef0c",
      "lf_sha256": "001bfb17d7b7f446455ecb2d246cb4810a5c2828a910d91ba7a8bbc1aea1ef0c",
      "source_text": "For sufficiently small universal \\beta\\eta , the last two terms are absorbed into the left-hand side. This proves ( C.18 ). ∎"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.4",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "proof-container",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1331012,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1348510,
      "raw_sha256": "145a79a98b420490e13545f829a3c8e6b5b3ec6d04e66d71e0835285d2843703",
      "lf_sha256": "145a79a98b420490e13545f829a3c8e6b5b3ec6d04e66d71e0835285d2843703",
      "source_text": "Proof of Proposition C.5 . Choose a small enough universal constant in the hypothesis, if necessary, so that Lemma C.6 applies. On \\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbf{1}_{[1/2,1]}(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})) , the operator \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{-1} is bounded. Applying ( B.13 ) first to \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}w and then to \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w gives \\displaystyle\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\|\\nabla w\\| \\displaystyle\\leq C\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}w\\|\\leq C\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}w\\|\\,, \\displaystyle\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\|\\nabla(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w\\| \\displaystyle\\leq C\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w\\|\\leq C\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{3}w\\|\\,. (C.28) Here, the final inequality in each line follows by spectral calculus on [\\frac{1}{2},1] . Decompose \\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}w according to ( C.15 ). The affine part has coefficient 2\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,a_{y} , so Proposition C.2 , \\|I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp}\\|\\leq 2 applied to the error term, and (r+s)^{2}\\leq 2r^{2}+2s^{2} give \\displaystyle\\|(I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp})\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}w\\|^{2} \\displaystyle\\leq C\\beta\\eta^{2}\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)+C\\,\\mathbb{E}[e_{Y_{+}}(W)^{2}] \\displaystyle\\leq C\\eta\\,\\|\\nabla(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w\\|\\,\\|\\nabla w\\|\\,, where the last line uses \\beta\\eta\\leq 1 and Lemma C.6 . Finally, ( C.28 ) gives ( C.14 ). ∎"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p12.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1331648,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1334836,
      "raw_sha256": "c4700d26cac12de5dc52e73a98ff1dc1087bc5b8c473dbec1c9af7e66cceff16",
      "lf_sha256": "c4700d26cac12de5dc52e73a98ff1dc1087bc5b8c473dbec1c9af7e66cceff16",
      "source_text": "Choose a small enough universal constant in the hypothesis, if necessary, so that Lemma C.6 applies. On \\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbf{1}_{[1/2,1]}(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})) , the operator \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{-1} is bounded. Applying ( B.13 ) first to \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}w and then to \\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w gives"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1334934-1336909",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1334934,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1336909,
      "raw_sha256": "5844067807dba39fdc410962ea96d158498ef3b24e7801e3543ab834d616cc89",
      "lf_sha256": "5844067807dba39fdc410962ea96d158498ef3b24e7801e3543ab834d616cc89",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\|\\nabla w\\| \\displaystyle\\leq C\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}w\\|\\leq C\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}w\\|\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1336937-1339489",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1336937,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1339489,
      "raw_sha256": "6902d280a01f2443f42f66efe4317d08b45f7d6ff499f025509b47f98f4bef88",
      "lf_sha256": "6902d280a01f2443f42f66efe4317d08b45f7d6ff499f025509b47f98f4bef88",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\|\\nabla(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w\\| \\displaystyle\\leq C\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}^{-1}(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w\\|\\leq C\\,\\|\\mathsf{\\Gamma}_{\\mathsf{P}}^{3}w\\|\\,. (C.28)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p12.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1339507,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1339993,
      "raw_sha256": "3f594d74f2298e586dc0e77fe77422faaef10114f08f0f5799c10f48d9f1eecc",
      "lf_sha256": "3f594d74f2298e586dc0e77fe77422faaef10114f08f0f5799c10f48d9f1eecc",
      "source_text": "Here, the final inequality in each line follows by spectral calculus on [\\frac{1}{2},1] ."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p13.1",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1340040,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1342873,
      "raw_sha256": "ab06ef2164f4bfa9de5bcf065a0eae2fde0d12932ccae2aeecc3623b9223adaf",
      "lf_sha256": "ab06ef2164f4bfa9de5bcf065a0eae2fde0d12932ccae2aeecc3623b9223adaf",
      "source_text": "Decompose \\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}w according to ( C.15 ). The affine part has coefficient 2\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,a_{y} , so Proposition C.2 , \\|I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp}\\|\\leq 2 applied to the error term, and (r+s)^{2}\\leq 2r^{2}+2s^{2} give"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1342971-1345753",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1342971,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1345753,
      "raw_sha256": "7ac18aae6112a538cd6fa998f01d5c33003bc34f4ac38c785442ef1ebd075e6c",
      "lf_sha256": "7ac18aae6112a538cd6fa998f01d5c33003bc34f4ac38c785442ef1ebd075e6c",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\|(I+\\mathsf{H}_{\\perp\\perp})\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}w\\|^{2} \\displaystyle\\leq C\\beta\\eta^{2}\\int a_{y}^{\\top}(I-\\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\\,\\pi_{\\eta}^{Y}(\\mathrm{d}y)+C\\,\\mathbb{E}[e_{Y_{+}}(W)^{2}]"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1345782-1346809",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1345782,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1346809,
      "raw_sha256": "f72cb095ed0ede6cf67944cb4f1dde66d4bb4ff147a8e358982fd93708df6086",
      "lf_sha256": "f72cb095ed0ede6cf67944cb4f1dde66d4bb4ff147a8e358982fd93708df6086",
      "source_text": "\\displaystyle\\leq C\\eta\\,\\|\\nabla(I-\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}})w\\|\\,\\|\\nabla w\\|\\,,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A3.SS3.p13.2",
      "anchor_container": "A3.SS3",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Interpolation/half-turn and spectral-localization downstream lane; excluded from marginal PI construction.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1346827,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1348496,
      "raw_sha256": "85671f23e369288dd8d0e2bedafd3dc2171caf8c96f53c83d1ef4e6b6fa4a4b9",
      "lf_sha256": "85671f23e369288dd8d0e2bedafd3dc2171caf8c96f53c83d1ef4e6b6fa4a4b9",
      "source_text": "where the last line uses \\beta\\eta\\leq 1 and Lemma C.6 . Finally, ( C.28 ) gives ( C.14 ). ∎"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.Thmtheorem1",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS1",
      "kind": "source-statement",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Hilbert/Markov/spectral conventions; separate context for Gamma, not marginal PI proof.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1349084,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1355944,
      "raw_sha256": "87084b576f520a1dd35b5fabe73f562d718c437ee5ca60c5b9eaa2d814c25baa",
      "lf_sha256": "87084b576f520a1dd35b5fabe73f562d718c437ee5ca60c5b9eaa2d814c25baa",
      "source_text": "Definition D.1 (Hilbert space notation) . Let \\zeta be a probability measure. The real Hilbert space L^{2}(\\zeta) consists of equivalence classes of measurable functions f such that \\int f^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}\\zeta<\\infty . Its inner product and norm are \\langle f,g\\rangle_{L^{2}(\\zeta)}\\coloneqq\\int fg\\,\\mathrm{d}\\zeta\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\|f\\|_{L^{2}(\\zeta)}\\coloneqq\\langle f,f\\rangle_{L^{2}(\\zeta)}^{1/2}\\,. (D.1) We write L_{0}^{2}(\\zeta)\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{f\\in L^{2}(\\zeta):\\int f\\,\\mathrm{d}\\zeta=0\\Bigr\\}\\,. (D.2) When \\zeta=\\pi_{\\eta} , we abbreviate the inner product and norm by \\langle f,g\\rangle and \\|f\\| ."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.Thmtheorem1.p1.1",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Hilbert/Markov/spectral conventions; separate context for Gamma, not marginal PI proof.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1349538,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1350965,
      "raw_sha256": "441f86a771ac6ab03eccd7b815ec916d2166fb5dee5e51e88631709d17b4f244",
      "lf_sha256": "441f86a771ac6ab03eccd7b815ec916d2166fb5dee5e51e88631709d17b4f244",
      "source_text": "Let \\zeta be a probability measure. The real Hilbert space L^{2}(\\zeta) consists of equivalence classes of measurable functions f such that \\int f^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}\\zeta<\\infty . Its inner product and norm are"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.E1",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Hilbert/Markov/spectral conventions; separate context for Gamma, not marginal PI proof.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1350966,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1353270,
      "raw_sha256": "3103a8e41f99b902f93b5ba15d3e89c2c9b0816d7a7880ceabc3379bdae6e4d5",
      "lf_sha256": "3103a8e41f99b902f93b5ba15d3e89c2c9b0816d7a7880ceabc3379bdae6e4d5",
      "source_text": "\\langle f,g\\rangle_{L^{2}(\\zeta)}\\coloneqq\\int fg\\,\\mathrm{d}\\zeta\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\|f\\|_{L^{2}(\\zeta)}\\coloneqq\\langle f,f\\rangle_{L^{2}(\\zeta)}^{1/2}\\,. (D.1)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1351028-1353253",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Hilbert/Markov/spectral conventions; separate context for Gamma, not marginal PI proof.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1351028,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1353253,
      "raw_sha256": "71ee7126d3ab4d3aaeb965bac64eaad74b23fd754f5fc5189f297f0b7fabad38",
      "lf_sha256": "71ee7126d3ab4d3aaeb965bac64eaad74b23fd754f5fc5189f297f0b7fabad38",
      "source_text": "\\langle f,g\\rangle_{L^{2}(\\zeta)}\\coloneqq\\int fg\\,\\mathrm{d}\\zeta\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\|f\\|_{L^{2}(\\zeta)}\\coloneqq\\langle f,f\\rangle_{L^{2}(\\zeta)}^{1/2}\\,. (D.1)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.Thmtheorem1.p1.2",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Hilbert/Markov/spectral conventions; separate context for Gamma, not marginal PI proof.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1353271,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1353325,
      "raw_sha256": "306f175f8b93e9fd6e8aa58130c495ed23800670978c03570675fa9ec88d282b",
      "lf_sha256": "306f175f8b93e9fd6e8aa58130c495ed23800670978c03570675fa9ec88d282b",
      "source_text": "We write"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.E2",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Hilbert/Markov/spectral conventions; separate context for Gamma, not marginal PI proof.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1353326,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1354877,
      "raw_sha256": "6cea332ce8e4b8feee47693b33ccb040d349dc98952bca41da0ac10dbe9af321",
      "lf_sha256": "6cea332ce8e4b8feee47693b33ccb040d349dc98952bca41da0ac10dbe9af321",
      "source_text": "L_{0}^{2}(\\zeta)\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{f\\in L^{2}(\\zeta):\\int f\\,\\mathrm{d}\\zeta=0\\Bigr\\}\\,. (D.2)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1353388-1354860",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Hilbert/Markov/spectral conventions; separate context for Gamma, not marginal PI proof.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1353388,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1354860,
      "raw_sha256": "55746023458ba8293067acd91ee3a19235ba365abd5be5548b5c773bd95db6eb",
      "lf_sha256": "55746023458ba8293067acd91ee3a19235ba365abd5be5548b5c773bd95db6eb",
      "source_text": "L_{0}^{2}(\\zeta)\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{f\\in L^{2}(\\zeta):\\int f\\,\\mathrm{d}\\zeta=0\\Bigr\\}\\,. (D.2)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.Thmtheorem1.p1.3",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Hilbert/Markov/spectral conventions; separate context for Gamma, not marginal PI proof.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1354878,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1355930,
      "raw_sha256": "e1ae0ea51cc37af9a9971352578b5207cfd4f6168e61f98bd3bdac61ff0597c4",
      "lf_sha256": "e1ae0ea51cc37af9a9971352578b5207cfd4f6168e61f98bd3bdac61ff0597c4",
      "source_text": "When \\zeta=\\pi_{\\eta} , we abbreviate the inner product and norm by \\langle f,g\\rangle and \\|f\\| ."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.SS1.p1.1",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Hilbert/Markov/spectral conventions; separate context for Gamma, not marginal PI proof.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1355983,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1359142,
      "raw_sha256": "075d90e72867f87d854212cc43d565c5974fcca81362160b2247bef46520f087",
      "lf_sha256": "075d90e72867f87d854212cc43d565c5974fcca81362160b2247bef46520f087",
      "source_text": "Two functions equal \\zeta -almost everywhere represent the same vector. A closed linear subspace \\mathcal{M}\\subseteq L^{2}(\\zeta) has orthogonal complement \\mathcal{M}^{\\perp}\\coloneqq\\{g:\\langle f,g\\rangle=0\\text{ for all }f\\in\\mathcal{M}\\} . Its orthogonal projection is the unique bounded operator \\mathsf{P}_{\\mathcal{M}} for which \\mathsf{P}_{\\mathcal{M}}f\\in\\mathcal{M} and f-\\mathsf{P}_{\\mathcal{M}}f\\in\\mathcal{M}^{\\perp} ."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.SS1.p2.1",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Hilbert/Markov/spectral conventions; separate context for Gamma, not marginal PI proof.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1359188,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1362009,
      "raw_sha256": "03199d15504a574904ad72fa4d89c53f29c97786d18ca5aa82991c322845a317",
      "lf_sha256": "03199d15504a574904ad72fa4d89c53f29c97786d18ca5aa82991c322845a317",
      "source_text": "All operators in the convergence analysis are bounded linear operators on the indicated Hilbert spaces unless explicitly stated otherwise. The adjoint \\mathsf{L}^{*} is characterized by \\langle\\mathsf{L}f,g\\rangle=\\langle f,\\mathsf{L}^{*}g\\rangle . An operator is self-adjoint if \\mathsf{L}=\\mathsf{L}^{*} , a contraction if \\|\\mathsf{L}f\\|\\leq\\|f\\| , and unitary if it is onto and preserves norms. A self-adjoint involution, meaning \\mathsf{L}^{2}=I , is unitary. For self-adjoint operators \\mathsf{L}_{1},\\mathsf{L}_{2} ,"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.E3",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Hilbert/Markov/spectral conventions; separate context for Gamma, not marginal PI proof.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1362010,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1363500,
      "raw_sha256": "7ee578edbde6ac223041812df28068b46ce1049e8a5ca76c1f9317a2bdd2db4c",
      "lf_sha256": "7ee578edbde6ac223041812df28068b46ce1049e8a5ca76c1f9317a2bdd2db4c",
      "source_text": "\\mathsf{L}_{1}\\preceq\\mathsf{L}_{2}\\hskip 10.00002pt\\Longleftrightarrow\\hskip 10.00002pt\\langle f,(\\mathsf{L}_{2}-\\mathsf{L}_{1})f\\rangle\\geq 0\\hskip 10.00002pt\\text{for every }f (D.3)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1362072-1363483",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Hilbert/Markov/spectral conventions; separate context for Gamma, not marginal PI proof.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1362072,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1363483,
      "raw_sha256": "e42f2f510a46e456fa6cd029783d67a13823321ac143f0c3efa29ed41b344099",
      "lf_sha256": "e42f2f510a46e456fa6cd029783d67a13823321ac143f0c3efa29ed41b344099",
      "source_text": "\\mathsf{L}_{1}\\preceq\\mathsf{L}_{2}\\hskip 10.00002pt\\Longleftrightarrow\\hskip 10.00002pt\\langle f,(\\mathsf{L}_{2}-\\mathsf{L}_{1})f\\rangle\\geq 0\\hskip 10.00002pt\\text{for every }f (D.3)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.SS1.p2.2",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Hilbert/Markov/spectral conventions; separate context for Gamma, not marginal PI proof.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1363501,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1365064,
      "raw_sha256": "b8965f3a4664b38a5bda50e552ef6c2f14f689a24492851c7722a361e9da86bf",
      "lf_sha256": "b8965f3a4664b38a5bda50e552ef6c2f14f689a24492851c7722a361e9da86bf",
      "source_text": "is the Loewner order. If \\mathsf{L} is self-adjoint, the spectral theorem defines \\psi(\\mathsf{L}) for bounded Borel functions \\psi ; in particular \\mathbf{1}_{E}(\\mathsf{L}) is the orthogonal projection onto the spectral set E , and a non-negative operator has a unique non-negative square root."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.Thmtheorem2",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS1",
      "kind": "source-statement",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Hilbert/Markov/spectral conventions; separate context for Gamma, not marginal PI proof.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1365072,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1369536,
      "raw_sha256": "3a51dbee2ffbddb3bc95a2863aa4abf94527ff687d109a276128f161cf4c633d",
      "lf_sha256": "3a51dbee2ffbddb3bc95a2863aa4abf94527ff687d109a276128f161cf4c633d",
      "source_text": "Definition D.2 (Markov operators and density evolution) . Let \\mathcal{K}(z,\\mathrm{d}z^{\\prime}) be a Markov kernel preserving \\zeta . Its Markov operator on observables is (\\mathsf{K}f)(z)\\coloneqq\\int f(z^{\\prime})\\,\\mathcal{K}(z,\\mathrm{d}z^{\\prime})\\,. (D.4) It is a contraction on L^{2}(\\zeta) . Its adjoint \\mathsf{K}^{*} governs density evolution: if a law has density h with respect to \\zeta , then its density after one step is \\mathsf{K}^{*}h . Constants are fixed by both operators."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.Thmtheorem2.p1.1",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Hilbert/Markov/spectral conventions; separate context for Gamma, not marginal PI proof.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1365542,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1366365,
      "raw_sha256": "d6a7bd044b0741d47fe56e22d7e81c04fd94c9f1909970aa997f0fe1ba6b8d6f",
      "lf_sha256": "d6a7bd044b0741d47fe56e22d7e81c04fd94c9f1909970aa997f0fe1ba6b8d6f",
      "source_text": "Let \\mathcal{K}(z,\\mathrm{d}z^{\\prime}) be a Markov kernel preserving \\zeta . Its Markov operator on observables is"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.E4",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Hilbert/Markov/spectral conventions; separate context for Gamma, not marginal PI proof.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1366366,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1367986,
      "raw_sha256": "1d63e3fab9a690675f0c3d60238763da4e99291743dea9772ec529474a41add5",
      "lf_sha256": "1d63e3fab9a690675f0c3d60238763da4e99291743dea9772ec529474a41add5",
      "source_text": "(\\mathsf{K}f)(z)\\coloneqq\\int f(z^{\\prime})\\,\\mathcal{K}(z,\\mathrm{d}z^{\\prime})\\,. (D.4)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1366428-1367969",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Hilbert/Markov/spectral conventions; separate context for Gamma, not marginal PI proof.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1366428,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1367969,
      "raw_sha256": "d55dd11f585f55208f99f6f0c95eed428d6fe7cb5e6319e05c4c79c314176694",
      "lf_sha256": "d55dd11f585f55208f99f6f0c95eed428d6fe7cb5e6319e05c4c79c314176694",
      "source_text": "(\\mathsf{K}f)(z)\\coloneqq\\int f(z^{\\prime})\\,\\mathcal{K}(z,\\mathrm{d}z^{\\prime})\\,. (D.4)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.Thmtheorem2.p1.2",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Hilbert/Markov/spectral conventions; separate context for Gamma, not marginal PI proof.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1367987,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1369522,
      "raw_sha256": "00176faacac7ff43b551c4c2ccd3c40db45c89fc6be64f41f203def645f3b3d8",
      "lf_sha256": "00176faacac7ff43b551c4c2ccd3c40db45c89fc6be64f41f203def645f3b3d8",
      "source_text": "It is a contraction on L^{2}(\\zeta) . Its adjoint \\mathsf{K}^{*} governs density evolution: if a law has density h with respect to \\zeta , then its density after one step is \\mathsf{K}^{*}h . Constants are fixed by both operators."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.SS1.p3.1",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Hilbert/Markov/spectral conventions; separate context for Gamma, not marginal PI proof.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1369575,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1370053,
      "raw_sha256": "588974dce22d51ae703327a2c9660f315381fd3667da40b6f0dc882d56357d2c",
      "lf_sha256": "588974dce22d51ae703327a2c9660f315381fd3667da40b6f0dc882d56357d2c",
      "source_text": "If P\\ll\\zeta has density h , then"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.E5",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Hilbert/Markov/spectral conventions; separate context for Gamma, not marginal PI proof.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1370054,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1371149,
      "raw_sha256": "5bede8da081666f294ffac53e866a322752fe8a877714d5bef6086f7d92eafd0",
      "lf_sha256": "5bede8da081666f294ffac53e866a322752fe8a877714d5bef6086f7d92eafd0",
      "source_text": "\\chi^{2}(P\\|\\zeta)=\\|h-1\\|_{\\zeta}^{2}\\,. (D.5)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1370116-1371132",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS1",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Hilbert/Markov/spectral conventions; separate context for Gamma, not marginal PI proof.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1370116,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1371132,
      "raw_sha256": "0de364c15c500f47d4dacb0c2fb2578d343123069010b357effb9fb7a057d3e0",
      "lf_sha256": "0de364c15c500f47d4dacb0c2fb2578d343123069010b357effb9fb7a057d3e0",
      "source_text": "\\chi^{2}(P\\|\\zeta)=\\|h-1\\|_{\\zeta}^{2}\\,. (D.5)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.SS1.p3.2",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS1",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "Hilbert/Markov/spectral conventions; separate context for Gamma, not marginal PI proof.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1371150,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1372345,
      "raw_sha256": "45b753e1f1f1b027764e06235e9af5ef3e5315eb715bea3dca96988dad477387",
      "lf_sha256": "45b753e1f1f1b027764e06235e9af5ef3e5315eb715bea3dca96988dad477387",
      "source_text": "Consequently, an operator norm bound for \\mathsf{K} on L_{0}^{2}(\\zeta) gives the same bound for its adjoint \\mathsf{K}^{*} , and hence gives \\chi^{2} contraction."
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.SS2.p1.1",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1372591,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1374049,
      "raw_sha256": "17fc38c09f6ab6759235ed31a53ae8411ea5a3dc3bb510419d308d589322f308",
      "lf_sha256": "17fc38c09f6ab6759235ed31a53ae8411ea5a3dc3bb510419d308d589322f308",
      "source_text": "We repeatedly use the following standard consequences of Bakry–Émery curvature. If a probability measure \\nu(\\mathrm{d}z)\\propto e^{-W(z)}\\,\\mathrm{d}z satisfies \\nabla^{2}W\\succeq mI , then, for smooth f ,",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A4.SS2.p1.1"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.E6",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1374050,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1375315,
      "raw_sha256": "88edb420beeb531d3346c9ed577162084b1574bd45f7c0fda221e7367fad709d",
      "lf_sha256": "88edb420beeb531d3346c9ed577162084b1574bd45f7c0fda221e7367fad709d",
      "source_text": "\\Var_{\\nu}(f)\\leq\\frac{1}{m}\\,\\mathbb{E}_{\\nu}\\|\\nabla f\\|^{2}\\,, (D.6)",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A4.E6"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1374112-1375298",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1374112,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1375298,
      "raw_sha256": "be434be9d8f461c450bc8740693459285630e3f658ea16db0878520f7b8a9e0e",
      "lf_sha256": "be434be9d8f461c450bc8740693459285630e3f658ea16db0878520f7b8a9e0e",
      "source_text": "\\Var_{\\nu}(f)\\leq\\frac{1}{m}\\,\\mathbb{E}_{\\nu}\\|\\nabla f\\|^{2}\\,, (D.6)",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:byte-1374112-1375298"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.SS2.p1.2",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "D.7 Gaussian concentration/LSI consequences are not consumed by bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1375316,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1376247,
      "raw_sha256": "3cb5bbd2301f2212bdd269b500d09b22a852aceea943a17940dfafeef9005612",
      "lf_sha256": "3cb5bbd2301f2212bdd269b500d09b22a852aceea943a17940dfafeef9005612",
      "source_text": "and \\nu satisfies the log-Sobolev inequality with constant 1/m . In particular, every L -Lipschitz f obeys Gaussian concentration"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.E7",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "EXCLUDED",
      "reason": "D.7 Gaussian concentration/LSI consequences are not consumed by bounded marginal PI delta.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1376248,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1377613,
      "raw_sha256": "ca9356a30ed5e41e87b38e37bd9769953b17b59c1b471cf411f9fbbb7866c834",
      "lf_sha256": "ca9356a30ed5e41e87b38e37bd9769953b17b59c1b471cf411f9fbbb7866c834",
      "source_text": "\\mathbb{P}\\{f-\\mathbb{E}f\\geq t\\}\\leq\\exp\\Bigl(-\\frac{mt^{2}}{2L^{2}}\\Bigr)\\,. (D.7)"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1376310-1377596",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1376310,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1377596,
      "raw_sha256": "dc0be162ab5c9d8c895704604a326ff446ce7d0a1ce832fdc5d6c76be0fb3813",
      "lf_sha256": "dc0be162ab5c9d8c895704604a326ff446ce7d0a1ce832fdc5d6c76be0fb3813",
      "source_text": "\\mathbb{P}\\{f-\\mathbb{E}f\\geq t\\}\\leq\\exp\\Bigl(-\\frac{mt^{2}}{2L^{2}}\\Bigr)\\,. (D.7)",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:byte-1376310-1377596"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.SS2.p1.3",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1377614,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1377850,
      "raw_sha256": "ce94f3c65cbc12b4e127abbecb136c8db5e9be738679522573282c1105a69555",
      "lf_sha256": "ce94f3c65cbc12b4e127abbecb136c8db5e9be738679522573282c1105a69555",
      "source_text": "These statements follow from the Bakry–Émery criterion; see, for example, [ 3 , Chapters 4 and 5] .",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A4.SS2.p1.3"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.Thmtheorem3",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS2",
      "kind": "source-statement",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1377858,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1381672,
      "raw_sha256": "d9a164e6bb6ede5217412827505b54b20783a43bf931a325fdeeeb03dbde8210",
      "lf_sha256": "d9a164e6bb6ede5217412827505b54b20783a43bf931a325fdeeeb03dbde8210",
      "source_text": "Lemma D.3 (Two-sided covariance bound) . Let \\nu(\\mathrm{d}z)\\propto e^{-W(z)}\\,\\mathrm{d}z with mI\\preceq\\nabla^{2}W(z)\\preceq LI\\,. (D.8) Then L^{-1}I\\preceq\\mathrm{Cov}_{\\nu}(Z)\\preceq m^{-1}I\\,. (D.9)",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A4.Thmtheorem3"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.Thmtheorem3.p1.1",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS2",
      "kind": "substantive-paragraph",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1378306,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1379215,
      "raw_sha256": "b557cc19354e03a6de9cdd9672a2f5947dcc05137e457c8fdee2b7812c50913f",
      "lf_sha256": "b557cc19354e03a6de9cdd9672a2f5947dcc05137e457c8fdee2b7812c50913f",
      "source_text": "Let \\nu(\\mathrm{d}z)\\propto e^{-W(z)}\\,\\mathrm{d}z with",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A4.Thmtheorem3.p1.1"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "A4.E8",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1379216,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1380329,
      "raw_sha256": "a0bad6b7d5b9e39f121adc9d04f7a9cee6edbce00b5a0e3a3a8c7ddf13094d90",
      "lf_sha256": "a0bad6b7d5b9e39f121adc9d04f7a9cee6edbce00b5a0e3a3a8c7ddf13094d90",
      "source_text": "mI\\preceq\\nabla^{2}W(z)\\preceq LI\\,. (D.8)",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A4.E8"
    },
    {
      "region_id": "byte-1379278-1380312",
      "anchor_container": "A4.SS2",
      "kind": "display-equation",
      "disposition": "NODE",
      "reason": "Source region within marginal-Poincare prerequisite/consumer slice.",
      "primary_start_utf8_byte": 1379278,
      "primary_end_utf8_byte_exclusive": 1380312,
      "raw_sha256": "9e4c4374db69d02b9fd2a6e07ec4b5c8724c31d1acce0225e4c7f2fb94588c4c",
      "lf_sha256": "9e4c4374db69d02b9fd2a6e07ec4b5c8724c31d1acce0225e4c7f2fb94588c4c",
