      "source_text": "Let \\bar{x}_{y}\\coloneqq\\mathbb{E}[X\\mid Y=y] and \\Sigma_{y}\\coloneqq\\eta^{-1}\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(X\\mid Y=y) , as in the normalized coordinates of Appendix C . Differentiating the log-density of \\pi_{\\eta}^{Y} gives",
