      "source_text": "\\nabla U_{\\eta}(y)=\\eta^{-1}(y-\\bar{x}_{y})\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\nabla^{2}U_{\\eta}(y)=\\eta^{-1}(I-\\Sigma_{y})\\,. (D.10)",
      "node_id": "pbps57:region:A4.E10"
